世界文化与自然遗产、世界地质公园……素以奇松、怪石、云海、温泉、冬雪“五绝”著称于世。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\":\"原创\",\"homologous\":0,\"hoverText\":\"\",\"img1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20250305/1741162711383032944.jpg?q=75\",\"img2\":\"\",\"img3\":\"\",\"imgRGB\":\"#856553\",\"isTop\":0,\"is_media_account\":0,\"itemId\":\"\",\"itemUrl\":\"\",\"jumpUrl\":\"cntvcbox%3A%2F%2Fapp.cntv.cn%2FsingleVideo%3Fplayid%3D45cfc9152a3540fda8b4c1ca85e87000%26title%3D%25E9%25BB%2584%25E5%25B1%25B1%25E5%25A7%258B%25E4%25BF%25A1%25E6%2596%25B0%25E9%2581%2593%25E6%25B8%2585%25E6%2599%25A8%25E6%2597%25A5%25E5%2587%25BA%26vipFlag%3D0\",\"media_account_id\":\"\",\"mid\":\"\",\"playid\":\"45cfc9152a3540fda8b4c1ca85e87000\",\"price\":\"\",\"recordNumber\":0,\"sc\":\"生活\",\"showStyle\":\"\",\"skinColor\":\"\",\"source\":\"日出 安徽\",\"startTime\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"timeLineDate\":0,\"title\":\"黄山始信新道清晨日出\",\"trackId\":2509787,\"type\":0,\"videoLength\":\"00:00:30\",\"videoSetId\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vsetType\":\"\",\"vtype\":\"1\"},{\"ad\":1,\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"南迦巴瓦峰，地处喜马拉雅山脉、念青唐古拉山脉和横断山脉的交会处，是中国西藏自治区林芝市最高的山，海拔7782米，属于喜马拉雅山脉，位于喜马拉雅山脉最东端。星空直播点位于林芝市索松村，处于海拔3000米的雅鲁藏布大峡谷中，面朝南迦巴瓦，雪山及星空观赏效果极佳。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\":\"原创\",\"homologous\":0,\"hoverText\":\"\",\"img1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20250305/1741158384329085787.jpg?q=75\",\"img2\":\"\",\"img3\":\"\",\"imgRGB\":\"#856553\",\"isTop\":0,\"is_media_account\":0,\"itemId\":\"\",\"itemUrl\":\"\",\"jumpUrl\":\"cntvcbox%3A%2F%2Fapp.cntv.cn%2FsingleVideo%3Fplayid%3D21ecc939088740f2ba7a9fbd4762f926%26title%3D%25E5%258D%2597%25E8%25BF%25A6%25E5%25B7%25B4%25E7%2593%25A6%25E6%2598%259F%25E7%25A9%25BA%26vipFlag%3D0\",\"media_account_id\":\"\",\"mid\":\"\",\"playid\":\"21ecc939088740f2ba7a9fbd4762f926\",\"price\":\"\",\"recordNumber\":0,\"sc\":\"科教\",\"showStyle\":\"\",\"skinColor\":\"\",\"source\":\"南迦巴瓦 星空\",\"startTime\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"timeLineDate\":0,\"title\":\"南迦巴瓦星空\",\"trackId\":2509786,\"type\":0,\"videoLength\":\"00:00:42\",\"videoSetId\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vsetType\":\"\",\"vtype\":\"1\"},{\"ad\":1,\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"“东极岛”是浙江省舟山市普陀区东极镇所辖的所有岛屿的总称，其地理上的正式名称应该是“中街山列岛”。身处大海，四周被东海包围，不仅有浓厚、古朴的渔家特色，更有那美不胜收的风光，它几乎包揽了真正意义上的阳光、碧海、岛礁、海味。东极岛位于中国大陆东端，太阳来得早，但如果是个好天气，那绝美的日出绝对让你大饱眼福。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\":\"原创\",\"homologous\":0,\"hoverText\":\"\",\"img1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20241120/1732093517203042801.jpg?q=75\",\"img2\":\"\",\"img3\":\"\",\"imgRGB\":\"#856553\",\"isTop\":0,\"is_media_account\":0,\"itemId\":\"\",\"itemUrl\":\"\",\"jumpUrl\":\"cntvcbox%3A%2F%2Fapp.cntv.cn%2FsingleVideo%3Fplayid%3D5882d7b684a74d008e46f55ce94b0f88%26title%3D%25E6%2589%2593%25E5%258D%25A1%25E4%25B8%259C%25E6%259E%2581%25E5%25B2%259B%25E6%25B8%2585%25E6%2599%25A8%25E7%25BE%258E%25E6%2599%25AF%26vipFlag%3D0\",\"media_account_id\":\"\",\"mid\":\"\",\"playid\":\"5882d7b684a74d008e46f55ce94b0f88\",\"price\":\"\",\"recordNumber\":0,\"sc\":\"生活\",\"showStyle\":\"\",\"skinColor\":\"\",\"source\":\"舟山 日出\",\"startTime\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"timeLineDate\":0,\"title\":\"打卡东极岛清晨美景\",\"trackId\":2495281,\"type\":0,\"videoLength\":\"00:00:22\",\"videoSetId\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vsetType\":\"\",\"vtype\":\"1\"},{\"ad\":1,\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"双龙桥，坐落于建水古城西5公里处，横跨泸江与塌冲两河交汇之水面上，因两河蜿蜒盘曲如双龙而得盛名；该桥清乾隆年间先建三孔，道光十九年（1839年）续建十四孔与原建三孔首尾相连、雁齿蝉联、合为一体，故又称“十七孔桥”，是我国古桥建筑艺术的佳作。2006年，双龙桥被国务院列为国家重点文物保护单位。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\":\"原创\",\"homologous\":0,\"hoverText\":\"\",\"img1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20240529/1716970122260037146.jpg?q=75\",\"img2\":\"\",\"img3\":\"\",\"imgRGB\":\"#856553\",\"isTop\":0,\"is_media_account\":0,\"itemId\":\"\",\"itemUrl\":\"\",\"jumpUrl\":\"cntvcbox%3A%2F%2Fapp.cntv.cn%2FsingleVideo%3Fplayid%3D03723a7baa1544f0ad73d20a8a485eaa%26title%3D%25E5%259C%25A8%25E5%25BB%25BA%25E6%25B0%25B4%25E5%258F%258C%25E9%25BE%2599%25E6%25A1%25A5%25E6%2585%25A2%25E8%25A7%2582%25E4%25BA%2591%25E6%2599%25AF%26vipFlag%3D0\",\"media_account_id\":\"\",\"mid\":\"\",\"playid\":\"03723a7baa1544f0ad73d20a8a485eaa\",\"price\":\"\",\"recordNumber\":0,\"sc\":\"生活\",\"showStyle\":\"0\",\"skinColor\":\"\",\"source\":\"云南 红河\",\"startTime\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"timeLineDate\":0,\"title\":\"在建水双龙桥慢观云景\",\"trackId\":2471644,\"type\":0,\"videoLength\":\"00:00:15\",\"videoSetId\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vsetType\":\"\",\"vtype\":\"1\"},{\"ad\":1,\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"在安徽黟县的卢村，静享宁静清晨是不可缺少的环节。如果能赶上日出，那会是个非常不错的体验。但如果云层遮蔽了艳阳也不必烦恼，云层舞动将会带给你全新的风景！\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\":\"原创\",\"homologous\":0,\"hoverText\":\"\",\"img1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20240417/1713325434606017205.jpg?q=75\",\"img2\":\"\",\"img3\":\"\",\"imgRGB\":\"#856553\",\"isTop\":0,\"is_media_account\":0,\"itemId\":\"\",\"itemUrl\":\"\",\"jumpUrl\":\"cntvcbox%3A%2F%2Fapp.cntv.cn%2FsingleVideo%3Fplayid%3Dee476926be66444091f7f65f62d2d099%26title%3D%25E5%259C%25A8%25E5%25AE%2589%25E5%25BE%25BD%25E9%25BB%259F%25E5%258E%25BF%25E5%258D%25A2%25E6%259D%2591%2B%25E9%259D%2599%25E8%25B5%258F%25E6%25B8%2585%25E6%2599%25A8%25E4%25BA%2591%25E6%2599%25AF%26vipFlag%3D0\",\"media_account_id\":\"\",\"mid\":\"\",\"playid\":\"ee476926be66444091f7f65f62d2d099\",\"price\":\"\",\"recordNumber\":0,\"sc\":\"生活\",\"showStyle\":\"0\",\"skinColor\":\"\",\"source\":\"黄山市 乡村旅游\",\"startTime\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"timeLineDate\":0,\"title\":\"在安徽黟县卢村 静赏清晨云景\",\"trackId\":2465207,\"type\":0,\"videoLength\":\"00:00:22\",\"videoSetId\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vsetType\":\"\",\"vtype\":\"1\"},{\"ad\":1,\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"姜花浸鱼片是广东顺德创新菜。皖鱼剔除鱼骨，鱼肉切片，撒上姜花，浇入高汤烫熟，鱼肉鲜味与姜花香气交织四溢，满室生香。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\":\"原创\",\"homologous\":0,\"hoverText\":\"\",\"img1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20240415/1713149385182065524.jpg?q=75\",\"img2\":\"\",\"img3\":\"\",\"imgRGB\":\"#856553\",\"isTop\":0,\"is_media_account\":0,\"itemId\":\"\",\"itemUrl\":\"\",\"jumpUrl\":\"cntvcbox%3A%2F%2Fapp.cntv.cn%2FsingleVideo%3Fplayid%3D7b260495a78e469f80aa0393b329fcc0%26title%3D%25E5%25A7%259C%25E8%258A%25B1%25E6%25B5%25B8%25E9%25B1%25BC%25E7%2589%2587%25EF%25BC%259A%25E9%25B2%259C%25E5%2591%25B3%25E9%25A6%2599%25E6%25B0%2594%2B%25E4%25BA%25A4%25E7%25BB%2587%25E5%259B%259B%25E6%25BA%25A2%26vipFlag%3D0\",\"media_account_id\":\"\",\"mid\":\"\",\"playid\":\"7b260495a78e469f80aa0393b329fcc0\",\"price\":\"\",\"recordNumber\":0,\"sc\":\"生活\",\"showStyle\":\"0\",\"skinColor\":\"\",\"source\":\"顺德 美食\",\"startTime\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"timeLineDate\":0,\"title\":\"姜花浸鱼片：鲜味香气 交织四溢\",\"trackId\":2464849,\"type\":0,\"videoLength\":\"00:01:00\",\"videoSetId\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vsetType\":\"\",\"vtype\":\"1\"},{\"ad\":1,\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"舂陵村位于湖北枣阳吴店镇，因刘秀点将起兵而闻名。近年来，舂陵村坚持规划引领，加强环境整治，彰显文化特色，依托自然风光、产业优势，找寻文化基因，讲好文创故事，实现文旅融合发展。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\":\"原创\",\"homologous\":0,\"hoverText\":\"\",\"img1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20240412/1712908573470018872.jpg?q=75\",\"img2\":\"\",\"img3\":\"\",\"imgRGB\":\"#856553\",\"isTop\":0,\"is_media_account\":0,\"itemId\":\"\",\"itemUrl\":\"\",\"jumpUrl\":\"cntvcbox%3A%2F%2Fapp.cntv.cn%2FsingleVideo%3Fplayid%3D9d8b8f0b50ff464cae13aab2d1e220d8%26title%3D%25E8%2588%2582%25E9%2599%25B5%25E6%259D%2591%25EF%25BC%259A%25E8%25BF%259C%25E8%25BF%2591%25E9%2597%25BB%25E5%2590%258D%25E7%259A%2584%25E6%2597%2585%25E6%25B8%25B8%25E6%259D%2591%26vipFlag%3D0\",\"media_account_id\":\"\",\"mid\":\"\",\"playid\":\"9d8b8f0b50ff464cae13aab2d1e220d8\",\"price\":\"\",\"recordNumber\":0,\"sc\":\"生活\",\"showStyle\":\"1\",\"skinColor\":\"\",\"source\":\"湖北\",\"startTime\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"timeLineDate\":0,\"title\":\"舂陵村：远近闻名的旅游村\",\"trackId\":2464565,\"type\":0,\"videoLength\":\"00:01:00\",\"videoSetId\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vsetType\":\"\",\"vtype\":\"1\"},{\"ad\":1,\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"长沙火宫殿传统小吃是长沙地方风味小吃的龙头和代表，以八大传统小吃为主体，即油炸臭豆腐、姊妹团子、龙脂猪血、三角干子、煮馓子、红烧猪脚、荷兰粉、八宝果饭。八大传统小吃都有独特的制作工艺，别具一格，为市民游客所广泛认同和喜爱，并传承已久。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\":\"原创\",\"homologous\":0,\"hoverText\":\"\",\"img1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20240412/1712908722823053564.jpg?q=75\",\"img2\":\"\",\"img3\":\"\",\"