         <div class=\"text\">\r\n                    <p><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/11/VIDEVMAjOxF1I1JLcF1HWagy261011.shtml\">从话剧舞台到票房女王 马丽的故事远不止于喜剧</a></p>\r\n                    <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/lm/zgdybd/index.shtml\"target=\"_blank\">中国电影报道</a></span>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </li>\r\n\r\n            <li>\r\n                <div class=\"img\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/12/VIDEsoPe9FeNcsEa2Vt7w6CO261012.shtml\"><img src=\"//p5.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628562061688972/bot_draw_kd.jpg\" data-echo=\"//p4.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/13/1791855251863_888.jpg\" /></a></div>\r\n                <div class=\"text\">\r\n                    <p><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/12/VIDEsoPe9FeNcsEa2Vt7w6CO261012.shtml\">别人做饭为谋生 他做饭为陪伴 一碗热饭驱散孤独</a></p>\r\n                    <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/lm/kmdj/index.shtml\"target=\"_blank\">开门大吉</a></span>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </li>\r\n\r\n            <li>\r\n                <div class=\"img\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/13/VIDEXEmMD0R4TDRV6D3H66NC261013.shtml\"><img src=\"//p5.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628562061688972/bot_draw_kd.jpg\" data-echo=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/14/1791945202195_815.jpg\" /></a></div>\r\n                <div class=\"text\">\r\n                    <p><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/13/VIDEXEmMD0R4TDRV6D3H66NC261013.shtml\">这套“专属工具包” 让福建海岛古人实现海鲜自由</a></p>\r\n                    <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/lm/xgzg/index.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">寻古中国</a></span>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </li>\r\n\r\n            <li>\r\n                <div class=\"img\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/11/VIDEjJLoCuj4vmgNOcGGMNRG261011.shtml\"><img src=\"//p5.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628562061688972/bot_draw_kd.jpg\" data-echo=\"//p4.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/pa