Name\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1707022330297,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1707022330297,\"seqStrId\":\"1707022330297\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"岁首时节，是时候龙重登场了！\",\"vbrief\":\"今日立春，岁首时节，万物更生！新的一个轮回已开启，#是时候龙重登场了# ！祝福所有龙的传人，新的一年“龙”光焕发，笑不“龙”嘴，万事兴“龙”，好运longlonglong~\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":45,\"vid\":\"b65c7279af3a4dcf956d6c5fd8a7de4c\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2024/02/04/VIDEvVxmqzx3BZfkC1K7JnGn240204.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEkShmMLKLrkJMHVJyySbT240202\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"dc87e54358384ec6b9f191f6043d77fb\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20240202/1706853444247079611.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20240202/1706853448086096081.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"动物园,昆明\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1706853450484,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1706853450484,\"seqStrId\":\"1706853450484\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"进来抄作业！这可能才是动物园该有的样子\",\"vbrief\":\"昆明动物园“猫猴共处”事件引发人们对动物园管理问题的思考。不用表演，不用迎合，安全、健康，得到足够的尊重。一个科学有爱动物园是什么样？南京红山动物园、西宁野生动物园、北京动物园……这些优秀的动物园都有哪些共同的特点？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":242,\"vid\":\"07a422191baa4332a383d80474741040\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2024/02/02/VIDEkShmMLKLrkJMHVJyySbT240202.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEoniRSGh1P0E9hTlvDQRh240111\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"d594f48495b446e694fa97f894741ab9\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20240111/1704941890555038299.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20240111/1704941896809091221.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"繁花,哈尔滨,冻梨,文旅\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1704941936405,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1704941936405,\"seqStrId\":\"1704941936405\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"土豆是土豆 冻梨是冻梨……用《繁花》的方式打开“尔滨”\",\"vbrief\":\"也许，马迭尔会过期，老面包会过期，连冬天都会过期，但尔滨知道，在文旅这件事上，用心是不会过期的……2024 年初的东北，霓虹养眼，冰灯如海，尔滨在自己的主场季迎来了文旅的春天。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":229,\"vid\":\"e60fcfc6e4194a619326a67a605ad1b8\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2024/01/11/VIDEoniRSGh1P0E9hTlvDQRh240111.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEkvhyPikXgR6IpH0mHGQw231227\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c46d25cd028d40c4891ad2f9526f4e6a\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20231226/1703577810424004295.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20231226/1703577816759041694.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"评论区,2023,记忆\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1703635200000,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1703635200003,\"seqStrId\":\"1703635200003\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"评论区变成开心旮旯 2023年心头一暖的“小雀跃”时刻\",\"vbrief\":\"打开书包发现提前准备的雨伞、开会时一抬头看到的小彩虹、走过路口突然闻到的桂花香，随便糊弄做的饭意外的好吃……那些细碎疗愈的生活日常，当下可能毫无感知，当我们悉心将稍纵即逝的瞬间记忆整合，于是，生活便有了意义。还有4天，2023 年就要结束了。我们的评论区对你可见，来打捞一下这一年，令你心头一暖的“小雀跃”时刻，愿你们平安喜乐，每天都能创造美好的记忆。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":192,\"vid\":\"f0d4e954b0e745fea7edc72b2df0d7c9\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2023/12/27/VIDEkvhyPikXgR6IpH0mHGQw231227.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEsKcXh3ilW6g3KRAG73lc231215\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"16141d8618634b16b0ebf10600ef2f4a\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20231215/1702621684317075090.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20231215/1702621687788001026.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"下雪,路面,冬季\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1702621922151,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1702621922151,\"seqStrId\":\"1702621922151\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"企鹅步 刘能步 ……如何在光滑速冻路面安全行进\",\"vbrief\":\"下雪天最怕的是什么？化雪。如何在（看似）光滑的融雪路上安全行进呢？3分钟拆解视频告诉你。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":193,\"vid\":\"59bbeb3da04e4de6a8bd92891c5f2b4e\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2023/12/15/VIDEsKcXh3ilW6g3KRAG73lc231215.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEb0OAy0MSOL4A7zxmQMoj231202\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c14fed3ebb374fb29e56001afd8ae186\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20231202/1701473895328015091.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20231202/1701473916577063586.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"key