极其稳定的生物：水豚。它是动物界的老好人，任世界如何蹂躏自岿然不动，如夕阳红老干部般“温馨又从容”的荒谬冷静无动于衷气质，成为了现代人的精神图腾。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":237,\"vid\":\"61b24034aee3441aaa9b0bb8ad57bc93\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2023/08/07/VIDERpo043DJDx4oCYeHkpDb230807.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEYOEGBtubRsh1WtkAtR6s230806\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"7b5b0febc9eb4618ba0a432cb740606a\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230806/1691291181645054617.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230806/1691291185463036674.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"粉色,标签,刻板印象\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1691291219327,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1691291219327,\"seqStrId\":\"1691291219327\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"少女粉？猛男粉？别给粉色贴标签了\",\"vbrief\":\"提到粉色，你最先会想到什么？这个地球上最古老的生物颜色，见证了人类一个个历史瞬间，它曾被划为男性的专属，又成为女性的标签。看似简单的颜色，却有着丰富的历史，所幸如今的粉色在不断被定义中，正逐渐打破定义。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":201,\"vid\":\"83f5878256174272b939456ee162b53e\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2023/08/06/VIDEYOEGBtubRsh1WtkAtR6s230806.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDERWVv5UEWfKiNWhxabTcS230802\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"d665161f9e5e42e8b543b50d2258570f\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230802/1690939513217055888.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230802/1690939516034097926.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"暴雨,台风\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1690939602972,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1690939602972,\"seqStrId\":\"1690939602972\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"南方登陆的台风 为何让北方遭遇极端降雨\",\"vbrief\":\"2天下完了以往近2年的雨。为什么千里之外的“杜苏芮”会让北方内陆地区持续暴雨？京津冀罕见大暴雨成因最直观动画解析此次台风“作案”全过程。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":173,\"vid\":\"51648c551b4f4c5aa33803741936dabf\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2023/08/02/VIDERWVv5UEWfKiNWhxabTcS230802.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDExmmbqUmuVLdExhwThDVi230801\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"78d09c8ad3aa4ca3a2d4fd0bcc8ce6c2\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230801/1690845434927013069.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230801/1690845438026053258.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"暴雨,指南,极端天气\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1690845456271,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1690845456271,\"seqStrId\":\"1690845456271\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"这份暴雨避险自救指南请收好！\",\"vbrief\":\"受今年第五号台风“杜苏芮”残余环流北上影响，北方多地出现大范围的极端强降雨，京冀局部地区甚至在两天下完了接近两年的雨。暴雨天出行需要注意哪些事项？遇到危险该如何自救？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":236,\"vid\":\"ef2b72654d914212a37a825741a376bb\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2023/08/01/VIDExmmbqUmuVLdExhwThDVi230801.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allow