876057008369.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230605/1685931871201098025.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国航天,神舟,龙拳,太空生活\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1685933871301,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1685933871301,\"seqStrId\":\"1685933871301\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"呼叫地球人！用《龙拳》打开历次神舟返回名场面\",\"vbrief\":\"太空漫步、交会对接、太空会师、机械臂上与地球合影…用《龙拳》重温“神五”到“神十五”安全返回瞬间，打开中国航天员太空生活高燃时刻。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":138,\"vid\":\"1a5afc4731b340cb9d52555790e99ee6\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2023/06/05/VIDETUGHx74xfV4ZxeFNIwdo230605.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEyOej5eGFXrswmzFadbSy230604\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"2c1b1c38878c4c3fa37b385fa0826c27\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230604/1685838924422072035.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230604/1685838929580082058.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"神舟,天宫,天问,宇航员\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1685838955374,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1685838955374,\"seqStrId\":\"1685838955374\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"中国星辰 | 三句话整明白神舟、天宫、天问的区别\",\"vbrief\":\"神舟是飞船，里面坐着宇航员，长征是火箭，大家靠它送上天，天舟是货船，小哥送货不一般……你还在神舟、天舟、天宫、长征、嫦娥傻傻分不清？3分钟视频带你了解。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":171,\"vid\":\"909a3a34d6b24dfeacfa19a61570ef89\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.