4U2iAggnbsMfzmm230306\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"5f8010fe0a634198bc9c12c66ec124c2\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230306/1678072409638091400.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230306/1678072413363037280.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"甲流,感冒\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1678072436109,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1678072436109,\"seqStrId\":\"1678072436109\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"甲流高峰期该如何应对？这些要点请收藏\",\"vbrief\":\"甲流来势汹汹！流感不是感冒，就像老虎从来不是猫，出现哪些症状要警惕流感并发症？之前家中囤留的新冠抗原试剂可以用来自行检测是否中招了吗？预防流感的关键是什么，现在打疫苗还来得及吗？我们应该怎么做？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":208,\"vid\":\"1da70845204e4246b2fa28f73a43d93a\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2023/03/06/VIDEOMg6B4U2iAggnbsMfzmm230306.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDET0rA3fF6uAK67BLWlxiW230303\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"3e7f838191774e329c6cc14a7e663082\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230303/1677810705911011086.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230303/1677810709244001619.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"熊猫,差距\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1677810725283,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1677810725283,\"seqStrId\":\"1677810725283\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"都是养熊猫 为什么各国差距这么大\",\"vbrief\":\"旅日的“香香”回家