:\"情人节,情侣,吵架\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1676330471332,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1676330471332,\"seqStrId\":\"1676330471332\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"情侣吵架怎样才能“赢”？\",\"vbrief\":\"童话故事中，“王子和公主最后幸福地生活在一起”几乎是标准结局了。然而，现实生活中总免不了争吵和误会。嘴瓢词穷人还怂，年轻情侣们总是陷入这样的困境，吵架当时发挥不好，事后梦想再吵一次。为什么男女吵架总对不上，怎么吵才算真的“赢”？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":224,\"vid\":\"da4a321300c1469b819612b9e2bd00b5\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2023/02/14/VIDEHINCUwXX4c13Y3IFgMRU230214.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEu9G6qwUplkxwrJZDgZyP230211\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"7ba4a62ba7634b63997fe599380ba67d\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230211/1676071880414012171.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230211/1676071885421042177.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"缉毒松鼠,动物界,缉毒劳模\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1676071898988,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1676071898988,\"seqStrId\":\"1676071898988\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"首批缉毒松鼠将上岗 动物界还有哪些缉毒劳模？\",\"vbrief\":\"近日，重庆警方在警犬大队技术指导下，成功培训出中国第一批6只缉毒松鼠，它们即将上岗！此前还没有国家使用过松鼠来缉毒，我们是怎么做出这个选择的呢？新型缉毒、搜爆动物的相关研究早已在世界范围内广泛开展，猜猜“动物缉毒队”成员都有谁？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":176,\"vid\":\"aafc6d480256421b87e1b5b370090522\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2023/02/11/VIDEu9G6qwUplkxwrJZDgZyP230211.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEckElrFeM6sDQr1QAVEs8230205\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"17b08da410724a54a7e84ed50e63fcd8\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230204/1675497711887081200.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230204/1675497715443091310.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"元宵节,灯谜\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1675551600000,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1675551606273,\"seqStrId\":\"1675551606273\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"空间站里闹元宵 “太空灯谜”等你来猜\",\"vbrief\":\"闹元宵，猜灯谜，中国空间站里浪漫满屋，来与神舟十五号航天员乘组一同遨游苍穹吧。瞧！那喵已在，灯火阑珊处……猜灯谜！这些航天灯谜，你能猜对几个，需要摇人吗？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":213,\"vid\":\"6adb0fc7896d48f88b0a225835eddfa4\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2023/02/05/VIDEckElrFeM6sDQr1QAVEs8230205.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE1OZ8ELWzCk0v5p3cJu7E230204\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"62075d805228485dbe69829e07330efe\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230204/1675501702645021740.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230204/1675501711024052118.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"扫黑除恶,社会热点\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1675501712501,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1675501712501,\"seqStrId\":\"1675501712501\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"沉浸式揭秘 从《狂飙》看督导组是如何办案的\",\"vbrief\":\"《狂飙》中一开始就“吓死”官员的指导组是何来头？关联现实中都是什么级别？官员被查问题线索从哪里来？指导组又是如何联合各部门调查取证、联合办案的？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":267,\"vid\":\"b0dd756ffb744959823ae24c3b6a4ece\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2023/02/04/VIDE1OZ8ELWzCk0v5p3cJu7E230204.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEcj8UN1BwnnJaXWNNYm9b230123\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c73ceb9d8fab40bab517a0cf9aabbbce\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230123/1674450656782006443.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230123/1674450661454050879.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"春节,过年,年夜饭,春晚\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1674450662135,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1674450662135,\"seqStrId\":\"1674450662135\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"过年｜ 看看中国人的春节“套餐” \",\"vbrief\":\"过年是迫不及待踏上回家的路程，是家人大大的拥抱，是吃着吃着年夜饭春晚就开始了，是家家户户都贴上喜庆对联……今年，把这个充满年味的年好好记录下来。祝大家新春快乐，万事遂意，平安健康！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":250,\"vid\":\"1228d41a3b0d4ee290618b57910e1869\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2023/01/23/VIDEcj8UN1BwnnJaXWNNYm9b230123.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEay3SUzcHdRUgBKA5s5Ib230122\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"bfdbcec61f9a43c09261bc454a649d52\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230122/1674345675318099593.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230122/1674345678777006369.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"烟花,过年\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1674345742534,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1674345742534,\"seqStrId\":\"1674345742534\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"仪式感那么多 人类为什么偏爱烟花\",\"vbrief\":\"烟花，曾是过年的“标配”，记忆中“年味儿”的气氛担当。神经科学家表示，看到烟花时，大脑的杏仁核会激活，释放多巴胺，这种化学物质能使人快乐。所以，看烟花是谈恋爱的平替。烟花易冷，让我们用镜头保温，祝大家新的一年闪耀祥瑞，生活多彩。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":203,\"vid\":\"aaed4bc81ed84cb69367642d92503311\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2023/01/22/VIDEay3SUzcHdRUgBKA5s5Ib230122.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEtyhGIoA5bHPFrtvmUMui230116\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"43c5bd57ca0443deae0fbda9317bb13c\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230116/1673837673418093782.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20230116/1673837678439027907.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"过年,回家,比划\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1673838174264,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1673838174264,\"seqStrId\":\"1673838174264\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"过年了 我要回家看看\",\"vbrief\":\"在外面是大人，回到家就可以做回小孩。这才是春节回家最正确的打开方式。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":325,\"vid\":\"618d2174795447b0b0fa064c675748b6\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2023/01/16/VIDEtyhGIoA5bHPFrtvmUMui230116.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE06caaqfJW2Tdn7oBhbn5221231\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"5629ab64be0e44e8847373eb0cf1afdb\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221231/1672479325788031495.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221231/1672479332491019784.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"苍穹,圆梦\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1672479361968,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1672479361968,\"seqStrId\":\"1672479361968\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"2022我看到坚韧的力量\",\"vbrief\":\"这一年，我们看到，问天探苍穹、老将圆梦，太空会师，这一年，我们看到，小人物守护世界，逐梦的你将电线变成音符，将烧火棍变成画笔，不普通的梦想闪烁在奔波的卡车里、雪山下的梦幻球场……2022年岁末，原创歌曲《我看到》 愿你的2023，前路浩瀚皆可盼，努力都不被小看。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":237,\"vid\":\"97d30b44384d458ab60cccf8748b992d\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/12/31/VIDE06caaqfJW2Tdn7oBhbn5221231.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEzMRb0TB1rp8nRotF541K221231\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"4b299c09009b43d2b1a8911124a7bc0d\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221231/1672448430889059758.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221231/1672448436169049196.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"奥密克戎,新冠,白肺\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1672448448077,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1672448448077,\"seqStrId\":\"1672448448077\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"奥密克戎七问七答：元旦聚餐旅行会二次感染吗？感染新冠会变“白肺”吗？\",\"vbrief\":\"临近元旦，部分地方新增感染者仍处于快速增长期，国内是否有产生新的变异株？很多患者转阴后，仍然存在咳嗽、嗅觉味觉减退等症状，这属于后遗症吗？假期聚餐旅行会二次感染吗？我们该如何与新冠长期共存?\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":291,\"vid\":\"084a5416db274d00b058215dc477c227\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/12/31/VIDEzMRb0TB1rp8nRotF541K221231.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEPQR9rnq5sZqo3G7OKzFn221218\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"f5f60737445946e6a6c3ee0aaaacbecf\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221218/1671323532489019510.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221218/1671323545183077407.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"防疫,误区,健康\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1671323624177,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1671323624177,\"seqStrId\":\"1671323624177\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"防疫六大误区，千万别“中招”！\",\"vbrief\":\"虽然奥密克戎致病性已大大减弱，病死率接近流感，但今冬疫情流行形势依旧严峻，预计持续三个月左右，每个人都要保护好自己。在使用口罩、药物使用、居家消毒等各个日常防护环节中，容易出现哪些常见的误区？\\n\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":254,\"vid\":\"27e187f6bcdd42abaca859a6eacdefb4\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/12/18/VIDEPQR9rnq5sZqo3G7OKzFn221218.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEkw4vBin5hK1uaE2btn25221210\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c831960ece4948588d74f88b2a988f6a\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221210/1670637169002059215.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221210/1670637173826049365.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"世界杯,内马尔,足球\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1670638139797,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1670638139797,\"seqStrId\":\"1670638139797\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"巴西遗憾出局 为什么受伤的总是内马尔？\",\"vbrief\":\"诸神黄昏又送走了它的一位客人，用一身伤痕换舞者之名。在世界杯上，他总是因伤错过重要比赛，有数据统计，仅首场小组赛，他在上场的79分钟里就被对方侵犯9次。为什么内马尔总是被“针对”？被铲倒后最容易受伤的部位是哪个？足球运动员脚踝受伤的危害有多大？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":182,\"vid\":\"75fbbaa3b21d468fa61a267b2d4d3210\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/12/10/VIDEkw4vBin5hK1uaE2btn25221210.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEE6q2SfJbpbPm8rO5YtrR221206\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"e3ab7281b05645ccb6f86e0138748946\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221206/1670284468883072960.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221206/1670284474159037007.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"足球,世界杯,点球\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1670284477254,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1670284477254,\"seqStrId\":\"1670284477254\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"世界杯上如何最大概率踢进点球\",\"vbrief\":\"小组赛里，梅西C罗都靠点球打开了本届世界杯的进球账户。在淘汰赛阶段，点球大战又会决定很多球队的生死。踢丢点球有多难？在世界杯上踢点球，怎么踢最有可能成为国家英雄？怎么踢又最容易翻车呢？我们总结了过去4届世界杯所有点球录像，经过一番严谨统计，得出了8个没有什么用的结论。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":239,\"vid\":\"65214f9357494b3baa90d5622c4b3c5f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/12/06/VIDEE6q2SfJbpbPm8rO5YtrR221206.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDECOeDmL0msTOuLwk1eehw221120\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"4b713d562b354e1bb83e413fccd65fec\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221120/1668905868886026831.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221120/1668905875126023500.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"世界杯,梅西,罗纳尔多\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1668905890786,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1668905890786,\"seqStrId\":\"1668905890786\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"“梅罗”最后一舞  老兵不死 继续闪耀！\",\"vbrief\":\"还记得梅西C罗世界杯第一粒进球吗？卡塔尔的草皮迎来众神黄昏，很多耳熟能详的名字都将完成他们的谢幕演出，世界杯是他们荣誉书上的最后一个拼图。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":171,\"vid\":\"df368fb5bcdb40ac94a03c4e1c7f2d11\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/11/20/VIDECOeDmL0msTOuLwk1eehw221120.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE2lDzp7ykOjbAvkxsEXmj221119\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"4bc5aed328c84d09adb0a0458581fd85\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221119/1668813899056007642.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221119/1668813902905023122.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"厕所革命,历史\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1668813940412,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1668813940412,\"seqStrId\":\"1668813940412\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"中国厕所“粪斗史” 从随处解决到厕所文明\",\"vbrief\":\"俗话说，肥水不流外人田，5000年来，中国人是如何处理粪便的？ 中国的公厕是如何从原来的脏乱差变得干净整洁的？这是一条有味道的视频，请谨慎食用，哦不，观看！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":274,\"vid\":\"1371b92793b44527a0111634f5d75e41\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/11/19/VIDE2lDzp7ykOjbAvkxsEXmj221119.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEZWYVwcUNgnv1xYJxJ149221114\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"f796e1c843174eac9c8dffc935e0cb27\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221114/1668386259380025120.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221114/1668386264179061941.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"糖尿病,健康,胰岛素\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1668386312246,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1668386312246,\"seqStrId\":\"1668386312246\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"“甜蜜爆表”！年纪轻轻怎么就患上糖尿病？\",\"vbrief\":\"11月14日是世界防治糖尿病日，数据显示，我国已成为世界第一糖尿病人口大国，且患病人群持续年轻化，甚至蔓延到儿童群体，“小糖人”越来越多。这其中，肥胖是2型糖尿病的一大诱因，这是一种与生活方式最为密切的慢性疾病，而我国有近三成儿童青少年超重或肥胖。吃油炸辛辣、喝奶茶饮料，再加上久坐不动……身体里的血糖是如何失控的？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":207,\"vid\":\"07d9a0c919d7490789adb9b46b385d3f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/11/14/VIDEZWYVwcUNgnv1xYJxJ149221114.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDElltikKUNTweRzbnCrKy7221112\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"abf306fa8b2f4ebf8db8c9cf628b9916\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221112/1668209146501097863.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221112/1668209149449048910.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"消防员,消防日\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1668209162571,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1668209162571,\"seqStrId\":\"1668209162571\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"可爱又伟大 消防员超级英雄行为图鉴\",\"vbrief\":\"他们可可爱爱，深受人类幼崽们的喜爱，一旦发生危险，就会义无反顾地带头冲锋。漫长岁月里，逐渐成为了人类最坚实的靠山。119全国消防日，向消防逆行者们致以最崇高的敬意！愿每次出征，你们都平安归来。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":162,\"vid\":\"0596a79d8e474065b89746ae71000550\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/11/12/VIDElltikKUNTweRzbnCrKy7221112.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE69iZKpSpKxSB2Twss2kV221031\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"b598ac3b34964df69d74c6b1f9b9227c\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221031/1667184666135081795.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221031/1667184671747072782.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"梦天实验舱,航空航天,发射\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1667184679760,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1667184679760,\"seqStrId\":\"1667184679760\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"飞天圆梦丨66秒看“梦天实验舱”的新名片\",\"vbrief\":\"“梦天”出征！中国空间站即将形成三舱“T”字基本构型，完成中国空间站的在轨建造；同时，随着梦天实验舱的在轨运行，我国的国家太空实验室也将真正建成。“星空浩瀚无比，探索永无止境！”，一张崭新名片，请查收！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":67,\"vid\":\"84486925298343d1af6aabe3141954d7\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/10/31/VIDE69iZKpSpKxSB2Twss2kV221031.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEEEEs1Kosc8yYQf4hbYIj221027\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"49664945ec5b4ea5b19f244f3e9df2c5\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221027/1666833057526041115.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221027/1666833062249026548.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"国际熊猫日,大熊猫,动物\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1666843200000,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1666843200006,\"seqStrId\":\"1666843200006\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"熊猫终极治愈行为大赏 谁能拒绝圆咕隆咚的大猫猫\",\"vbrief\":\"可爱的国宝仅推给可爱有趣的你！国际熊猫日，一起来吸猫！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":150,\"vid\":\"c1ce1c6af73d4f9d9f84b2935bd417fe\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/10/27/VIDEEEEs1Kosc8yYQf4hbYIj221027.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE6tGg4cIEpRdexYJLvyW6221025\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"5061ada8c32f443581d9e253a720f72c\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221025/1666653272650077354.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221025/1666653276336009837.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"抗美援朝,志愿军,长津湖\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1666653281340,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1666653281340,\"seqStrId\":\"1666653281340\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"“耳朵鼻子一碰就掉” -40℃极端低温 志愿军战士是如何扛过朝鲜寒冬的\",\"vbrief\":\"1950年的长津湖为什么这么冷？ 赴朝作战的中国人民志愿军都经历了什么？没有厚冬衣这些志愿军战士又是如何扛过-40℃的极端低温的？抗美援朝纪念日，缅怀先烈，不忘过去，向最可爱的英雄们致敬！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":301,\"vid\":\"43191d00e2904d06b99145d07e844811\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/10/25/VIDE6tGg4cIEpRdexYJLvyW6221025.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEDjKL6WofJYnzmMwRMWsN221015\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"bf3c243305d543839605f5dc1f806799\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221015/1665788773453057747.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20221015/1665788777433086101.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"航天员,杨利伟,太空\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1665788792999,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1665788792999,\"seqStrId\":\"1665788792999\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"2分钟动画回顾中国航天员圆梦太空19周年\",\"vbrief\":\"19年前的今天，中国自行研制的“神舟五号”载人飞船在酒泉发射成功，杨利伟成为第一位造访太空的中国公民。今年年底，将有6名航天员共同在中国空间站里在轨驻留。从2003到2022，星辰大海不断刷新“中国高度”，中国载人航天令你印象最深的是哪个瞬间？\",