":\"VIDEboYk8S49tibx3F5WNw3U220907\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"54ec9a6064704891947a38a0b164c86a\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220907/1662505863253084600.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220907/1662505866522043494.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"种菜,水稻,太空\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1662505896295,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1662505896295,\"seqStrId\":\"1662505896295\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"在太空种上几茬水稻，把农场开进太空！\",\"vbrief\":\"中国人的种菜天赋有多强，或者说中国人对“在家种菜”有多执着？“我已出苗，状态良好！”过了满月礼的“植物宇航员”们在太空之家里生长发芽，郁郁葱葱~你知道什么样的种子才能成为“天选之种”进入太空？经过太空旅行的种子又需要经过多少步骤才能摆上我们的餐桌？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":227,\"vid\":\"0a121943a2a34b7e9ea834ba60f19f30\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/09/07/VIDEboYk8S49tibx3F5WNw3U220907.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE8rx4GrO41MkaQPjleyn5220829\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c3c0c6dc63ef40e8bd47268f0ad45584\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220829/1661730937758056993.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220829/1661730942233055526.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"开学,作业,知识\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1661730944938,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1661730944938,\"seqStrId\":\"1661730944938\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"开学了 扎堆写作业的娃儿们又密集出现了\",\"vbrief\":\"地铁上人来人往，他们站着也要在知识的海洋里徜徉。车站里熙熙攘攘，难挡他们补作业的仓皇。疾驰的摩托车后座儿，也要把作业尽快补上。一个晚上，一支笔，一盏台灯创造人类奇迹！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":85,\"vid\":\"1074f034bda647f886cbceee274dc946\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/08/29/VIDE8rx4GrO41MkaQPjleyn5220829.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE5hV81akA3bwi4m7cxooh220826\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"74123bc5423a45b18523980ccba45a02\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220826/1661475408778088951.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220826/1661475412837042311.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"高温,山火,重庆,干旱\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1661475442490,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1661475442490,\"seqStrId\":\"1661475442490\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"南方高温干旱山火 今年夏天为什么热成这样\",\"vbrief\":\"遭遇45℃极端高温，7天连续突发10余起，重庆山火为何多发又难以扑灭？干旱、山火、湖泊干涸、北极穿短袖……为什么今年这么热？以后还会更热吗？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":222,\"vid\":\"270a9813313a4c1b88f3e39e317e8778\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/08/26/VIDE5hV81akA3bwi4m7cxooh220826.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEoMQdgb8xCyhZxkJgRQMA220824\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"0bae6b652b4446f195ff6088ac00cfbc\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220824/1661325286532000827.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220824/1661325290059009011.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"地图,台湾,民俗\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1661325340615,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1661325340615,\"seqStrId\":\"1661325340615\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"血脉印记，我在台湾省找到了同名家乡\",\"vbrief\":\"成都路、桂林路、杭州路、重庆路……台湾省街道，为什么会以大陆城市命名？除了熟悉的地名，地图里还藏着很多中华美食。地名从来都不是随便取的，背后涵盖的是民俗、历史、文化认同。味觉也不会作弊，美食背后藏着的是乡愁。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":240,\"vid\":\"fcc30375bab041199c75a461922d0bcf\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/08/24/VIDEoMQdgb8xCyhZxkJgRQMA220824.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE4D6PRNGrNMRaejwNAK4O220820\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"678f5475992e4b38b0ca4623481d8313\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220820/1660951293182090165.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220820/1660951297605066161.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"头发,健康,洗头\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1660951314465,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1660951314465,\"seqStrId\":\"1660951314465\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"为什么你的头越洗越油\",\"vbrief\":\"发丝蓬松根根分明不纠缠打结，3天不洗头依然颅顶不塌清爽怡人，是当代人对于洗发水功能的基本要求（奇思妙想）。宇宙尽头到底有没有一款改变油扁塌，集育发护发生发功能为一体的六边形本命洗发水？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":237,\"vid\":\"fa7e721f4b8c4692a4efc936ecc31b30\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/08/20/VIDE4D6PRNGrNMRaejwNAK4O220820.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE50JjxlNL41DUsJy394Zs220817\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"de0117c62c954450a7124b5c8a1cb145\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220817/1660716395000011870.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220817/1660716405040097795.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"社会热点,山洪,自然灾害\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1660716405734,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1660716405734,\"seqStrId\":\"1660716405734\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"山洪暴发有多厉害 为什么无明显降水也会发生山洪\",\"vbrief\":\"一条流水潺潺的砂石小清溪，为什么会瞬间变脸，吞噬游客？突发山洪是如何形成的？暴发有哪些前兆？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":180,\"vid\":\"acd1312dea0645a0817fa39d1c26258e\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/08/17/VIDE50JjxlNL41DUsJy394Zs220817.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDECL1XNzLTgoxIkD45MsH7220815\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"737c967ff0b649fd911725963ff4c72b\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220815/1660541743055039906.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220815/1660541747379097830.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"日本,投降\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1660541749265,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1660541749265,\"seqStrId\":\"1660541749265\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"投降就投降 日本为什么是“无条件”投降\",\"vbrief\":\"1945年8月15日，日本电台播发天皇《终战诏书》，向全世界广播，宣布无条件投降。日本的“无条件投降”是啥意思？历史上是否有 “有条件投降”呢\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":77,\"vid\":\"646d1fe1831748c4b4a601f537fab8c2\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/08/15/VIDECL1XNzLTgoxIkD45MsH7220815.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE5Msei0UTn9h5HLqDkx6k220809\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"7bed3508a5764efd92f1ce8a39b3f0cc\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220809/1660001469238034367.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220809/1660001473803047053.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"网红,大白鲨,物种灭绝\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1660001534630,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1660001534630,\"seqStrId\":\"1660001534630\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"网红烤了一条大白鲨 一条鱼的生死如何影响人类\",\"vbrief\":\"前有长江白鲟灭绝让全世界扼腕叹息，后有网红吞大白鲨触目惊心……据统计，全世界每天有75个物种灭绝，每小时有3个物种灭绝，“此生从未遇见，听闻已是诀别。”一个看似离人类生活很远的物种的灭绝，对于普通人来说究竟意味着什么？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":227,\"vid\":\"c8f99d0f4cc6415a9b2626c1f178526b\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/08/09/VIDE5Msei0UTn9h5HLqDkx6k220809.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDERQ9LtzxuEt7Loyq3P9de220804\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"6fb0a7d5e022478aa16936978253aaa7\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/uploa