:\"\",\"title\":\"活跃在战场上的“雇佣兵”\",\"vbrief\":\"近期，各种形式的西方“雇佣兵”不断博人眼球。这些“雇佣兵”究竟从哪里来，又要到哪里去？“雇佣兵现象”背后又有哪些不为人知的黑历史和不可告人的秘密？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":190,\"vid\":\"6b0968804ff54557b2767df3ac14ace4\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/04/09/VIDEaIp8jRaftXMpsNPnAViT220409.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEs6waJetlx2NYE1xoFxDv220407\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"6b2be5c14cdb488a9df7d0de7b613daf\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220407/1649316866863063594.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220407/1649316871336059509.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"爱国卫生月,细菌战\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1649316976168,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1649316976168,\"seqStrId\":\"1649316976168\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"爱国卫生月的起源 竟为防御美军细菌战\",\"vbrief\":\"中国人是何时养成喝热水习惯的？这要追溯到半个世纪前的“爱国卫生运动”。上世纪的中国，一壶热水，代表了一段中国人与疫病抗争的历史。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":192,\"vid\":\"e07a98561ac240ea9b10785a08952743\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/04/07/VIDEs6waJetlx2NYE1xoFxDv220407.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEJrwgrsB74veSyRdKBsKP220401\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c7150ea167044d6d835c566e0994fe20\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220401/1648797732189086542.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220401/1648797740847098947.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"毒株XE,奥密克戎,新冠病毒,英国\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1648797758645,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1648797758645,\"seqStrId\":\"1648797758645\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"英国发现新毒株XE：两种奥密克戎重组而成 传播速度快10%\",\"vbrief\":\"3月28日，英国卫生安全局证实已监测到一种新的新冠病毒变异毒株，名为XE。分析表明，XE是奥密克戎BA.1和BA.2变异株重组后的新变种，传播速度更快，这意味着什么，它在未来会成为流行毒株吗？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":81,\"vid\":\"81904530c5c345e6b5211cfe502018e7\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/04/01/VIDEJrwgrsB74veSyRdKBsKP220401.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE1eAv4M26Ac5uMXa0gg8B220320\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"123d9249e9424026a081f4d8b99c5c0e\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220320/1647731551772086127.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220320/1647731557313042393.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"福岛核电站,日本,地震\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1647731582629,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1647731582629,\"seqStrId\":\"1647731582629\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"日本又地震了 福岛核电站还会泄漏吗\",\"vbrief\":\"时隔11年，福岛附近再次发生大地震，两次地震究竟有什么关系？地震发生后，日首相称各地核电站并未发现异常，情况属实吗？如果再次发生核泄漏，将导致哪些影响和更可怕的次生灾害？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":135,\"vid\":\"b6dffb33c0b54fe09951f64ca105d652\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/03/20/VIDE1eAv4M26Ac5uMXa0gg8B220320.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEQyZuNPrJ13c4hwkvrsEk220319\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"f214feb7b0504343a9e54e3ae2f38c22\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220319/1647676133118023356.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220319/1647676136339032931.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"美国,实验室\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1647676140202,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1647676140202,\"seqStrId\":\"1647676140202\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"美国遍布全球的336个生物实验室到底在研究啥\",\"vbrief\":\"蝙蝠冠状病毒实验、测试炭疽杆菌武器、把乌克兰士兵当作实验室豚鼠……俄军在乌克兰找到美军进行生物实验研究的关键证据后，真相逐渐浮出水面……无论事实如何，某些美国不愿回答的问题，正在被事实“抢答”。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":292,\"vid\":\"4a33633904464987b6c464a6dc25f85a\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/03/19/VIDEQyZuNPrJ13c4hwkvrsEk220319.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEzNqhBx48u1VNwCCAhTtN220301\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"a205f6f6bf3943daae45eaa018e3bc8e\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220301/1646116441736033637.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220301/1646116446438000977.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"SWIFT,银行\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1646116454848,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1646116454848,\"seqStrId\":\"1646116454848\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"“金融核弹”SWIFT制裁威力有多大\",\"vbrief\":\"现代战争中，最可怕当数按下核按钮，而“大杀器”SWIFT则是公认的“金融核弹”。该如何看待SWIFT系统这张“牌”？西方这一措施会对俄经济造成哪些影响？这一金融打击手法又会给世界经济带来哪些余波？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":243,\"vid\":\"0ec44d558ace45a3b9f15c619f7d8025\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/03/01/VIDEzNqhBx48u1VNwCCAhTtN220301.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEZhkaygKoeHsDmLq9ZChk220218\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"6944bebff6e54f0e8225b156588537ae\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220218/1645139230627061448.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220218/1645139237008056186.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"詹天佑,京张高铁,谷爱凌,冬奥会,学霸\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1645139240130,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1645139240130,\"seqStrId\":\"1645139240130\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"从詹天佑到谷爱凌 跨越百年的中国式骄傲\",\"vbrief\":\"100多年前，詹天佑们学成归来，自主修筑中国第一条铁路京张高铁；100多年后，中国代表团运动员谷爱凌在冬奥会上突破极限书写青春传奇。两个不同时期的学霸，他们身上有哪些相似之处？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":199,\"vid\":\"aa7648b91c404f0cb2068d7bbe011df2\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/02/18/VIDEZhkaygKoeHsDmLq9ZChk220218.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDErLw3Cu0XCOoGHQTkjSxI220217\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"2b6cab289af242a1acadb6719e0e93a3\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220217/1645077183104049462.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220217/1645077190808046834.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"冬奥,拼搏,高燃混剪,中国队,徐梦桃,武大靖,谷爱凌,苏翊鸣,齐广璞,任子威\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1645077207950,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1645077207950,\"seqStrId\":\"1645077207950\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"中国式拼搏：中国冬奥军团热血高燃混剪\",\"vbrief\":\"徐梦桃、齐广璞的锲而不舍，苏翊鸣、谷爱凌的顶峰相见，武大靖、任子威的绝不认怂……北京冬奥会激战犹酣，拼尽全力就是最棒的，你永远可以相信中国队。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":122,\"vid\":\"c10cb88c48a5446e936237646a103d16\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/02/17/VIDErLw3Cu0XCOoGHQTkjSxI220217.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDELS44dWCrt3fc6kMMg4xz220215\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"61defa861989469ebc1c931c14ed03e1\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220215/1644893194031063100.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220215/1644893197640089042.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"雪容融,元宵节\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1644893238382,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1644893238382,\"seqStrId\":\"1644893238382\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"元宵节就是要看雪容融 谁会拒绝会wink和叉腰的小灯笼\",\"vbrief\":\"雪是它的姓，红是它的命。除了冰墩墩，我们雪容融也要有排面！雪后满大街都是雪容融，元宵节大家出来看灯啊~~\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":114,\"vid\":\"1dd7a806bfff4e11baeeb5219828d1e9\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/02/15/VIDELS44dWCrt3fc6kMMg4xz220215.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDECntTzTqq7N7CpY7vQOc3220210\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"41cc82991a9543d68dd7e6b7c93bcb39\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220210/1644468919577027863.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220210/1644468924370040943.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"花滑,冬奥会,羽生结弦\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1644468945883,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1644468945883,\"seqStrId\":\"1644468945883\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"花样滑冰的音乐有多重要 羽生结弦的BGM是怎么选的\",\"vbrief\":\"你知道吗？最初的花滑比赛是没有音乐的，当有了氛围感十足的音乐搭配后，花滑变成了一项集技术感与观赏性于一体的冰上旋转运动。那么，花滑什么音乐都能滑吗，羽生结弦的音乐是怎么选的，周杰伦为啥成为国外选手心头好？陈露的《末代皇帝》、金博洋的《卧虎藏龙》，当花滑遇上流行乐与中国风是一种怎样的体验？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":237,\"vid\":\"3f0bb5c728a043c0ac3f71c0d59adbb2\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/02/10/VIDECntTzTqq7N7CpY7vQOc3220210.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE5fsPFS04hNVBgRkNVtKR220208\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"2df7d42d74344e90b728d8cce27ef686\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220208/1644314645240072532.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220208/1644314648473005544.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"冬奥会,冰墩墩,文化输出\",\"labelId\":\"1