看到的是赛场角力 我却只能看到多人扫地\",\"vbrief\":\"没有人不知道冰壶，但少有人看得懂冰壶，冬奥会场次最多的比赛，必须懂起来！选手们为什么大喊大叫？不停“擦地”的背后，到底隐藏着什么玄机？如何优雅的观看冰壶比赛，掌握这些知识，震撼朋友一整年。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":222,\"vid\":\"4386c2f88b1d44d098c9a82e0945af46\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/02/01/VIDEyGK3pcrhx5q75eEz0TOV220201.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE6TvdSYQQ8In94bsp1C6M220131\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"f7814fbfe05b4bdcb126848cd5ea0c34\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220131/1643594400657042706.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220131/1643594404503008129.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"老虎,出道\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1643594476063,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1643594476063,\"seqStrId\":\"1643594476063\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"原来老虎可以这样分辨 虎团组团出道你会选谁做idol\",\"vbrief\":\"《武松打虎》的老虎pk西游记里的虎力大仙谁更厉害？《罗小黑战记》里的府先生又是哪个品种？老虎究竟应该怎么区分？谁的颜值更高、哪种战斗力更强？虎年说虎，看看老虎团战斗力萌力值排行榜。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":294,\"vid\":\"4815b7bc86a8439c83984fb2da7ad2aa\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/01/31/VIDE6TvdSYQQ8In94bsp1C6M220131.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDExWlx61IHqpYjLE5HAkEC220129\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"0e44bb6ab12a45fea64763306cd476c3\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220129/1643413666648019105.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220129/1643413671692005253.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"谷爱凌,羽生结弦,冬奥会\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1643413677451,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1643413677451,\"seqStrId\":\"1643413677451\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"别只知道谷爱凌羽生结弦了 普通人如何快速看懂冬奥会\",\"vbrief\":\"冬奥会项目拢共分几种？冰上玩的，雪上玩的，车上玩的。哪个项目最“年轻”，哪个又最“刺激”？哪个项目神似《林海雪原》抗联战士的行进方式？哪个又是虎年最配冬奥项目？今日冬奥知识分享，观赛姿势get！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":161,\"vid\":\"4800835505254680991d2930e59543af\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/01/29/VIDExWlx61IHqpYjLE5HAkEC220129.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEiUsjmyDf5EqV62Xz3byg220128\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"57cd928a339e4e6483df3634ec6ba633\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220128/1643339794223051823.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220128/1643339799104044554.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"星球大战,星链卫星\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1643339877967,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1643339877967,\"seqStrId\":\"1643339877967\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"新版星球大战计划？威胁中国空间站的星链卫星到底要干嘛\",\"vbrief\":\"两次接近中国空间站，对中国航天员生命安全构成威胁，美国“星链”卫星要做什么？发射4万颗卫星圈地太空，把太空当自家后花园，揭秘美国“星链计划”背后的军事企图，从“阿波罗”到“阿尔忒弥斯”再到成立太空军，美国又是如何积极布局“太空战”的？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":230,\"vid\":\"7f70f273867145ed8be38933dd570977\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/01/28/VIDEiUsjmyDf5EqV62Xz3byg220128.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEYoJjC3TIlrVzxNOLJu18220125\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"65af39afa02a4110bc50169f6d2bdc68\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220125/1643080611911078546.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220125/1643080615140014553.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"东北话,方言,武大靖,刘伯明\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1643080912001,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1643080912001,\"seqStrId\":\"1643080912001\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"从乒乓球到短道速滑再到中国空间站 宇宙的尽头是东北话\",\"vbrief\":\"从疫情病房的二人转，到日漫里出现的中配版，从东北鹦鹉口中的“你嘎哈啊”到刘伯明太空出舱的十级东北话评语“老亮了”……作为一种神秘的东方力量，东北话不仅实现了跨物种传播，甚至走出了地球……那么，为什么东北话传染性为啥这么强，全世界都在学东北话呢？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":293,\"vid\":\"d65df070afe04f3a8a54738821bfd4b3\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/01/25/VIDEYoJjC3TIlrVzxNOLJu18220125.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEBHyyTFiA75nOrXJv3Kb1220121\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"5398a8fac2584a48b0ec710783582546\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220121/1642757020098091299.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220121/1642757024418098029.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"火山,毁灭地球\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1642757039188,\"pv\":\"1.1万\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1642757039188,\"seqStrId\":\"1642757039188\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"超级火山能毁灭地球上所有的生命吗\",\"vbrief\":\"15米海啸、整岛被炸没、约等于1000颗原子弹威力，汤加火山爆发到底有多恐怖？是否会再次爆发？为什么海底火山不会被海水浇灭？沉睡300年富士山岩浆活跃，是否意味着世界各地的活火山都在蠢蠢欲动？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":253,\"vid\":\"8aedaec9cd7b4df3a275de97aa56b4f1\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/01/21/VIDEBHyyTFiA75nOrXJv3Kb1220121.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE8c625g0QXS8z2thbRMLP220114\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"86e1c616689941b5a6b60564551f3b90\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220113/1642042858715048138.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20220113/1642042865278056231.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"冰雪,民间,冬季运动,冬奥\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1642122000000,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1642122004723,\"seqStrId\":\"1642122004723\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"民间冰雪大赛有多热闹 冬季运动的快乐你不懂\",\"vbrief\":\"2022年冬奥会要来了，中国人的冰雪奥林匹克激情被点燃，床单当雪山、热水瓶当冰壶，拖鞋当冰刀，家庭版野生版冰雪项目大赛已经拉开帷幕！幕天席地，纵意所如……看民间高手们解锁冰雪潮趣新玩法，Let the games begin！\\n\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":148,\"vid\":\"953edb840ad945c982eb780860e448c5\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2022/01/14/VIDE8c625g0QXS8z2thbRMLP220114.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEz6yAJWSygPitbP5YKYfx211231\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"6ff6c726c6e649559b79b40f074e5e7d\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211231/1640940720156078846.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211231/1640940727903033863.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"跨年,年终盘点,元旦\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1640940742894,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1640940742894,\"seqStrId\":\"1640940742894\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"人类奇妙跨年史 当代青年为何热衷于跨年\",\"vbrief\":\"新年来临时，前一年的焦虑都被暂时搁下，“跨”越年末的那一秒，仿佛为后一年注入新的活力。人类最早的跨年活动是什么时候开始的？世界各地奇幻的跨年形式都有哪些？吃大餐、云许愿、流连忘返各种跨年晚会……后疫情时代，一个人又该如何优雅跨年？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":249,\"vid\":\"741ac6bdc32f4118bc580b488dffce8d\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/12/31/VIDEz6yAJWSygPitbP5YKYfx211231.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEsqrjXQNvNR4NJgZWObh2211224\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"9797a125cedc49738187de18d5a6aa7c\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211224/1640342309701065476.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211224/1640342318066025085.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"外交天团,硬核,名场面,大国风范\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1640342324725,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1640342324725,\"seqStrId\":\"1640342324725\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"火力全开！2021外交天团硬核输出名场面\",\"vbrief\":\"“美国没有资格在中国的面前说，你们从实力的地位出发同中国谈话。”、“日本官员称核废水喝了没事，那请他喝了再说！”、“自己得了病，还要让别人吃药。”、“外国政客的拙劣表演，只不过是中国统一进程中的几道杂音。”一句句掷地有声的回应，是不卑不亢的大国风范！160秒看外交天团如何花式回怼。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":155,\"vid\":\"c159f46f73eb4f10b7941a8da9fb8851\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/12/24/VIDEsqrjXQNvNR4NJgZWObh2211224.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEOEooCjSK2eKFY1AC7UAO211224\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"ae7d1261963d48be9db9f7f309dc5a89\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211224/1640332471865009925.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211224/1640332477689011522.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"火箭,长征\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1640332485654,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1640332485654,\"seqStrId\":\"1640332485654\",\"size\":\"9:16\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"我国火箭首次完成“一箭双主星”发射\",\"vbrief\":\"12月23日，我国长征七号改运载火箭首次实现“一箭双主星”发射，发射的两颗卫星总重量超过6吨。专家表示，以前“一箭多星”都是一颗主星搭载很多小卫星，而此次这两颗卫星都是主星，都比较大。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":19,\"vid\":\"9e4cc097f36d4725ac38c71fa779505a\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/12/24/VIDEOEooCjSK2eKFY1AC7UAO211224.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEYI9TRVSs0D4ZU9FJGFP0211223\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"d3e858b81a9849a38e1cb2dab508137b\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211223/1640214168538037635.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211223/1640214172435037462.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"钱学森,袁隆平\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1640214725136,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1640214725136,\"seqStrId\":\"1640214725136\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"2021年度CP 记住一整年最甜蜜的模样\",\"vbrief\":\"是钱学森、顾方舟、袁隆平那代人“永不过时的爱，只给祖国”的相濡以沫？是“不远万里，只为见你”的矢志不渝？还是陈延年柳眉“七尺之躯已许国，难再许卿”的意难平......这一年，你最嗑哪一对？这一年，你最想对谁说：是你的陪伴，治愈了我整个2021。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":162,\"vid\":\"6a1360827cce4d338d492370d69a867b\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/12/23/VIDEYI9TRVSs0D4ZU9FJGFP0211223.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEhX5lYPRTiKAElqgJrZCs211222\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"3bdc85cae2374079bf54413eafd397df\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211222/1640144338009010219.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211222/1640144341414038634.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"霸陵,汉文帝,考古\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1640144547958,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1640144547958,\"seqStrId\":\"1640144547958\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"史料也“骗人”？考古专家如何一步步揭开“霸陵之谜”\",\"vbrief\":\"寻找霸陵是近期最热的考古事件，借着地理优势，西安市民已经先一步围观打卡了。霸陵怎么就被错认了近千年？先不说教科书要被推翻修改，对于刚刚把霸陵写入论文的人来说，也是有一点点emo……虽然眼下的阴差阳错让人有些忍俊不禁，但考古工作者们前后花了55年才确定，亿点点细节来戳视频了解吧→\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":231,\"vid\":\"725a5348f8d84168884d83b2fea7d697\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/12/22/VIDEhX5lYPRTiKAElqgJrZCs211222.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEXIz3dR1YG61cZf4aF5Wq211221\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"9d83b4035249445d836ed26beae1fa50\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211221/1640041462431014180.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211221/1640041465762078193.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"冬至,饺子\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1640041494802,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1640041494802,\"seqStrId\":\"1640041494802\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"冬天是一种什么样的味道  如何过冬至才有仪式感\",\"vbrief\":\"冬天是寒风里夹杂的雪花味，是车站旁飘起的烤地瓜香，是北方人“凡是过节就都要吃饺子”的魔咒，是南方人关于“湿冷究竟有多冷”的刺骨记忆。冬天还是《请回答1988》《鬼怪》《情书》的季节，是穿得最多却最想贴近的时光……你记忆里的冬天是什么样子的？什么食物最能代表冬天的味道？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":255,\"vid\":\"c48acad2396644c9b7eef030835e4322\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/12/21/VIDEXIz3dR1YG61cZf4aF5Wq211221.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEl9l0JK0flS6OfW6ZUzGn211215\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"b922b4e064b84572a8ba7a71a525a381\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211215/1639538928838057997.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211215/1639538933618060602.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"滑雪,冰嬉,冰雪运动\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1639548000000,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1639538948911,\"seqStrId\":\"1639538948911\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"燃情冰雪 拼出未来｜人类滑雪起源于中国\",\"vbrief\":\"你知道世界滑雪的起源地么？谁是神秘的钉灵人？古代中国人是如何滑冰的？《甄嬛传》里的“冰嬉”又是一种什么运动？ 又是谁找到了冰雪运动起源于中国的证据？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":293,\"vid\":\"b590c741dee14c4187a0eb84b8ad6cbf\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/12/15/VIDEl9l0JK0flS6OfW6ZUzGn211215.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEL6x4swIxvhD5XiUt8QmV211215\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"58ea486fbee94d77b7daeb3c4da0c6de\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211215/1639537451665062517.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211215/1639537456186006989.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"不雅视频,台湾,政客,网军\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1639537549056,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1639537549056,\"seqStrId\":\"1639537549056\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"台湾美女政客惨遭暴打被逼下跪，是怕不雅视频外泄，你太小看她了！\",\"vbrief\":\"近日，台湾政坛“女神”高嘉瑜遭男友暴打，全身都是伤还被逼下跪。女方哭诉男友手握不雅视频，背后还操纵“网军”发起攻击。该事件连续多日霸占台湾头条，但高嘉瑜学姐蔡英文一直沉默，幕后黑手指向台湾政坛最大毒瘤！高嘉瑜怕的是他？还是她？真相可能是让人感慨。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":198,\"vid\":\"4825201492fe455e9890aed3c3b11b1f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/12/15/VIDEL6x4swIxvhD5XiUt8QmV211215.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEHBuwKv3PjFCjbXTh3eDp211215\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"be98ccd409794aea9ad7be59594457e7\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211215/1639524495848019986.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211215/1639524500999023762.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"疫苗,脊髓灰质炎,糖丸爷爷,顾方舟\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1639524503861,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1639524503861,\"seqStrId\":\"1639524503861\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"真正的疫苗之王 他用一颗糖护佑了中国\",\"vbrief\":\"你是否还记得小时候在医院吃过一颗甜甜的糖丸？那颗圆圆甜甜的糖究竟发挥着什么作用？为什么现在不用再吃了？这颗糖丸的医学名称是脊髓灰质炎减毒活疫苗糖丸。带头研制糖丸疫苗的爷爷，用甜蜜终结了五十年代最严重的传染病。世界强化免疫日，让我们一起怀念糖丸爷爷顾方舟。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":247,\"vid\":\"a1b747a905434d5eaa5dc8c533ae7ad1\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/12/15/VIDEHBuwKv3PjFCjbXTh3eDp211215.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEIWtwJhUY3B0iunQhEW0C211213\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"dc9fab9eb0594f55ac6a827092fa9877\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211213/1639354085597045933.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211213/1639354093557068343.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"南京大屠杀,日本,反人类,侵略者\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1639354095053,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1639354095053,\"seqStrId\":\"1639354095053\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"为什么日本侵略者在南京大屠杀中如此反人类？\",\"vbrief\":\"南京大屠杀是人类史最黑暗的一页。日本士兵在南京大屠杀中到底都做了什么？为什么会如此残忍、灭绝人性？日本是如何“兽化”出没有人性的侵略者的？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":371,\"vid\":\"af39702a013f4639afde9eaa05a46d42\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/12/13/VIDEIWtwJhUY3B0iunQhEW0C211213.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE4C44kQEQ20KaqrESS49l211210\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"95f7b6b3670b4c22a6def439df490442\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211210/1639108394173066996.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211210/1639108398647016068.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"2021年,热词,铭记\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1639108453910,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1639108453910,\"seqStrId\":\"1639108453910\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"一整年值得被铭记的瞬间合集 什么词代表你的2021\",\"vbrief\":\"YYDS、破防、快乐星球、DNA动了……2021年的进度条只剩下最后5%. 这一年里，哪些瞬间跨越时间仍让你记忆犹新？让我们随着这些“年度热词”再来一遍2021吧~\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":255,\"vid\":\"76ffa3933b0943ec8966b3fc99da0ccc\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/12/10/VIDE4C44kQEQ20KaqrESS49l211210.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEcs0jgmJoG0XhBSBrtMGO211207\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"7c2590f5e3654739a66ec8b2ed1770e7\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211207/1638835263577026979.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211207/1638835269761078778.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"吴钊燮,蔡英文\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1638835294882,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1638835294882,\"seqStrId\":\"1638835294882\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"他用袖子帮蔡英文沾水渍，勾结印度挑衅大陆，为何敢这么跳？\",\"vbrief\":\"近年来，蔡英文的亲信吴钊燮跳得特别厉害，他不仅跟美国勾连，还策划设立所谓立陶宛“台湾代表处”；甚至在中印边境冲突后，他公开叫嚣“台印情报合作”。他如何成为蔡英文的YesMan？他在国际舞台上的对华挑衅，背后有哪些算计？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":195,\"vid\":\"50c037ceefb440cd820b6e64c07696c7\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/12/07/VIDEcs0jgmJoG0XhBSBrtMGO211207.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE2nkkpb0fzCXDPGX1Ib5P211203\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"7b80afae746e440ba949f5b82dc04d00\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211203/1638513055178028228.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211203/1638513060153062978.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国红,五星红旗,太空\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1638513145002,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1638513145002,\"seqStrId\":\"1638513145002\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"分享中国红！重温五星红旗在太空高高飘扬\",\"vbrief\":\"还记得吗？去年今日，那一抹鲜艳的中国红闪耀月球。前不久神舟十三号出舱宇航员身上的红黄配色在太空组成了国旗的主色，带着五星红旗在太空创纪录，的的确确是属于中国人的浪漫仪式感呀！“神舟”启航，“嫦娥”问月 、“天问”探火……五星红旗伴着我们的征途，一路走向星辰大海，来重温那颗太空中最亮的“星”！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":162,\"vid\":\"260a09013e334c07bdcee2d58cd7c23c\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/12/03/VIDE2nkkpb0fzCXDPGX1Ib5P211203.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDECm8fMBGnmGXh8stEVX6b211203\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"2b944810088e4095a079289de5b04ee9\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211203/1638488478519046614.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211203/1638488483722056343.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"玲娜贝儿,顶流女明星,迪士尼\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1638488530471,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1638488530471,\"seqStrId\":\"1638488530471\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"出道60天变身顶流女明星 玲娜贝儿凭什么走红\",\"vbrief\":\"新晋国民女鹅、迪士尼断货王、顶流女明星“川沙妲己”，玲娜贝儿（Linabell)是迪士尼达菲家族的第7位好萌友。这只粉狐狸没有作品却能持靓行凶，只会卖萌的粉色毛茸茸凭什么治愈大家？为什么人类对可爱的事物毫无抵抗？如何理解人们对一个无故事卡通形象的期待？今天，又是疯狂迷恋贝儿的一天。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":241,\"vid\":\"47496a6e42254b5d933822c5f15ccd25\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/12/03/VIDECm8fMBGnmGXh8stEVX6b211203.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE9tNv4gvuQEZLQJrxF4rT211202\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"f773e0749ab244d1bf6d4595fcfa9e3f\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211202/1638427494103076299.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211202/1638427499649054075.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"台湾,苏贞昌\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1638427658489,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1638427658489,\"seqStrId\":\"1638427658489\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"苏贞昌为何名列“台独”顽固分子清单第一名？\",\"vbrief\":\"2021年，大陆公布第一批“台独”顽固分子清单，苏贞昌赫然位列第一名。苏贞昌被曝出身于汉奸家族，主动当蔡英文“反中仇中急前锋”，在绝路上蒙眼狂奔。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":198,\"vid\":\"a4ccf8c8365b46d5a72db73d47a5d3be\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/12/02/VIDE9tNv4gvuQEZLQJrxF4rT211202.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE8QACTYgMzC8qKfv0HzQb211130\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"2214d840187c4f4e988c9823a71296d7\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211130/1638253795132061720.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211130/1638253800089074697.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"野猪,狂奔\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1638254050159,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1638254050159,\"seqStrId\":\"1638254050159\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"转角遇见猪 为什么城里总有野猪在狂奔？\",\"vbrief\":\"最近，猖狂的野猪在全国各地轮番上演动作大片：闯奶茶店、上地铁坐车、撒丫子在驾校狂奔、在农田里一顿猛吃，怒刷存在感。城市里怎么会有这么多野猪？野猪如此泛滥，为何还是保护动物？能随意猎杀吗？当野猪忽然的出现，在街角的咖啡店，你要怎么面对它？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":175,\"vid\":\"1ec00112b9ea439ca438ab80e5f17ed9\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/11/30/VIDE8QACTYgMzC8qKfv0HzQb211130.shtml\"},{\"