",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"哀牢山事件更多细节披露 地质勘探有多危险 \",\"vbrief\":\"近日，四名失联地质考察队员在云南哀牢山遇难，有专业能力的人员也会面临失联、乃至遭遇不测，哀牢山究竟是座怎样的山？失温、毒气、缺氧、神秘生物……原始森林有哪些不可抗的危险？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":146,\"vid\":\"9257666e6fbd40489ffe8ba0f40f0ac8\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/11/27/VIDE1NVUOKJCo28veK2znSel211127.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEBs8jdHKdBQgNeESXcuCD211113\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c091ac8b9e804f82964a650ff6d36688\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211113/1636763985039026707.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211113/1636763988541073597.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"缉毒,美国,犯罪\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1636764595310,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1636764595310,\"seqStrId\":\"1636764595310\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"开设官方吸毒室？美国为什么不大力禁毒\",\"vbrief\":\"追求自由的美国，将为瘾君子开办一个合法的吸毒中心，为什么会出现如此魔幻的情况？消灭不了就加入，美国禁毒逻辑是什么？为什么中国的硬核禁毒，美国无法复制？从国家到人民，中国的禁毒决心有多坚定？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":272,\"vid\":\"dfab92f401684287834d13df22f51c79\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/11/13/VIDEBs8jdHKdBQgNeESXcuCD211113.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEhKrdrzQvEnQ8Japy8UI2211109\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"d1d72858b2384848ac986984966aef74\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211109/1636414115619021290.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211109/1636414119520058859.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"消防员,救灾,全国消防日\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1636414153259,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1636414153259,\"seqStrId\":\"1636414153259\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"我的个神呐 为什么消防队员什么都管\",\"vbrief\":\"消防员，最美逆行者，被网友称为最具安全感的“蓝朋友”。他们的身影辗转在城市各个角落，大到救火救灾，小到戒指卡手……只要有他们在，啥都能救！为什么消防员如此“万能”？既然这么忙，他们日常工作又是怎么分配的？119全国消防日，祝我们可爱可敬的超级英雄节日快乐~\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":254,\"vid\":\"b76b0274e8d143d2ba7e206b0ff76b3e\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/11/09/VIDEhKrdrzQvEnQ8Japy8UI2211109.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEDYepzZ6Wh4Pwf2PMYSQf211107\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"4571028341914ffd937b66b294f26aee\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211107/1636289096385084577.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211107/1636289103585026393.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"立冬,极端天气,气候问题\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1636289104496,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1636289104496,\"seqStrId\":\"1636289104496\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"今年冬天会有多冷，2008年南方雪灾会再现吗\",\"vbrief\":\"最强寒潮来袭，全国多地开启下雪模式。2021年是“双拉尼娜年”，这个冬天会被冻哭吗？不少网友联想到2008年南方雪灾。后续会出现更极端天气吗？全球变暖为什么冬天却越来越冷? \",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":151,\"vid\":\"0e13dd5786ee410992765e773883ddde\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/11/07/VIDEDYepzZ6Wh4Pwf2PMYSQf211107.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDERycvEBb42WyhQyZTSGVf211107\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"92fa894a255047c8925753961aca2c6d\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211107/1636288583784041450.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211107/1636288595431081256.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"六中全会,科普,热点论说\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1636288614187,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1636288614187,\"seqStrId\":\"1636288614187\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"100秒了解六中全会\",\"vbrief\":\"11月8日至11日，十九届六中全会将在北京召开。你知道什么是中央全会吗？六中全会一般都研究什么问题？100秒了解一下。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":101,\"vid\":\"1483b8af27ee4c418c5c895fa81e9839\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/11/07/VIDERycvEBb42WyhQyZTSGVf211107.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEMGgTyTN9t1Ix2KfUzZhc211026\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"356d3b91bab84fcbbb0e6b84b7673b00\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211026/1635214817618061054.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211026/1635214823772091984.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"冬奥,冰雪运动\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1635214903001,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1635214903001,\"seqStrId\":\"1635214903001\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"临近冬奥经常踩坑？突破这些易错题你也会是“十级学者”\",\"vbrief\":\"今年过年除了围观航天员在太空吃饺子，还能看什么？2022年北京冬奥会将于虎年大年初四开幕，一场冰雪的盛宴即将上演。要成为一名合格的冬奥会粉丝，必须对冰雪运动有足够的了解，因此……比划猫踏上了闯关之旅！各位也来试试吗？冬奥会倒计时100天前要交卷哦！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":155,\"vid\":\"dfbb69da7cf440a087ef713f865b5754\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/10/26/VIDEMGgTyTN9t1Ix2KfUzZhc211026.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEMZC6lD6jRfCrj2P8bCOG211021\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"3c2b8a9e44914ab187a4ddba890b61c9\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211021/1634794462423094709.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211021/1634794475623045475.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国渔民,反间谍,核潜艇,美军\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1634794479041,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1634794479041,\"seqStrId\":\"1634794479041\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"中国渔民反间谍贡献有多大\",\"vbrief\":\"岛礁、沉船、钻井，渔场甚至龙王……美军核潜艇撞击不明物已经发散出多个版本。值得一提的是，近年来，中国渔民曾多次在海上打捞出各种“硬核海产”，其中不乏境外国家秘密投放的侦察装置。潜艇会不会撞上美国自家投放的间谍装置？中国渔民们双叒叕立功了吗？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":239,\"vid\":\"a90e50a147dc41d486153f07c6650937\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/10/21/VIDEMZC6lD6jRfCrj2P8bCOG211021.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEVGWdvM1vDQLxGDEw1OVS211017\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"52711cf9816e4429b83580c1067d534d\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211017/1634433920129063805.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20211017/1634433926742069188.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"毒品,禁毒,实验室,涉毒艺人\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1634433930471,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1634433930471,\"seqStrId\":\"1634433930471\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"宋冬野后李代沫也被禁演 中国禁毒“法眼”有多强？\",\"vbrief\":\"面对毒品我国从来都是零容忍的态度，前有宋冬野，后有李代沫，涉毒艺人的演出被接连取消。2021年，全国范围内多个国家毒品实验室分中心正式启用，通过小小试管里的污水浓缩液，循线追踪，挖出千里之外的制毒工厂……这不是悬疑侦探小说里的情节，而是科技赋能禁毒的真实案例，5克冰毒投入西湖都能被测出。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":115,\"vid\":\"bc59765d947b498cafa4ed8c8b5ea37a\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/10/17/VIDEVGWdvM1vDQLxGDEw1OVS211017.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEsJropIbnSKCTJUs7CjEo210924\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"05feb661c28047c08ce409a909082162\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210924/1632455805612076403.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210924/1632455812202030368.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"美国,情报机构,好莱坞\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1632455822086,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1632455822086,\"seqStrId\":\"1632455822086\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"起底黑历史 美国情报界五大阴招\",\"vbrief\":\"在很多好莱坞电影里，他们英俊、潇洒、聪明，神通广大；可在现实中，他们撒谎、欺骗、偷窃，无恶不作。策划政变、实施刺杀，虐囚监听，看看劣迹斑斑的美国情报机构是如何在全世界作恶的。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":298,\"vid\":\"2b638e69034349639e69dc6bb8b7f514\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/09/24/VIDEsJropIbnSKCTJUs7CjEo210924.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE1VuF7RTwAkzZky98gWY7210921\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"4d2d03146abf4e27ab208e37168bbba4\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210921/1632181633499058883.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210921/1632181638181092731.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中秋节,月亮,脑洞,西方\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1632181660046,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1632181660046,\"seqStrId\":\"1632181660046\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"中秋节为什么要看月亮 那些地球人的“月球脑洞”\",\"vbrief\":\"当我们对着满月祈团圆，西方对满月却唯恐避之不及，“花好月圆夜”被视为各路妖魔鬼怪出没的时间。在不同文化中，月亮是一种什么存在？狼人吸血鬼出没、外星人纳粹基地……关于月亮都有什么脑洞猜想？中秋节带你看看月亮的“两幅面孔”，聊聊关于月亮的都市传说。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":280,\"vid\":\"cb163c98c11b4dd28c8ce5733ce4619d\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/09/21/VIDE1VuF7RTwAkzZky98gWY7210921.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEKK41ZPFzy0bwHbu6ESQN210920\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"1ae52c64c85d42b6827847072a834a97\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210920/1632123432229031278.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210920/1632123439871034328.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"天舟三号,太空,航天员\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1632123448425,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1632123448425,\"seqStrId\":\"1632123448425\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"神舟十二90天画卷遨游记\",\"vbrief\":\"天舟三号发射，新太空出差3人组即将启航。你知道吗？刚刚归来的3位航天员还无法跟家人欢度中秋，他们要进行长达数周的医疗隔离和疗养，更需要约半年时间来重新回归“地球生活”，但他们用平安归来给全国人民带来了最好的中秋礼物。漫步太空人不老，中国航天接力跑，过去的90天17小时2分钟是新纪录，也是新起点，正如聂海胜所说的，将会有更多中国航天员刷新记录，这航天精神会一直传承下去！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":196,\"vid\":\"6dd266f706384e868cd5acac6713d76f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/09/20/VIDEKK41ZPFzy0bwHbu6ESQN210920.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEJ21N3j6PsF4fjrQrZoji210917\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"a5a1da3905d6426d9bf98119d3b6c5b8\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210917/1631842652965078846.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210917/1631842656371010411.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国航天,东风着陆场,神舟十二号\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1631842707569,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1631842707569,\"seqStrId\":\"1631842707569\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"搜救队准备了21年！直击神舟返航“降落点”突然改变有何玄机？\",\"vbrief\":\"太空出差三人组刚刷新完单次飞行太空驻留纪录，赶回家过中秋途中又要挑战多个“首次”。东风着陆场迎接3位帅哥回家，返程中最难关卡是什么，这跟航天员穿着的航天服颜色有关吗？这次突然启用了“职场新人”东风着陆场有何玄机？有一支队伍却为此已经默默努力21年！你想对三位航天员说什么，请留言！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":249,\"vid\":\"5f6d2ee9452844ff8b660dd616bb0345\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/09/17/VIDEJ21N3j6PsF4fjrQrZoji210917.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEPDrPVyjx4YvwVmFBDUkY210916\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"dfaade78826e4168aa0de4f5808e3e6e\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210916/1631787353750031761.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210916/1631787362553081443.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"航天员,食物\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1631787372306,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1631787372306,\"seqStrId\":\"1631787372306\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"航天员返回地球第一餐吃什么？\",\"vbrief\":\"神舟十二号的3名航天员即将从空间站返回地球家园，吃了3个月太空食品的他们，回家后第一顿会吃些什么呢？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":43,\"vid\":\"3b9b0fa3e798483cb9da2123439a9c2d\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/09/16/VIDEPDrPVyjx4YvwVmFBDUkY210916.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE293ZIDa2jZbXmB4nnBbJ210916\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"cd29f92cbcba467a84cb0143eaa74764\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210916/1631759051276037179.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210916/1631759054312034162.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"航天员,太空\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1631759064120,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1631759064120,\"seqStrId\":\"1631759064120\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"呼叫地球人！重温11名航天员返回名场面\",\"vbrief\":\"“神舟十二号”航天员即将返回，重温“神五”到“神十一”安全返回瞬间。太空漫步、交会对接、太空授课、机械臂上与地球合影…用《龙拳》打开中国航天员太空生活高燃时刻。\\n\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":138,\"vid\":\"358c3f2d35144a49b8985beb27751555\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/09/16/VIDE293ZIDa2jZbXmB4nnBbJ210916.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDETEnNsLTiH9MKCNdKtu4G210902\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"900a761242c744c29066e086fff7b76a\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210902/1630592654506065259.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210902/1630592662351073163.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"日本,战败国,南京大屠杀,侵略\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1630593241251,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1630593241251,\"seqStrId\":\"1630593241251\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"同是战败国 为何只有日本对战争罪行死不悔改\",\"vbrief\":\"在日本，有这样一股势力，他们不仅供奉战犯、否认南京大屠杀，还有计划地将自己打扮成原子弹爆炸的受害者，美化历史。今年东京奥运会期间，广岛市长曾致信要求参与各方进行默哀。如果这事真搞成了，国际社会会不会被“洗脑”认为日本才是二战的受害者？#日本侵华战争花式洗白大法#都有哪些？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":351,\"vid\":\"5b3ce16b08774e8f807cfb2cb602980e\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/09/02/VIDETEnNsLTiH9MKCNdKtu4G210902.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEXdSrLEF53ELBYGdDeKBN210816\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"b5439646aecf47e0ac281cf179269250\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210816/1629104860761074495.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210816/1629104865993095996.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"生化武器,传染病,炭疽病\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1629104893380,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1629104893380,\"seqStrId\":\"1629104893380\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"为什么北京特别报告一例肺炭疽 这种传染病有多可怕\",\"vbrief\":\"什么是炭疽病? 致死率有多高？为什么大家闻之色变？真的是很成熟的生化武器么？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":113,\"vid\":\"6ed11e6c3fed48c18c20f96bed17d2a8\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/08/16/VIDEXdSrLEF53ELBYGdDeKBN210816.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEWpnUzv80KOHeqS8YIUSz210815\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"31b9bfccad78459d988cb08aeb96dc30\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210815/1628998311717012282.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210815/1628998316948078300.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"病毒溯源,美国\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1628998370997,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1628998370997,\"seqStrId\":\"1628998370997\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"病毒溯源 谁在说谎？\",\"vbrief\":\"查天查地就是不能查美国自己，美国关于溯源的表演，最后只能指向一个事实：美国有事要隐瞒。在“制毒”、“泄毒”这件事上，美国有着“辉煌”的历史。从“未卜先知”的疫情演习到军运会反常举动，从伊拉克“洗衣粉事件”到反科学的情报部门溯源，美式栽赃再次重现江湖。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":284,\"vid\":\"26279b8016324348be36b197bedaa9af\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/08/15/VIDEWpnUzv80KOHeqS8YIUSz210815.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEFkOPFXB7UZiLkQpBsRg0210814\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c166029c3e864ea1b4606d71e208e1f0\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210814/1628901024685018702.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210814/1628901034954051406.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"强奸罪,性侵,未成年人\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1628901303345,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1628901303345,\"seqStrId\":\"1628901303345\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"强奸定罪为什么难 遭受性侵害后该怎么做\",\"vbrief\":\"阿里员工被侵害案调查有难度，有什么难度？强奸罪需要什么证据才能定罪？遭遇危险时如何有效保留证据？什么是性同意？没有拒绝算不算同意？法律上如何界定未成年人性侵害？又是如何判处的？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":231,\"vid\":\"21ae75eb522344aa8080d37d2b2b5899\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/08/14/VIDEFkOPFXB7UZiLkQpBsRg0210814.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEKFHmrpxG2xIVD1y1mJyL210808\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"da01dce3a7fc4fb98d230daa72ef751b\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210808/1628430054266005549.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210808/1628430061115062868.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"奥运冠军,比划猫\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1628430253132,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1628430253132,\"seqStrId\":\"1628430253132\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"YYDS！奥运冠军同款比划猫来袭\",\"vbrief\":\"喵星人奥运冠军合集，你见过吗？比划猫演绎中国奥运军团，萌翻全场！~\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":101,\"vid\":\"a77f4dc93fc045d9baa690e94f8f1992\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/08/08/VIDEKFHmrpxG2xIVD1y1mJyL210808.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEshUgiIyIVeeKCDq5swD1210803\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"52e379cf53e64a249a5395389715794f\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210803/1627954147346040218.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210803/1627954151684063319.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"比划,跳水,奥运会\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1627954174777,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1627954174777,\"seqStrId\":\"1627954174777\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"只会看压水花？怎样专业地观看跳水比赛\",\"vbrief\":\"跳水只会看水花，体操只会看落地。普通观众如何看明白跳水比赛得分？除了水花大小，还要看开始动作、助跑、起跳、空中动作和入水动作，两分钟教大家看懂跳水比赛。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":123,\"vid\":\"472892a41ef44a5b90cc44c7670616dd\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/08/03/VIDEshUgiIyIVeeKCDq5swD1210803.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE5nTnWRqes9u83jYGYcBk210731\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"82fdc93e8edd44ec9b3bf84cac5e9745\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210731/1627700835131096559.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210731/1627700841337062057.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"南京,新冠疫情,疫苗,张家界\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1627700924843,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1627700924843,\"seqStrId\":\"1627700924843\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"南京疫情迅速外溢 接种疫苗为何还会被感染？\",\"vbrief\":\"南京首次披露疫情源头，本轮疫情或已形成南京张家界传播双中心，传播链还在延伸，目前再现两处传播聚集点，分别位于江苏扬州和湖南常德。南京疫情为何迅速外溢？14秒就感染，短短10天内就能传五六代，“德尔塔”已成为全球最易传播的新冠病毒变异株，为什么钟南山院士说“过去的密接概念已不适用”? 与此同时，新冠病毒变异总体呈加快趋势，“德尔塔+”、“拉姆达”等变异毒株可能具有更高传染性，我们的疫苗还有用吗？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":126,\"vid\":\"189303c6caed4369a2cfa4bd5fafb728\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/07/31/VIDE5nTnWRqes9u83jYGYcBk210731.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEoa0xrRARdVrRaRNjBTo9210724\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"18eb668904194e6cb35e8fd6e45e0600\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210724/1627085328067031148.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210724/1627085331843059603.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"奥运会,体育,赛事\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1627085420974,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1627085420974,\"seqStrId\":\"1627085420974\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"来了！东京奥运会首金争夺战\",\"vbrief\":\"女子10米气步枪连续第9次成为奥运首金项目，射击项目为什么每次都能后来居上拿下“首金”？这里的“小心机”就是快。10米气步枪有多难？靶心只有针尖大，运动员的瞄准装置里可没有放大镜，纯肉眼操作！所以，射击运动需要极佳的视力吗？假如派出特种兵狙击手VS奥运射击选手，谁更猛？本届奥运会，中国队杨倩和王璐瑶参加该项对决，两名选手均是第一次参加奥运会，姑娘们加油！ \",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":76,\"vid\":\"7ce6649653064e14b69620d93aba44b4\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/07/24/VIDEoa0xrRARdVrRaRNjBTo9210724.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE4JW5mi2CqEGY8oLAZGkS210723\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"808307ac5b9e4c11aa0bc418ac7caf3b\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210723/1627042095411039117.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210723/1627042098770037340.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"台风烟花,河南暴雨\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1627042166536,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1627042166536,\"seqStrId\":\"1627042166536\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"“凶手”来了！台风烟花是如何影响河南暴雨的\",\"vbrief\":\"河南为啥三天下了一整年雨？“主凶”就是台风烟花！这个远在千里的台风是如何远程控制这场暴雨的？超强台风的破坏力有多高？为什么这次影响最大的是内陆城市？台风作恶将被除名，现下，凶手烟花正从幕后走向台前，预计于25日下午到26日凌晨登陆浙江，或成史上7月登陆浙江最强台风！江浙沪请做好防御！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":171,\"vid\":\"cd52f6d2bec742c281b55275e6c6da68\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/07/23/VIDE4JW5mi2CqEGY8oLAZGkS210723.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE4k0YxNfJDPDyFChzZRS4210722\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"b539daa83720412292b2ea0ca8da8aa0\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210722/1626947822160023692.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210722/1626947829402087751.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"河南,暴雨,避险脱困\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1626947833302,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1626947833302,\"seqStrId\":\"1626947833302\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"河南2小时暴雨纪录又被刷新！收好这份避险生存指南\",\"vbrief\":\"7月20日河南全境遭遇特大暴雨，郑州市直接刷新了全球省会级城市小时最大降雨记录。21日新乡降水量又超郑州纪录，暴雨北移，22日河北发出红色预警。接连不断的罕见暴雨袭击多个城市，熟悉的交通工具都变得不再安全，该如何远离“看不见的危险”，成功避险脱困？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":263,\"vid\":\"2a3e2145ed9d4553944dccc6b0f1b2aa\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/07/22/VIDE4k0YxNfJDPDyFChzZRS4210722.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEg8myaZL3pt1ea4UjGIGh210722\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"d010bb64a59840f3906ddd7c70b237f5\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210722/1626939608160036620.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210722/1626939611679015936.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"东京奥运会,福岛,艺术品\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1626939617580,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1626939617580,\"seqStrId\":\"1626939617580\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"东京奥运村众生相 开福岛盲盒围观日韩“暗战” 堪称史上最魔幻\",\"vbrief\":\"7月23日，日本将举行东京奥运会开幕式。然而东京奥运会还没开始，就已经出现了一系列让人匪夷所思的迷惑新闻……\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":151,\"vid\":\"5cbe0b7844ef4be09e6b1ca840441e21\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/07/22/VIDEg8myaZL3pt1ea4UjGIGh210722.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE8a6KDgMRjhq8lu3O2gPn210721\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"fca131ad1d5a4a789d179fc8be74b60a\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210722/1626883229235039431.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210722/1626883237732064178.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"大雨,河南,郑州\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1626880354228,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1626880354228,\"seqStrId\":\"1626880354228\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"一年364天都在抗旱的河南 为啥三天下了一整年雨\",\"vbrief\":\"河南不靠海，为什么成为特大暴雨中心？此次降雨为何如此极端？“台风是幕后黑手”，造成此次暴雨原因之一的台风“烟花”又有多厉害？大暴雨之后，河南人民留下了怎样惊险难忘的回忆？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":195,\"vid\":\"3286e59fb0b847a8ab0bd42d654acd89\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/07/21/VIDE8a6KDgMRjhq8lu3O2gPn210721.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEMbcuebc7urS7RgR7U6iV210718\",\"episodes\":0,\"fc\":\"原创\",\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"4dded209465c48b4b2bd0d35d16afc18\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210718/1626594593491011949.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210718/1626594596934098226.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"滴血认亲,失孤,打拐DNA数据库\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1626594610900,\"pv\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqId\":1626594610900,\"seqStrId\":\"1626594610900\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"《失孤》奇迹可以复制！揭秘现代版“滴血认亲”系统有多靠谱\",\"vbrief\":\"《失孤》原型寻子成功，警方是如何找到郭刚堂儿子的？这背后除了郭刚堂和社会各界的坚持，还得益于公安部的一项大工程：打拐DNA数据库。那么，为什么打拐需要DNA鉴定，这个数据库是如何工作的？收集血样、远程比对，揭秘现代版滴血认亲系统有多靠谱。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":216,\"vid\":\"8a160b1908d747f08227e57fec80b902\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/07/18/VIDEMbcuebc7urS7RgR7U6iV210718.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEXBMHBSMyYXH5by2czbXr210627\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"4f66f130e8cb413f8b29ce4f3eee573d\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210627/1624749865864033422.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210627/1624749870299023652.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"神舟boys,聂海胜,刘伯明,汤洪波,宇航员,vlog\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1624749877550,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1624749877550,\"seqStrId\":\"1624749877550\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"“神舟boys”第一周vlog来啦！周末休息吗？\",\"vbrief\":\"“神舟boys”聂海胜、刘伯明、汤洪波在太空的第一周过的都和咱地球人有啥不同？听说，宇航员的作息制度跟在地面是一样的，工作8小时，睡觉8小时，休闲锻炼吃饭8小时，他们工作起来会“内卷”吗，周末休息吗？说起来三位帅哥刚爆出年龄的时候，大伙都说太大龄了，#聂海胜出征前染黑了白发#，其实这年龄在宇宙出道真不算晚，这其中有什么健康秘诀吗？→\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":202,\"vid\":\"da1fbf329efc471ea2393d7cf60c412e\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/06/27/VIDEXBMHBSMyYXH5by2czbXr210627.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDETXe1vwdXH81zPu6UPmnl210624\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"5f6286c55a77481fa243b0f4559cf4ca\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210624/1624522042554035802.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210624/1624522051184044846.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国航天,载人航天,空间站\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1624522054421,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1624522054421,\"seqStrId\":\"1624522054421\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"中国太空新家住人了！“宇宙天团”聊天记录曝光\",\"vbrief\":\"中国人首次进入自己的空间站，太空里好久没这么热闹了，隔壁的玉兔和祝融可开心坏了，天上小分队一下子就聊嗨了！布置“新家”、用上太空WiFi……这些天，咱们的宇宙天团都聊了啥？这里有份聊天记录请查收！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":266,\"vid\":\"99c33273af4c40e399318e3c57ba28a9\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/06/24/VIDETXe1vwdXH81zPu6UPmnl210624.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEiFyKEdPusCeluCXh9DxO210616\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"02a727cbbd454c7b8cf2131b0c1cb6fd\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210616/1623836639491030247.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210616/1623836647538040915.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"航天员,太空,空间站,生活\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1623836660003,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1623836660003,\"seqStrId\":\"1623836660003\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"中国航天员时隔5年再入太空 3个月空间站生活吃什么\",\"vbrief\":\"“三位帅哥”航天员聂海胜、刘伯明、汤洪波明天就启程了！前些日子“快递小哥”天舟二号可是运了6吨多货上去，在太空拆上160+包裹的快递，会拆到手软吗？这一次飞行3个月，上太空吃什么？请广大胖友们放心，有一种饿叫祖国妈妈觉得你饿，中国空间站食堂不仅食品种类120多种，还准备了折叠桌，加热、冷藏、饮水设备一应俱全，绝对妥妥的，有史为证，不信戳视频吧！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":195,\"vid\":\"f7a5f0d0062f492dafff7d04d75d32b2\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/06/16/VIDEiFyKEdPusCeluCXh9DxO210616.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEfRMVFCEArcPRCptAF1xS210608\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"fd3f77e36a7b4f75b96240b39c8e2a75\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210608/1623121179652032140.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210608/1623121202492008307.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"大象,比划\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1623121203860,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1623121203860,\"seqStrId\":\"1623121203860\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"大象神仙游：一场说走就走的旅行\",\"vbrief\":\"“排排躺！听说今天高考，我们就安静一天吧！”狭路“象”逢、晕头转“象”、全民偶“象”，野生亚洲象徒步彩云之南，暴走500多公里的背后，究竟有着怎样的故事？“象”往的生活又是怎样的呢？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":232,\"vid\":\"b70cc26e11b44b2fa4b2bae1a9e6af3a\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/06/08/VIDEfRMVFCEArcPRCptAF1xS210608.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEUPxAYvK5HfVJuiHS0u9k210606\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c731da2e66b34ae5bef7e94a4b04fe26\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210606/1622947522687024443.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210606/1622947526717002741.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"高考,回忆杀,学生时代\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1622947573070,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1622947573070,\"seqStrId\":\"1622947573070\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"高考回忆杀 为什么我们总是怀念学生时代\",\"vbrief\":\"高考是什么？是少年十八恣意任性的终结？是大学四年自由梦想的起点？是经历者眼前努力翻越的坎儿，或是过来人梦里倍感珍惜的夏天？人生中只有一次的“高考”，中国孩子共同的回忆，你想和高考那年的自己说什么？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":191,\"vid\":\"af4aea0ba22045c3803b9bf1b46fd185\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/06/06/VIDEUPxAYvK5HfVJuiHS0u9k210606.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDERkqudtQCzcHfBeKJ8VBp210602\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"0a4928843057496399a196ef7711ce90\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210602/1622607014832002509.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210602/1622607020036097125.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"亚洲象,云南\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1622607028827,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1622607028827,\"seqStrId\":\"1622607028827\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"15头亚洲象的奇妙之旅：懵懂小象曾喝醉 年轻头象或迷路 无语老象往回走\",\"vbrief\":\"北有“完达山一号”畅游东三省，南有野生亚洲象徒步彩云之南，它们因何北上？如何回家？到底要去哪？云南人又对大象又有多宠？为什么不能劝返它们回家？\\n\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":213,\"vid\":\"858237e350d044ad99dc508e77ec2d3a\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/06/02/VIDERkqudtQCzcHfBeKJ8VBp210602.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE77cJz6nw1tTNdWFBUl5p210530\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"7228afe8a686466e83f9f1bd98b836ce\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210530/1622369235120024201.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210530/1622369239464009050.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"院士,追星,成就\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1622369291221,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1622369291221,\"seqStrId\":\"1622369291221\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"他们才是最该追的星：干惊天动地事，做隐姓埋名人\",\"vbrief\":\"他们似乎离我们很远，在教科书上、在试卷里、在新闻中，到处都是他们的耀眼事迹。他们又如此“平凡”，终生目标只有一个：“中国没有航母，我死不瞑目。”、“我平生就一个想法，让中国人吃饱饭。”、“我只是一个医生，救治病人是我的天职 ”。他们“隐身”在岁月里，却联手保护了你我的世界。我们抵御不了浪潮，但会永远记得灯塔。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":269,\"vid\":\"6fb643e7e842496cb0e07e97e205e7a2\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/05/30/VIDE77cJz6nw1tTNdWFBUl5p210530.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE23NssDiRj5SDF97wvRwk210522\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"ccf44df9b71b44a6a661a91bb7fe814d\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210522/1621640764495071504.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210522/1621640768001055588.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"整容,精灵耳,容貌焦虑\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1621640794717,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1621640794717,\"seqStrId\":\"1621640794717\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"为瘦腿切断神经、为变美整成精灵耳......变美和瘫痪，你选哪个？\",\"vbrief\":\"切断小腿神经，精灵耳整容，容貌焦虑内卷到耳朵？一种疯狂的“瘦小腿”方法引发讨论，有网友做了“小腿神经阻断术”，这是一项损害性手术，不可逆的创伤、潜在的致残风险、可能出现的后遗症、难以维持的效果，容貌焦虑还能严重到什么程度？“瘦即正义”何时停？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":225,\"vid\":\"4b812b38e5f8484091e5fb3a81b3cec1\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/05/22/VIDE23NssDiRj5SDF97wvRwk210522.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEBHwBXlvTdYjUgtNdjz8n210519\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"7c76b49f080f4ec39bd15b19b62c8243\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210519/1621421985604055930.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210519/1621421989661010164.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"疫苗,新冠病毒,印度疫情\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1621422052449,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1621422052449,\"seqStrId\":\"1621422052449\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"印度疫情外溢 新冠疫苗对变种病毒还有效吗？\",\"vbrief\":\"日前安徽、辽宁相继出现本土确诊病例，一个值得注意的细节是，新增确诊病例没有接种新冠疫苗。新一波疫情正在席卷全球，仅5月至今我国陆地、水面、航空口岸均有报告，其中变异病毒占比增加。英国、南非、巴西、印度变异株先后出现，现有疫苗还有效吗？人类与新冠的战役制胜关键是什么？#疫苗犹豫#为什么连钟南山都说，再不打疫苗，你可能会遇到这些“麻烦”？戳视频看权威解答！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":199,\"vid\":\"27752f6821ec4c6595596165540a6311\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/05/19/VIDEBHwBXlvTdYjUgtNdjz8n210519.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE6mMbN3f0OeVHPNY0Qb3m210509\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"e239ccb1c85f4e5f9629f4ab8f7155fb\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210509/1620529678485023971.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210509/1620529683088063762.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国,妈妈,育儿\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1620529696253,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1620529696253,\"seqStrId\":\"1620529696253\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"“鸡娃”盛行的年代  中国妈妈有多焦虑\",\"vbrief\":\"压垮一个成年人，只需要一个“家长群”，彻底压垮一个成年人，只需要一个“鸡娃群”。所谓“鸡娃”，意为家长给孩子打鸡血，挖空心思呕心沥血敦促孩子学习进步。当代父母“鸡娃”日常有多魔幻？“鸡娃”父母的焦虑如何缓解？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":209,\"vid\":\"3dd5210b5d5e48e996a8d82bc217b696\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/05/09/VIDE6mMbN3f0OeVHPNY0Qb3m210509.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEztjmQm7ynQpXw0GggMns210508\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"b2d618e0e4444519bd1658f03732dd45\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210508/1620469811842017748.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210508/1620469829238034553.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"老母亲,带娃\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1620469855746,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1620469855746,\"seqStrId\":\"1620469855746\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"没笑算我输！当代老母亲带娃图鉴\",\"vbrief\":\"闻者伤心见者流泪的当妈生活，身边案例总是过于真实。与其“紧抓严打”，不如“随缘佛系”，才艺随缘、分数看淡，比起“听妈妈的话”，当代妈妈更愿意“听孩子想法”。5月9日母亲节，看不按套路出牌的妈妈能有多欢乐，愿妈妈们放下焦虑，笑颜绽放。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":106,\"vid\":\"477bf997c1a849a485316fc907b7fb38\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/05/08/VIDEztjmQm7ynQpXw0GggMns210508.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEKjY7NAJ3uY9RrKtOwl5y210429\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"5e4679edf6af46b5807daf91237424bd\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210429/1619652363488032919.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210429/1619652367626028002.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国空间站,航天,天和号\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1619653222504,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1619653222504,\"seqStrId\":\"1619653222504\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"走！跟着“天和”去太空建房子 宽敞舒适有WiFi\",\"vbrief\":\"中国空间站“天和”核心舱即将发射，马上我们就在太空拥有一个属于中国的新房子！那么，咱要建个啥户型，天和核心舱是凭啥叫“核心”？听说“新房子”不仅宽敞，还会为每个航天员配置一台平板电脑，有“WiFi”，航天员在空间站里可以打游戏吗？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":166,\"vid\":\"631e14351a444844a1cf1cb05859fc33\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/04/29/VIDEKjY7NAJ3uY9RrKtOwl5y210429.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEh3WxmOOEVG5lT12vdEvT210427\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"a446468cec454542b6310e3bedfa68cd\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210427/1619527809592098183.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210427/1619527817096089478.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"东北虎,完达山1号\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1619527821664,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1619527821664,\"seqStrId\":\"1619527821664\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"闯村东北虎“完达山1号”回忆事发经过：我从哪来 为啥进村\",\"vbrief\":\"宁静的村庄突现野生虎究竟是何原因？半年来频频“下山”究竟为了什么？它为啥会进村、它又为什么不怕人？这只伤了人的东北虎，结局究竟是什么？我们采访了一下“肇事虎”，和您一起走进“大猫”的内心，探寻真相。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":176,\"vid\":\"fb37645b027b4807af732bb49bb42366\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/04/27/VIDEh3WxmOOEVG5lT12vdEvT210427.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDETxKzrIgCqewEgJNnxFbo210425\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"540200872ef24a458c0d268f3e4d8622\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210425/1619315014694083965.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210425/1619315020344078127.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"太空,厕所\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1619315034851,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1619315034851,\"seqStrId\":\"1619315034851\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"太空厕所，怎么从“袋儿装”变“桶装”的？\",\"vbrief\":\"要问宇航员们在太空中遇到最困难的任务是什么，他们心中或许会有个难说出口的答案，那就是上！厕！所！从第一个在航天器中尿裤子的人，到现在可以把尿液转化为饮用水，科学家们真的是煞费苦心！问题来了朋友们：如果把尿液转化为水值2万块，你会拒绝喝吗？\\n\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":84,\"vid\":\"2ee0bc367d1a477dac1a2c5d218ca9d1\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/04/25/VIDETxKzrIgCqewEgJNnxFbo210425.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEW356mjL0xYoBmGyZGbVg210423\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"380e7f432c124437a0ae611a7c4c4254\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210423/1619172810445002114.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210423/1619172816005021970.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国航天日,航天人,名场面,火箭\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1619172818526,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1619172818526,\"seqStrId\":\"1619172818526\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"五十年航天人缩影 看中国航天人有多拼\",\"vbrief\":\"中国第一枚探空火箭是手动吊上去的、中国第一枚导弹发射现场啥样，揭秘中国航天史罕见名场面。跳健美操训练体魄、自创土味科普视频、看看航天人到底有多幽默。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":331,\"vid\":\"c3f8666f50cb4fddb29275659cd4bca9\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/04/23/VIDEW356mjL0xYoBmGyZGbVg210423.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEJSIdamL43TkWx3NQhYzp210416\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"1e5a0ba3e8ab46cf99ab676d0f63c8e5\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210416/1618560205437021201.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210416/1618560211057061381.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"日本,海鲜,新疆番茄\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1618560221261,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1618560221261,\"seqStrId\":\"1618560221261\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"日本别操新疆番茄的心了 还是发愁自己的海鲜怎么卖吧！\",\"vbrief\":\"日本番茄酱大王停止进口新疆番茄，又是熟悉的借口，又是熟悉的套路！这家一年仅购12吨新疆番茄的日企，选择在日美首脑会谈前夕突然表态说“抵制”，是急着给美国“送礼”？说起来，我国已是世界第一大番茄制品出口国，其中近70%出口量都来自新疆，比起咱的番茄，日本还是多想想自己的海鲜怎么卖吧，毕竟美国的身体可诚实的很呢！ \",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":119,\"vid\":\"ec27024153a64a19ac442a3ab27b20c7\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/04/16/VIDEJSIdamL43TkWx3NQhYzp210416.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEzonQLgMaDnwCW3K8qxp0210415\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"b4bbfe34b52d4dbb8a51b837ac119f6f\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210415/1618453358335083809.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210415/1618453366638056634.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"核废水,日本,福岛\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1618453373774,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1618453373774,\"seqStrId\":\"1618453373774\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"请全世界干了这杯核废水？日本为何如此反人类\",\"vbrief\":\"海鲜有毒、物种变异、人类患癌、百万吨核污水入海有多可怕？核废水中放射性物质危害有多大？扩散到各国需要多久？明明能花钱可以处理的事情，非要拉着全世界下水，还大声宣告喝废水没事，要脸吗？赵立坚说请日本官员先喝核废水，海洋不是日本的垃圾桶， 太平洋也不是日本的下水道！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":218,\"vid\":\"b360bca60a1248db8afcb4fc29028a64\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/04/15/VIDEzonQLgMaDnwCW3K8qxp0210415.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEZHAl0mhnQFLO5c2TL7SN210412\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"cf3cae937ec64a5680747e30b969a89c\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210412/1618225208709032391.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210412/1618225212341064958.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"火箭,世界航天日,太空\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1618225433092,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1618225433092,\"seqStrId\":\"1618225433092\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"世界航天日 聊聊历史上那些失败的火箭\",\"vbrief\":\"人类历史上最猛烈的火箭爆炸事故是哪一次？如果火箭发射失败，航天员要怎么逃生？人类为什么要发射火箭，又为何那么热衷于“逃离”地球？世界航天日，聊聊那些失败的火箭发射背后惊心动魄的故事。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":250,\"vid\":\"00ed72bc3d7747a6beb0420baf44eb5a\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/04/12/VIDEZHAl0mhnQFLO5c2TL7SN210412.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE0BiozTEbpgt0fHR7YcTL210330\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"4042c4ac24944be98efe487305908a5e\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210330/1617066660017086182.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210330/1617066664104089260.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"三星堆,黄金面罩,黄金\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1617066997324,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1617066997324,\"seqStrId\":\"1617066997324\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"看了一眼金面罩，你“拜金”了吧？\",\"vbrief\":\"三星堆是不是《庆余年》中的神庙？金面罩是外星人的面膜还是口罩？在古代世界人们沟通并不发达时，为什么各地都在用黄金，只是一个巧合吗？黄金不是稀有金属，也不耐磨耐用，为什么人们还是对黄金情有独钟，甚至引发战争？从三星堆出土的黄金面具，到古代以黄金作为权力象征，到现代人对黄金的迷恋，黄金的历史是如何演变的？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":214,\"vid\":\"a2d0d552c2a845fca7c7b5d558a49ab7\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/03/30/VIDE0BiozTEbpgt0fHR7YcTL210330.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE4aGSjuuVySSVUvCOtIJk210326\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"d85eeeeaa04f4a45bdeea9431754b1ec\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210326/1616744573934098622.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210326/1616744577980062599.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"新疆,棉花,美国,BCI\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1616744632791,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1616744632791,\"seqStrId\":\"1616744632791\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"棉花有话说：我为什么选择了新疆！\",\"vbrief\":\"黑奴采摘VS机械化，昨日华春莹展示的两张美中棉花采摘对比太强烈。有句话说得好，人类无法编造自己完全不熟悉的事物，除非……自己真的干过！近日，一场设计了一年多的阴谋浮出水面，深挖之下，串联这些外企抵制新疆棉花的背后，是一家叫BCI的组织。它有何动机，为何偏偏从棉花来搞事情？小编想说，是……它急了它急了！新疆棉花到底优秀到什么地步？戳视频来打call！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":220,\"vid\":\"8b87e596949046f981f05386805603ee\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/03/26/VIDE4aGSjuuVySSVUvCOtIJk210326.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEb82SdpnKM80SbwoaALYW210321\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"2ba4103082ad4a24af8208d606f15305\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210321/1616284573525025904.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210321/1616284580457008776.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国,睡眠,青年\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1616284619763,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1616284619763,\"seqStrId\":\"1616284619763\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"中国超3亿人存在睡眠障碍 当代青年熬夜真相\",\"vbrief\":\"当代年轻人的四大特征：穷还追星，丑还颜控，胖还贪吃，困还熬夜。“贫穷使我清醒”、“夜宵吃得有点顶”……睡不着的原因究竟是啥？3月21日是世界睡眠日，探讨一下熬夜爆肝的年轻人到底在干啥，人一直不睡觉又会怎样？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":190,\"vid\":\"5fbf58535dd744479268f506993fd14e\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/03/21/VIDEb82SdpnKM80SbwoaALYW210321.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE3sau38FpaTFQTnDKrOEV210320\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"2fc2305436384320bb2450977244053d\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210320/1616219317825069436.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210320/1616219326193003140.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"消费贷,社会热点,贷款\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1616219326948,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1616219326948,\"seqStrId\":\"1616219326948\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"专治各种手头紧？奇葩贷究竟有多坑\",\"vbrief\":\"“彩礼贷”、“美容贷”、“墓地贷”……你听过多少种奇葩贷款？打着各种噱头推消费贷，究竟是银行人性的扭曲，还是道德的沦丧？结婚人数连降7年，为什么年轻人不愿意结婚了，杭州萧山赘婿供不应求……又折射出怎样的社会现实？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":245,\"vid\":\"e8f5e68a0af2497eac342410566b568a\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/03/20/VIDE3sau38FpaTFQTnDKrOEV210320.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDER702wNbSdano4RJ1Wwgh210320\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"70fa57878bad4050a6892472fe3fea88\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210320/1616197256962084987.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210320/1616197264776032014.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"春分,野菜,食材\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1616197381427,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1616197381427,\"seqStrId\":\"1616197381427\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"春日野菜图鉴 收下这份“吃草”指南\",\"vbrief\":\"挖野菜是春天来了最强信号，为什么薅野菜是中老年人独有的迎春仪式？香椿、荠菜、春笋、槐花、榆钱……如何从野草的包围圈中快速识别出占比不到1%的野菜？春分又至，哪些野菜有毒、又有哪些成功出圈？最后提示：挖野菜易沉迷，不要贪多哦。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":217,\"vid\":\"c64c9bd92e4a43299ed30d6922812cb9\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/03/20/VIDER702wNbSdano4RJ1Wwgh210320.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEmReHDDcIdNotIZ75281I210308\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"7af732b327294d97beced98869faf24b\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210308/1615164010889062998.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210308/1615164020287088957.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"大妈,阿姨,丝巾,李焕英\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1615164022211,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1615164022211,\"seqStrId\":\"1615164022211\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"春天来了 姹紫嫣红的阿姨们盛开了\",\"vbrief\":\"她们，在春光里、花丛中、各大景点挥舞着丝巾。 她们，有着独创的拍照pose，总是高雅地交叉双腿，拥抱蓝天、阳光和空气， 为什么成千上万的阿姨，会不约而同在镜头前掏出同款丝巾，摆成如出一辙的姿势？为什么以前朴素的“李焕英”们如今偏爱穿得花花绿绿？揭秘充满神秘色彩的大妈搭配玄学，深挖#春天大妈迷惑行为#社会形成原因。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":212,\"vid\":\"733e02efa06045f08127d6fb65e61eb8\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/03/08/VIDEmReHDDcIdNotIZ75281I210308.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE60PDr5HNoVhxwnUF72Si210304\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"6d27ed05e778493ab82cc39366a88a45\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210304/1614818284674088616.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210304/1614818288321019873.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"能源,电网,寒潮\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1614818303168,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1614818303168,\"seqStrId\":\"1614818303168\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"中国为什么没有发生过大停电\",\"vbrief\":\"美国的一场寒潮让能源大州陷入重大灾难状态，不少网友发问，假如中国遭遇这样一场寒潮，也会上演“末日生存”吗？2008年那场令国人记忆犹新的冰灾，我们是如何渡过难关的？中国是世界上电网规模最大的国家，也是电网维护难度系数最高的国家。为什么从未发生过大范围停电事故？可以做到全年24小时不断电？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":237,\"vid\":\"b5e43ad207354b79aa875181a5554f9f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/03/04/VIDE60PDr5HNoVhxwnUF72Si210304.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEeXFqzjaYypu4SrCLxTbT210214\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"33edb57acee94351b89750eaec051f29\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210214/1613268423316005510.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210214/1613268434366071797.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"贺岁片,春节档,爷青回,科幻电影\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1613268437095,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1613268437095,\"seqStrId\":\"1613268437095\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"过年嘛，最开心的就是刷片啦\",\"vbrief\":\"从90年代以成龙为代表的香港电影到《甲方乙方》冯氏喜剧贺岁片的诞生，从好莱坞电影《阿凡达》入驻春节档到打开中国科幻电影新局面的《流浪地球》，以前的贺岁片有多经典，中国贺岁片和春节档的经历了哪些大事件和名场面？中国人过年看电影的习惯是从什么时候开始的？一副“爷青回”片单开启春节宅家高密度刷片模式。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":428,\"vid\":\"8a94bde98c854550b870c38d30fdb009\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/02/14/VIDEeXFqzjaYypu4SrCLxTbT210214.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE70FFh2T0eiKVwmCSQqJW210211\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"360f0d63fb7644609263fe085ec9497c\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210211/1613008848782082540.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210211/1613008875376058047.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"就地过年,春节,年轻人\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1613008877629,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1613008877629,\"seqStrId\":\"1613008877629\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"就地过年N种人格大赏\",\"vbrief\":\"动能keep放克，静能刷片干饭；交流年货采购清单，提前半月练习包饺子。这届网友长大了，会自己过年了……今年就地过年的你我，如何消磨春节假期？“就地过年氛围组”又分哪几类人？点开视频，看看当代年轻人，如何过日子。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":222,\"vid\":\"fdf92f1cc2e045599dc9cfd69b009da6\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/02/11/VIDE70FFh2T0eiKVwmCSQqJW210211.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEZWlbRtt7Jszxfy0tRRiX210210\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"2d52fcb573e940c59518d9b8bd24ad91\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210210/1612950975273060346.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210210/1612950984371079738.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"年味,家乡\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1612951193438,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1612951193438,\"seqStrId\":\"1612951193438\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"年味儿大盘点，快来看看有没有你的家乡！\",\"vbrief\":\"春节将近，年味儿渐浓！在东北，炖菜粉条子、小鸡蘑菇大冻梨，丰富多样的年货一早就准备妥帖；在陕北，吃着糖油粑粑、臊子面，看闹社火、扭秧歌穿街过村，热闹非凡；到了海南，采屋、祭祖、撒酒坛等环节可不能少，槟榔更是过年的必备年货，用它拜年蕴含着吉祥如意、尊重礼让，黎族还有无槟榔不成婚的习俗；在云桂一带，芦笙舞、大鼓舞载歌载舞，充满了浓浓的民族范儿……全国各地的过年风俗热闹纷繁，本期视频超适合下饭，快来围观这场年味儿PK吧～\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":201,\"vid\":\"546ead7a7e8b4df485e1ced2a4413e53\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/02/10/VIDEZWlbRtt7Jszxfy0tRRiX210210.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEclM4VNiYyMhJKeGUbpW5210210\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"562271ec83b140e18329c174a820c5b4\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210210/1612912776329058738.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210210/1612912790628050037.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"天问一号,火星,近火制动,就地过年\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1612912793729,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1612912793729,\"seqStrId\":\"1612912793729\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"天问一号在火星“就地过年”\",\"vbrief\":\"除夕前后天问一号将进行近火制动，这个春节，是时候在火星来一场大聚会了！3位地球客人——阿联酋的“希望号”、中国的“天问一号”、美国的“毅力号”陆续抵达。这些“地球仔”里个头最大、重量最大的那个，就是咱家的“天问一号”，它是怎么让自己成为火星的“卫星”，就地过年的？为什么要绕圈等到5月才进行登录？星辰大海，永不止步，戳视频来了解一下吧！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":193,\"vid\":\"fc699909d5814141ac483440d509de04\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/02/10/VIDEclM4VNiYyMhJKeGUbpW5210210.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEvMIJhnB7RQcDF68whCRO210204\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"78e71d421b3d4021bca5132533f5aaa9\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210204/1612405169289079069.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210204/1612405175074038101.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"年货,过年,美食,家乡\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1612405250357,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1612405250357,\"seqStrId\":\"1612405250357\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"我要悄悄买年货 然后惊艳所有人\",\"vbrief\":\"贴对联、穿新衣、瓜子花生鸡鸭鱼……今天是小年，你家有什么过年雷打不动一定会置办的年货？北方地摊上卖雪糕，南方阳台上挂腊肠，各地年货奇景大赏，哪一种能代表你的家乡味？螺蛳粉睡衣switch、口罩酒精视频APP，就地过年的你们，2021年货备货指南要注意哪些？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":176,\"vid\":\"26f944e59cbb4778946132af7fe1d00d\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/02/04/VIDEvMIJhnB7RQcDF68whCRO210204.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE2nHmpmvNFtWxFP2p6NZj210202\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"69b7d0a3a98a428ea433a878f86b419b\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210202/1612250025300076747.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210202/1612250013941059047.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"创意,社会热点,比划\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1612237907808,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1612237907808,\"seqStrId\":\"1612237907808\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"钱包为什么总是空的 人类记账史图鉴\",\"vbrief\":\"成年人的生活方式从每天记账开始，花钱的地方数不尽数，记账人有些许忧愁。干饭、学习、养生、旅游、撸猫……2020年你的钱都花去哪儿了？你的账单是否让你感到焦虑？琳琅满目的账单条款里，你是否会思考赚钱和账单的终极奥义？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":189,\"vid\":\"c8ac1a0c0a5946a5b0dcc97f523b59b1\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/02/02/VIDE2nHmpmvNFtWxFP2p6NZj210202.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEzndJffOFcpCWPcKX8WA1210127\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"ac4fa7e8b9474393a3d2e993fee0ebed\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210127/1611715441114006053.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210127/1611715452130073275.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"731部队,生化武器,美国,德特里克堡\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1611715454568,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1611715454568,\"seqStrId\":\"1611715454568\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"做个人吧！深挖美国生物实验黑历史\",\"vbrief\":\"继承“731部队”遗产、用千人做梅毒实验、研发进攻性生物战武器……坐拥全球200多个军事生物实验室的美国都有哪些“作恶史”？美国最大的生化武器基地，到底研究啥病毒？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":209,\"vid\":\"db24997c0feb4a1898ceee02c3bbc3ee\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/01/27/VIDEzndJffOFcpCWPcKX8WA1210127.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEHnV8JpKCIXGlcdFgrxuu210123\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"f6c69418aa6a45ff99d55cb56dcb07f5\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210123/1611382957112096802.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210123/1611382964710058816.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"创意,社会热点,科普\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1611382965901,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1611382965901,\"seqStrId\":\"1611382965901\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"美再泼脏水 新疆番茄有多“红”？\",\"vbrief\":\"番茄，可能是中国人最热爱的蔬菜，番茄炒蛋更被推上“国菜”的位置。近半年来，美国也盯上了咱的番茄，屡次说咱“强制劳动”，要全面禁止新疆番茄产品入境，这可不完全是“世纪谎言”嘛。来，这就去新疆瞅瞅~最后小央想说，咱华姐说的对，单边制裁损人害己，就像“回旋镖”迟早都会飞回！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":139,\"vid\":\"8ed465012581443f82312eab67d60aa9\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/01/23/VIDEHnV8JpKCIXGlcdFgrxuu210123.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"