89503511\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"你最关心的新冠疫苗问题 答案在这里\",\"vbrief\":\"我国首批新冠病毒疫苗开始对重点人群进行接种。疫苗到底安不安全？怎么打？哪些人能打？有不良反应怎么办？病毒变异对疫苗效果影响有多大？效果能持续多久？新冠疫苗的“全景式科普”来了，必看+收藏！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":191,\"vid\":\"3b76b409054946539ae471b0b89475e0\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/01/07/VIDE5iSuvZI7b2GuDsQVU8CG210107.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEYVJdnT7cXCCdAKu3iaVN210103\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"11196dd88e3e4ca5a9ba3b2e817a086c\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210103/1609664564889080857.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210103/1609664573925094248.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"流星雨,科普,比划\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1609664576177,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1609664576177,\"seqStrId\":\"1609664576177\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"我想死你们了！新年第一场流星雨竟是老朋友\",\"vbrief\":\"2021年第一场流星雨——象限仪流星雨将在1月3日晚10时30分迎来峰值，送上浪漫新年祝福。届时，天空中每小时都有约110颗流星划过。其实……这是位老朋友了，每个新年都持之以恒地来地球打卡，作为在北半球称霸的三大流星雨“巨星”之一，它有怎样的性格呢，戳视频比划喵来解密！最后，小央祝愿熬夜的小伙伴们都能看到流星，比如一颗明亮的火流星！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":141,\"vid\":\"5317523c396349bcae05998003cb5a84\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/01/03/VIDEYVJdnT7cXCCdAKu3iaVN210103.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEg1dsh2Ty4w3sY64Bi2mH210102\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"4fafbb09e47c4034a9bbaaa173d43cbb\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210102/1609550031817061556.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20210102/1609550036004006412.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"女性图像,2020,盘点\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1609550113983,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1609550113983,\"seqStrId\":\"1609550113983\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"2020年女性图像：她们是谁\",\"vbrief\":\"新闻报道里流泪却不怕“牺牲”的女医护、短视频里“心里有爱，眼里有光”的女人、热播影视里“不尽如意”的独立女性……2020年，我们拥有了girl power爆棚、独立有责任感的“她”；拥有了不再为自己容貌焦虑的“她”；拥有了敢于为自己“发声”的“她”……她们站在一起，温柔自有惊涛骇浪。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":222,\"vid\":\"166c9adbadb842d9b0efe49221c40fed\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2021/01/02/VIDEg1dsh2Ty4w3sY64Bi2mH210102.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEBrNqP3aUKUdof011N6W6201231\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"040fe70f70634b9a8329f6c46252c6a5\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201231/1609398926468094939.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201231/1609398931271027222.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"科幻片,预言,探测火星\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1609398988080,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1609398988080,\"seqStrId\":\"1609398988080\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"2020年 那些科幻片预言成真的事儿\",\"vbrief\":\"探测火星、奥运会延迟、赛博朋克style大火、AI智能机器人冲击人类社会……看看哪些科幻作品、科学家对于2020年的预测不幸被言中，2020年最后一天，总结2020年惊世预言。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":223,\"vid\":\"7225059e75924a73a3783623c9deee2e\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/12/31/VIDEBrNqP3aUKUdof011N6W6201231.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEwfEXar1eGdjQ7ju4dKh4201231\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"964d8ec5ec1749caa1ba2f507244a912\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201231/1609401545396065395.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201231/1609401557409050342.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"航天,科技,中国\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1609395211497,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1609395211497,\"seqStrId\":\"1609395211497\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"没吹牛！中国航天计划全力加速中……\",\"vbrief\":\"2020年，面对疫情这个不速之客，中国航天按照规划依旧火力全开，从长征五号乙的胜利首飞，到北斗三号的胜利收官，再到嫦娥五号的飞天揽月……时至今日，中国第一颗人造卫星“东方红一号”依然在轨飞行；明后两年，我国载人航天工程还将预计实施11次发射，没吹牛，咱一步步稳着呢！来说说，在你心中航天的2035年是什么样子？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":229,\"vid\":\"d962098f3a0645a0ba56d25fe9d696f6\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/12/31/VIDEwfEXar1eGdjQ7ju4dKh4201231.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEvHcCwQWiJEDPzV7YFScv201228\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"4f7c24c54e13421ab6d82b95c349fd0a\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201228/1609114396905032648.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201228/1609114404220014278.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"年终策划,科技,珠峰登顶\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeu