4rV7Sftg201218\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"7f3fbcd358eb4b2eb9ce61dd852d1b66\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201218/1608257696252060432.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201218/1608257700343074824.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"2020,凡人英雄,正能量\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1608258257544,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1608258257544,\"seqStrId\":\"1608258257544\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"100%眼泪收割大盘点 凡人英雄2020图鉴\",\"vbrief\":\"当2020年的记忆闸门打开，你能记起哪些温暖瞬间？又有哪些“凡人英雄”保护过我们、震撼过我们？中国人总是被他们之中最勇敢的人保护得很好，在年终复杂的情绪里，比划2020瞬间我们记下了那些闪闪发亮的普通人，让魔幻的2020年里各种温暖善良频频显现。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":219,\"vid\":\"f4cd67be5a3b4cf693724f8a0bb4a2ec\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/12/18/VIDEkyvffBIE8IHV4rV7Sftg201218.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEZ0Y0wXxJtP86oBIQAk2o201215\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"7fbb8fc2b0174fca9dae48c1e55c5823\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201215/1608000143938017925.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201215/1608000150190034267.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"珠峰,测量\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1608000377798,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1608000377798,\"seqStrId\":\"1608000377798\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"珠峰高程测量分几步 为什么一定要人登顶测量？\",\"vbrief\":\"珠峰8848.86米新高是怎么测出来的？为什么总要量“珠峰”的身高？珠峰测量用了哪些“黑科技”？为什么不能用无人机，一定要人去登顶珠峰？中尼共同宣布珠峰“身高”有何深意？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":185,\"vid\":\"1b8a74346b1d4d308e96679898f238d5\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/12/15/VIDEZ0Y0wXxJtP86oBIQAk2o201215.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEhGzoPeaCMyUN0THHiVDd201214\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"628713e5ea3142f59d2190f94f38f7ef\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201214/1607925763814075549.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201214/1607925772399089910.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"方便面,社会热点,趣味解读\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1607925773578,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1607925773578,\"seqStrId\":\"1607925773578\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"方便面这么贵，为啥你还愿意再给它一次机会？\",\"vbrief\":\"在你的印象里，一包方便面要多少钱？1元？3元？5元？近年来高端速食赛道竞争者越来越多、越来越挤，定价也越来越让人咋舌。 有人吃面为了情怀，有人为了猎奇，有人就好这口，无面不欢！寒冷的冬天就该吃面！关于“高端面”你怎么看？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":140,\"vid\":\"aef3bc2734b84674a76db7ba94d343c7\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/12/14/VIDEhGzoPeaCMyUN0THHiVDd201214.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEtaS6yQ7ti1FrXDgnoHiA201212\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"bab4a05bbfef47539594a1fb730422be\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201212/1607768828030003613.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201212/1607768834135056611.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"下雪,南方人,雪景\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1607768900162,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1607768900162,\"seqStrId\":\"1607768900162\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"为什么凡人看到下雪会很开心？\",\"vbrief\":\"无论是热搜上#让南方人羡慕的雪景#还是#当代人过冬图鉴#，无不透露人类对于这种自然界最具亲和力的晶体的爱慕，每当大雪降临人间或者朋友圈时，总会让人感到由衷的快乐与治愈。#一片合格的雪花长啥样# 为什么大家都喜欢它？上能灭火、下能洗貂，软萌的雪花还有哪些硬核用法？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":214,\"vid\":\"cc222a8ce67c462aa0deaae1755b1c7f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/12/12/VIDEtaS6yQ7ti1FrXDgnoHiA201212.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE0qVPoTwugLy3fr2FvtnO201207\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"d4ae1949d8374fb3acafa0d7aa7fb88e\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201207/1607296817898007053.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201207/1607296827523015449.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"美国总统,退休,赦免权\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1607296831585,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1607296831585,\"seqStrId\":\"1607296831585\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"离开白宫后 美国总统都有哪些待遇\",\"vbrief\":\"美国总统退休后都去干什么了？还是总统待遇吗？他们是依然生活在聚光灯下，还是像普通的退休老人一样种花养鸟打太极？能拿“退休金”吗？演讲、画画、讲脱口秀、打高尔夫，扒一扒美国总统的退休生活。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":192,\"vid\":\"946e999369734bfd9f7f8efb4393633a\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/12/07/VIDE0qVPoTwugLy3fr2FvtnO201207.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDELgBi4auNfu0RSpB3yWOi201130\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"8ba0880f7c9d4ea1afe4eb2d6f535ad5\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201130/1606718549811060576.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201130/1606718555091017414.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"儿童手表,神器,小学生\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1606718609537,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1606718609537,\"seqStrId\":\"1606718609537\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"你真的需要2000块的儿童手表吗？\",\"vbrief\":\"小霸王被申请破产的同时“柯南同款神器手表”已成为当代小学生眼中认同度最高的装备，就算你家娃戴着“绿水鬼”也入不了其他小朋友的法眼。啊？小学生也开始玩表了吗？均价上千的电话手表凭什么俘获了10后的芳心？作为家长的你，真的需要吗？ \",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":204,\"vid\":\"725acabd6c5f4baf966239c9756dd35a\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/11/30/VIDELgBi4auNfu0RSpB3yWOi201130.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEUyn2OMEgyXeeAVopcGTI201116\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"a6034f0d36a648e98dc9924ad756c821\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201116/1605496710421006521.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201116/1605496722142083244.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"智能科技,社会民生,养老\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1605496723214,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1605496723214,\"seqStrId\":\"1605496723214\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"看完这个动画视频，你会憧憬自己的老年生活\",\"vbrief\":\"小编开启“主角光环”，遇到来自2035年的机器人，有十万个为什么想问呢，比如延迟退休近了，这届打工人要干到65岁吗？作为90后，咱爸妈们的退休生活怎样安排？政策说“房子是用来住的，不是用来炒的”，是不是今后不是非得购买，长租也能享受一样的福利？戳视频看未来机器人怎么说！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":175,\"vid\":\"95a48ca8f3ac40da84e347218e78cdfc\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/11/16/VIDEUyn2OMEgyXeeAVopcGTI201116.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEOHXES3lTENBfuJeoFZjo201111\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"68786934918d4ba198461eeff3d4c299\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201111/1605083290567071118.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201111/1605083294722050249.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"新冠病毒,双十一,快递\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1605077042792,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1605077042792,\"seqStrId\":\"1605077042792\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"听说新冠病毒物传人，双十一我还能开心地拆快递吗？\",\"vbrief\":\"物传人、冷链“传毒”、变异病毒貂传人，疫情似乎变得越来越复杂……冷链食品究竟还能买吗？海淘回的快递能安心签收吗？世卫正研究丹麦变异新冠病毒貂传人病毒是否又变异“技能飞升”让疫情更严重？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":230,\"vid\":\"5978b6d869d34ec6bd42a9795dffd504\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/11/11/VIDEOHXES3lTENBfuJeoFZjo201111.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEe2D9c2ByDSiCV0uGgeiu201108\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"065b01871c3c4aa6b437500e987a802c\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201108/1604795838772081224.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201108/1604795844976096600.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"流感疫苗,韩国,安全问题\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1604795852289,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1604795852289,\"seqStrId\":\"1604795852289\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"流感疫苗到底安全吗？还能不能打？\",\"vbrief\":\"韩国94人接种流感疫苗后死亡究竟是怎么回事？流感疫苗还能不能打？普通感冒和流感，有啥不一样？三价四价，灭活减活，国产进口……如何快速区分疫苗类别？为什么有的人接种后可能出现异常反应？关于流感疫苗，《比划》今天一次性说明白！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":259,\"vid\":\"1672ef78807e4432bfa387ab4fe4e137\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/11/08/VIDEe2D9c2ByDSiCV0uGgeiu201108.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE3V3YctYu23tDEmWUV9ja201108\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"e527064af1b146769cd7b62df1638143\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201108/1604793777943063623.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201108/1604793786293024526.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"2035年,盲盒\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1604794367725,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1604794367725,\"seqStrId\":\"1604794367725\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"来拆盲盒，看看你的2035是什么样！\",\"vbrief\":\"近日，《中共中央关于制定国民经济和社会发展第十四个五年规划和二〇三五年远景目标的建议》对外发布。这份国家写好的“人生建议”里，有定心丸，也有指向标。2035年会是什么样？点开视频抽盲盒，先一起穿越去看看吧！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":168,\"vid\":\"d440a36109f843f89b0a543ce7728eda\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/11/08/VIDE3V3YctYu23tDEmWUV9ja201108.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDECs595zZj1qVZPX2r5OKh201030\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"0a4a5c77eeb44596a0f26bfd820e1c4a\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201030/1604037238690098364.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201030/1604037251309074632.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"五年规划,五中全会,十四五\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1604037269900,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1604037269900,\"seqStrId\":\"1604037269900\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"都是“五字辈”的，五年规划和五中全会到底有什么关系？\",\"vbrief\":\"作为中国人，你肯定对五年规划这个中国发展奇迹背后的“秘密武器”不陌生。这不，“十四五”也该“出生”啦，五年规划都是如何制定的呢？都是“五字辈”的，它和26日召开的五中全会有关系吗？视频为您揭秘“五”字巧合的故事。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":232,\"vid\":\"abffeb5eda594cc7a8e973c14d3f585f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/10/30/VIDECs595zZj1qVZPX2r5OKh201030.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEcdnQTj4bXlJx26kw4WCt201024\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"2cf5beba838d485b843e8228f5fb5bcc\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201024/1603552994556010514.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201024/1603552999589024278.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"重阳节,岁月\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1603554560652,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1603554560652,\"seqStrId\":\"1603554560652\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"热爱可抵岁月漫长 老有所乐生活图鉴\",\"vbrief\":\"也许时光的流逝，会让人更怀念青春，但谁还不是个孩子呢？当你老了：穿汉服惊艳众人，和老姐妹儿旅游跳舞，耍剑滑冰骑摩托，活到老，皮到老！重阳节，祝福全天下的“老朋友”永远开心，身体健康~\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":160,\"vid\":\"310fe18d80514317ad42622e8532aea7\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/10/24/VIDEcdnQTj4bXlJx26kw4WCt201024.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEgreUZ22OXkYA7aJgERwh201021\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"af241c3ebf65453c8b3acbce5a1a870e\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201021/1603258668840085161.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201021/1603258673823081688.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"食物中毒,美食,毒素\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1603258681580,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1603258681580,\"seqStrId\":\"1603258681580\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"食物有毒系列：平凡无奇的饭菜是如何毒死人的\",\"vbrief\":\"黑龙江鸡西“酸汤子”中毒事件致9人中毒，全部死亡，罪魁祸首是一种名为米酵菌酸的毒素。米酵菌酸究竟有多毒，为什么“冻不死也煮不烂”？国家卫健委提示慎吃酵米面类食品，除了发酵类面食，它还会存在于其它哪几类食品中？生活中还有哪些其它致命毒素，哪些自制食物存在致命隐患？又该如何应对“食物中毒”？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":194,\"vid\":\"57fa10a3f98c479aa362cdc0faecb33e\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/10/21/VIDEgreUZ22OXkYA7aJgERwh201021.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18BjQNVv0926\",\"cateName\":\"纪实\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEBIVWWyYdWN2MXY9MrE47201005\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"b892033f6be54b858fd00bd4a60861b1\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201005/1601857992902043434.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201005/1601858004927004155.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"悬疑剧,要素,霸屏\",\"labelId\":\"186Ff63i0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1601858120017,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1601858120017,\"seqStrId\":\"1601858120017\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"这是开挂了？！解密国产悬疑剧必火五要素\",\"vbrief\":\"最近《摩天大楼》、《隐秘的角落》、《沉默的真相》持续霸屏，它们是怎么火起来的？如果用新闻“5w原则”来分析悬疑剧，悬疑剧中有哪些常见的剧情设计和套路？为什么只有12集？为什么都在重庆拍？悬疑剧又有哪些冷知识？收好这份长假宅家观剧指南，不用“烧脑”沉浸式轻松看剧。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":226,\"vid\":\"2ecce43289b84e61ac9e9424ed690356\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/10/05/VIDEBIVWWyYdWN2MXY9MrE47201005.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEjMBWQTyJM2OPNIckIWkH201004\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"1016d7600ebe4add93b8dd5716a3c986\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201004/1601777276175036907.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20201004/1601777284911090635.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"钱塘江大潮,自然景观,风景名胜\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1601777286201,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1601777286201,\"seqStrId\":\"1601777286201\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"钱塘江大潮“天下第一”是如何炼成的\",\"vbrief\":\"据观测，10月4、5日是国庆期间钱塘江大潮最佳观赏时间。钱塘江可是位名副其实的老前辈，现在“浙江省”的名字都源自她！大概这就是“万人迷”吧，从李白到刘禹锡再到苏东坡都纷纷为她写诗。如今，钱塘江潮水“天下第一”的名号更是打遍世界无敌手，英国塞文河、美洲亚马逊河都纷纷败下阵来，她的“必杀技”是怎样练就的？戳视频一探究竟吧！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":179,\"vid\":\"be0267b357494029b2eb34a3e339056d\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/10/04/VIDEjMBWQTyJM2OPNIckIWkH201004.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEeS7ywXe4bHLgpEWW842Q200929\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"26c91e82fd7448e094db8b54f9f0888d\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200929/1601341388830069006.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200929/1601341408852089515.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"消费主义,奶茶,科普\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1601341409717,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1601341409717,\"seqStrId\":\"1601341409717\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"秋天的第一杯奶茶刷屏，谁在操纵我们的钱包？\",\"vbrief\":\"有人送你“秋天的第一杯奶茶”吗，还是你已大方地送出了N杯？买买买总是给人快感，可花钱一时爽，还钱……当代年轻人是如何一次次被带到沟里，被消费主义毒打的我怎么那么会花钱？想要点仪式感是不是一定要靠消费营造，你买什么就会成为什么吗？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":174,\"vid\":\"eeb1ddb5aa5d455d814839b4d6e78a4b\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/09/29/VIDEeS7ywXe4bHLgpEWW842Q200929.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE9ZeXDp6SIzmAtde39b60200928\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"3a611d7fcbf4404085ae825fc77e5699\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200927/1601193903010055689.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200927/1601193911978087098.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"狂犬病,世界狂犬病日,科普\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1601251200000,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1601251203829,\"seqStrId\":\"1601251203829\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"发病像“丧尸”、潜伏期达十年？你一定要知道的狂犬病误区\",\"vbrief\":\"人人都知道狂犬病可怕，但是对它的误解也很多，狂犬病的潜伏期有十年这么长吗？狂犬病真实的发病状态是啥？为什么狂犬病无法治疗？被猫狗抓咬第一时间就是去打疫苗吗？如何让家人正确认识狂犬病，给大家普及普及狂犬病的认知误区。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":181,\"vid\":\"d06844ae922a4de29502f29c513725ac\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/09/28/VIDE9ZeXDp6SIzmAtde39b60200928.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEFi5RREguR9FeZemJv9w0200923\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"92fc83e6d7ef44d689ad9d5643e34a46\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200923/1600847935352040939.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200923/1600847941144006795.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"月经,卫生巾,女性,例假\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1600847988469,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1600847988469,\"seqStrId\":\"1600847988469\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"为什么我们要拒绝“月经羞耻”？\",\"vbrief\":\"“月经”一直被大多数人认为是敏感词汇现代女性面临的种种困境。据统计，在190多个国家里，用来指代“月经”的词超过了5000个，“鲨鱼周”、“血腥玛丽”、“那个时间”……当然，还有我们常说的“大姨妈”。没有卫生巾的世界是什么样，通过梳理卫生巾的历史与演变，大家开始坦坦荡荡聊起月经，我们不再需要用黑色袋子装卫生巾，不再需要用肚子疼来代替痛经......\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":194,\"vid\":\"7034d51e8e79455ba3204c258251a4c5\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/09/23/VIDEFi5RREguR9FeZemJv9w0200923.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEUz52ZpiDaBHiyOPabZKW200920\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c7a74d6aeadc48e09adec19c87e8f089\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200920/1600563484102043548.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200920/1600563520836005846.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"牙齿,焦虑,年轻\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1600563616306,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1600563616306,\"seqStrId\":\"1600563616306\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"当代年轻人的焦虑 从牙齿变坏开始\",\"vbrief\":\"今天是第32个“全国爱牙日”，口腔健康是保证全身健康的一大关键哦！不过，据第四次全国口腔健康调查显示，我国高达97%的成人正在遭受口腔问题的困扰，20-39岁的中青年已成接受种植牙手术的主力军。当代年轻人的焦虑真的很多，除了头秃、腰酸，牙疼起来也让人“反复去世”。牙齿究竟是怎样坏掉的，朋克养生，熬夜追剧该背锅吗？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":173,\"vid\":\"f6673f7ad1334b3f83b500b362744281\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/09/20/VIDEUz52ZpiDaBHiyOPabZKW200920.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEliymgq5Az6gyvw0IYSnr200919\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"0fd6a202c2cb43c4b0fd9ecefe22abab\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200919/1600473630372098270.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200919/1600473798001069556.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"螺蛳粉,美食\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1600475829300,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1600475829300,\"seqStrId\":\"1600475829300\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"“臭”字人设的流量美食 为什么只有螺蛳粉坚挺到了现在\",\"vbrief\":\"它，具备看似矛盾的食材搭配和极致的嗅觉记忆点，集猎奇、反差、重口味于一身。它，自带话题流量和社交属性，要么独自享用，要么携生死之交共往。螺蛳粉的臭究竟是一种什么臭，让人心神向往？第一次吃螺蛳粉有什么感受？从街边小吃到全球“网红”，探索一碗螺蛳粉的爆红之路。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":196,\"vid\":\"39ae20fa47bb494da164ab2590e4b84f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/09/19/VIDEliymgq5Az6gyvw0IYSnr200919.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18BjQNVv0926\",\"cateName\":\"纪实\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEohqLi9bBjSnVMv0oeAnY200915\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"bab96a66577347249c458e5347b93c19\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200915/1600174262109018926.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200915/1600174317058051062.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"美国,加州,山火\",\"labelId\":\"186Ff63i0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1600174324363,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1600174324363,\"seqStrId\":\"1600174324363\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"美国为什么扑不灭加州山火？\",\"vbrief\":\"美国加州南部爆发了有史以来最大的一次山火，旧金山湾区被桔色烟雾笼罩，底特律郊区被夷为“平地”，西部多州现“末日”景象。为什么美国山火很多?美国加州年年发生山火原因是什么？山火为什么这么难灭？火场一线究竟面临着什么危险？如何科学扑救正确逃生？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":151,\"vid\":\"f158bdeea8fe4d389faa19c34916dd38\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/09/15/VIDEohqLi9bBjSnVMv0oeAnY200915.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDETlMNoz5iir3pN0wlzule200910\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"a7a005c14eb64723b640d25fd8901750\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200910/1599702728658017886.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200910/1599702735149029880.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"教师节,学校,学生\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1599702747611,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1599702747611,\"seqStrId\":\"1599702747611\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"当代老师行为语录大赏\",\"vbrief\":\"班主任说：“你们是我带过最差的一届！”，数学老师说：“耽误大家2分钟，讲完这道题就下课...”就像Tony老师说“我帮你剪短一点点”一样亲切。全国的体育老师都很忙，所有的班主任都爱在教室后窗“神出鬼没”，这些校园回忆是不是一秒唤起了美好童年？携猫授课、开美颜、剪视频……2020年因为疫情，不懂软件的老师不是好主播。致敬可爱又迷人的硬核角色，教师节快乐！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":179,\"vid\":\"ef2450976bbd4965977ae39cbc03906d\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/09/10/VIDETlMNoz5iir3pN0wlzule200910.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEyHZzmuz2UQJNbjKxWZQd200831\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"36cfb1565ea54a8385256392b93fc6a5\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200831/1598845299788095964.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200831/1598845303863004552.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"游泳,尿尿,公共,道德,浪费\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1598845865501,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1598845865501,\"seqStrId\":\"1598845865501\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"原来游泳池的那股味儿不完全是消毒水，而是…\",\"vbrief\":\"一进泳池就有尿尿的冲动，你会爬出泳池，还是直接在水中释放自我？生理学有一种说法叫“浸泡利尿”，让你嬉水不久便开始感到膀胱要爆炸。有人也许会想“一两尿液对泳池来说不算啥大事儿”，而类似的事件仍不断发生：共享单车扫10辆9辆是坏的，变味的大胃王吃播秀浪费粮食、任性涉险滥用救援资源.....只为个人利益最大化而胡乱占用“公共资源”，这背后有什么共通的心理？会导致怎样的后果呢？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":183,\"vid\":\"ed9ed7c17dbe49f1bdb54f27346fb3fb\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/08/31/VIDEyHZzmuz2UQJNbjKxWZQd200831.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEPpkLvwaOLV9lzKnQCYkg200829\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"2fba5c6f238540699db3b30081724da4\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200829/1598682954027076984.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200829/1598682958540037911.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"凶手,心理,犯罪,人性\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1598673913161,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1598673913161,\"seqStrId\":\"1598673913161\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"人性的扭曲是如何形成的 如何辨别一个变态凶手\",\"vbrief\":\"江西入室杀人嫌犯曾春亮、杭州杀妻案嫌犯许国利、劫杀七人嫌犯劳荣枝，这些特大刑事案件的犯罪嫌疑人，不仅作案手法凶残，落网后不仅看起来毫不惊恐，反而面不改色面露微笑。他们因何杀人？微笑表情背后是怎样的心理？他们身上的的“反社会人格”从哪来？“反社会型人格障碍”是精神病吗？如果犯罪，他们的刑事责任又是如何界定的？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":236,\"vid\":\"b3bb0378d41b405a9a1994873ad9583f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/08/29/VIDEPpkLvwaOLV9lzKnQCYkg200829.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEkPdEhg0IG91XSUqP72pG200826\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"af817b45362f437997dd6e4f0e375a99\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200826/1598439054446011353.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200826/1598439058819025400.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"台风,登陆\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1598439268994,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1598439268994,\"seqStrId\":\"1598439268994\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"“巴威”或成史上最强登陆东北台风？动画告诉你原因！\",\"vbrief\":\"福建一度热过吐鲁番，上海出现“物影上投”现象，这都是最新出炉的第8号台风“巴威”的杰作。如今它一路北上，是什么在影响它的行走路径？近15年无登陆东北地区的台风，如果“巴威”直接登录辽宁，它很有可能打破纪录，成为1949年以来登陆辽宁的“一手”台风中最强的一个。北上登陆的台风更易致灾，我们该如何防范？气象专家为您支招，赶紧来学习一下吧！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":152,\"vid\":\"09be47ffcb284931a68cdd77694c8257\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/08/26/VIDEkPdEhg0IG91XSUqP72pG200826.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEkXBY1azC6YJ30ks235GV200825\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"80e9f3cf6d844e59977dd86bcf819f22\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200825/1598312579699025533.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200825/1598312587631034563.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"七夕,情人节,传统节日\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1598312589031,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1598312589031,\"seqStrId\":\"1598312589031\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"七夕虐狗合集来了！凡人爱情图鉴\",\"vbrief\":\"普通人的爱情什么样？是兵哥哥“等水退之后就娶你”的最酷承诺？是宋小女和现任老公的“爱她，就选择接纳她一切”的支持包容？是“女孩洪水中救出男友心爱高达”的理解万岁，还是“爷爷抽血奶奶帮捂眼睛”的宠溺到老？2020年七夕，我们收集了一些平凡人相爱的瞬间，感恩这一个个烟火气十足的片段，让我们又相信爱情。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":215,\"vid\":\"ea58fd977e314a408fbb2abce1b973fe\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/08/25/VIDEkXBY1azC6YJ30ks235GV200825.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE5uR9mO0KGOa9idY2JrJk200816\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"2fb08947465e4057a56c8da21de04a27\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200816/1597574186914056971.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200816/1597574177567000832.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"网络暴力,传播,悲剧\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1597574259911,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1597574259911,\"seqStrId\":\"1597574259911\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"不是吧？不是吧？停止网络暴力吧！\",\"vbrief\":\"“林有有”扮演者成“全民公敌”，三浦春马最后一条微博，韩国25岁排球女将高友敏自杀，韩国艺人崔雪莉自杀身亡……网络暴力已是老生常谈，但悲剧仍在不断发生。尽管我们都在拼命呐喊拒绝网暴，只是极端的声音太吵，有时候很容易造成假象。“以多欺少，导致少数人沉默”，这就是德国传播学家提出的“沉默的螺旋”理论。温和而理性的人们啊，请答应这个请求，别让这世界轻易被极端和戾气所绑架，别失声，别拱手将世界让出！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":164,\"vid\":\"4b462816104745b688f23cf596c57e93\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/08/16/VIDE5uR9mO0KGOa9idY2JrJk200816.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEx72xfNKpXNfoyXDL1xia200813\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"cae74260842944dcb048f090fc50002b\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200813/1597318246670093838.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200813/1597318254246081832.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"蚊子,吸血,原因\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1597318400559,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1597318400559,\"seqStrId\":\"1597318400559\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"痒痒痒痒痒 为什么这届蚊子这么毒？\",\"vbrief\":\"蚊子，一个没有感情的吸血机器、抽血永动机。生长于积水、流转于人群、虽然存在了上亿年，但并没有进化出“消音”或者咬人不痒的本领，每隔一段时间都会听到同行死亡的消息。那么，世界上哪种蚊子最厉害、咬人更“狠毒”？为什么同样是人，蚊子总爱叮你？我们为什么不彻底灭绝蚊子？蚊子消失后的世界又是什么样子？在这个夏末初秋，《比划》来解答这些世纪疑问。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":220,\"vid\":\"11a7034b6dba447e9996e1a55b6bb248\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/08/13/VIDEx72xfNKpXNfoyXDL1xia200813.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"46181ed470844364b2a0b31ef4bf3681\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200812/1597199940631034682.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200812/1597199948807020057.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"烟花专业,考古专业,小龙虾烹饪\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1597199956532,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1597199956532,\"seqStrId\":\"1597199956532\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"那些令凡人颤抖的专业 就业到底有多香\",\"title\":\"那些令凡人颤抖的专业 就业到底有多香\",\"vbrief\":\"考古专业、殡葬专业、电竞专业、烟花设计、小龙虾烹饪……这些到底都是什么神仙学科？它们的真实面貌又如何？“医学生上课是否会解剖尸体”、“电竞专业上课到底要不要打游戏”、“烟花专业会不会碰到顾佳”充满了讨论热度。你的专业让你后悔了吗？冷门专业学生后来都怎么样了？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":204,\"vid\":\"83dfbcf6d4b94f818089a0d94bd757b2\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/08/12/VIDE7fTGkTO2POQaIY92D0e1200812.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEUVFrk2nNIrEg8ublQ2di200808\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"23d5e42989bf4be6b800ef1ca49f4b92\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200808/1596848845629038656.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200808/1596848850839095613.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"减肥,肥胖,健身\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1596848943593,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1596848943593,\"seqStrId\":\"1596848943593\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"你对肥胖有什么误解么？\",\"vbrief\":\"现在各种健身房和app越来越多，不在pyq晒跑步视频就不叫锻炼，走在路上迎面走来一个帅哥，绝对不是想和你恋爱，“亲，游泳健身了解一下？”有人喜欢细的腰，有人喜欢长的腿，有人喜欢健硕的肌肉和减下去的肥，“可为啥我就越减越肥？”可能是你的DNA在作祟～\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":184,\"vid\":\"7793b9e363664b7ba47dd294bc3f8177\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/08/08/VIDEUVFrk2nNIrEg8ublQ2di200808.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEOxeuQGzep8LN62JyPrkZ200806\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"d16af3770a2146beb3879fabf83e93fb\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200806/1596670807450099373.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200806/1596670816109037882.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"长江,抗洪,水库,长江三峡工程\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1596670952394,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1596670952394,\"seqStrId\":\"1596670952394\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"究竟是谁在守卫长江 解密长江抗洪最强军团\",\"vbrief\":\"台风黑格比来袭，又一波狂风暴雨注入中国，同往年面对洪涝灾害时一样，中国最大的水利工程——长江三峡工程，又成为全社会关注焦点。三峡工程在防洪中发挥哪些作用？为什么有了三峡工程，长江防汛还这么紧张？如果把水库比作水龙头，它们又是如何调节洪水的？我国防洪基础设施到底比1998年进步在哪里？比划3分钟带你了解抗洪究竟有多难。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":178,\"vid\":\"451000c8f0914cd8bafde8b92de23b17\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/08/06/VIDEOxeuQGzep8LN62JyPrkZ200806.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEvY8KGD4WtLlU8upwOPMn200722\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"86690d9d41ed464f88abd15424102bd7\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200722/1595390478448022589.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200722/1595390481970057256.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"治愈,人生,图鉴\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1595390737910,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1595390737910,\"seqStrId\":\"1595390737910\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"拯救不开心！请收藏这版人生治愈图鉴\",\"vbrief\":\"向考生人形“笔芯”的警察叔叔、冲出考场时开心到劈叉的女生、撑着伞在水坑中蹦蹦跳跳回家的男孩、看到路边骑行的小女孩便停下喷水的洒水车、拼命踮起脚尖给满手泥浆的官兵喂水的小女孩，还有每到危险时刻义无反顾冲向一线保卫我们的兵哥哥……2020年下半年，依旧有些“南”，但总有这些可爱的人和事，治愈抚慰着我们，嘿，别沮丧，这里有一份人类在苦闷冗繁的时光里享受快乐的证据，来看看这些雀跃的瞬间，宝贵可爱又温暖。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":285,\"vid\":\"e75ea052d639407d82b0bf9759750f13\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/07/22/VIDEvY8KGD4WtLlU8upwOPMn200722.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEMIPrSvi7HXg8aFDCJHf0200721\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"8ced75284b6e4255b8337287bf31c347\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200721/1595291911424020665.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200721/1595291916086065575.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"火星,探测器,航空航天\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1595292021367,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1595292021367,\"seqStrId\":\"1595292021367\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"为什么pick火星，是别的星球不够努力吗？\",\"vbrief\":\"咱家的火星探测器“天问一号”准备出门了，目标是火星！火星究竟藏着什么样的“秘密”，让地球人“撩”完月球就直接跳过了第二近的金星哩，比划喵偷偷去了趟金星才知道，想看本喵的探险故事吗？这一次咱的“送行家长”是长征五号火箭——新一代运载火箭里的最大个“胖五”，“天问一号”探测器里又都有啥？戳视频了解更多！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":200,\"vid\":\"840afdf168cf4e2ca55a4edb345f9f84\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/07/21/VIDEMIPrSvi7HXg8aFDCJHf0200721.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDENXi0wyELBxHZgk1mO8kr200720\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"17cec73fd3804a3b8ef7dc0b95ae58e3\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200720/1595214143309094924.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200720/1595214152795090858.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"火星,拍了拍,发射窗口\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1595214176802,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1595214176802,\"seqStrId\":\"1595214176802\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"2020年地球人集体“拍了拍”火星\",\"title\":\"2020年地球人集体“拍了拍”火星\",\"vbrief\":\"刚刚，“1号选手”阿联酋“希望号”发射升空，踏上去火星的旅途。2020年，为什么全世界都赶着扎堆奔向火星？理论上，去火星什么时候都可以，但地球和火星这对“塑料姐妹星”，关系跑远了能有4亿公里，所以抢占的“火星发射窗口”究竟是啥？“欧俄组合”为何又“咕咕”，戳视频来一探究竟吧！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":183,\"vid\":\"b3613c1d0cb54c48993a9d23c8a774a1\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/07/20/VIDENXi0wyELBxHZgk1mO8kr200720.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEZTZ9us36gJNyH7OwUPyI200718\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"6188e97229bd4dc793b2a7f4af687a27\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200718/1595061681635088211.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200718/1595061690666014950.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"鄱阳湖,长江流域,洪水危害\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1595061810922,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1595061810922,\"seqStrId\":\"1595061810922\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"鄱阳湖最大决口合龙成功 守住鄱阳湖有多重要\",\"title\":\"鄱阳湖最大决口合龙成功 守住鄱阳湖有多重要\",\"vbrief\":\"涨水、漫决、水位超1998年，水体面积10年来最大……长江2020年第2号洪水鄱阳湖为何水位上涨这么快？作为长江进入下游之前的最后一个蓄水池，鄱阳湖究竟有多重要？它对洪水调蓄能力究竟如何？长江流域洪水危害情况是否会超过1998年？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":221,\"vid\":\"0a2558cabe0f457085988e87e1f309c6\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/07/18/VIDEZTZ9us36gJNyH7OwUPyI200718.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEtclqzN6TAuFqThmNYAgY200710\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"3852f910bcf64bc8aa5a4e9c1622104f\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200710/1594353933420059513.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200710/1594353939833048910.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"汛期,洪灾,科普\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1594353947063,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1594353947063,\"seqStrId\":\"1594353947063\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"2020年雨水怎么这么多 看看这份暴雨“体检报告”\",\"vbrief\":\"为什么每年南方夏季都会有洪涝？降雨如“泼水”，2020年的雨水为什么这么多？一到夏季就看海，为啥城市里的雨水就是排不出去？为了最大限度预防和减少洪灾带来的损失，我们都想出了哪些办法？小央get这些暴雨洪灾防御知识点。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":223,\"vid\":\"43dd22e05b3d42c49a7cfe185ccfc11e\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/07/10/VIDEtclqzN6TAuFqThmNYAgY200710.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"bd902f06cd19484a880fbad0ed33c407\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200703/1593781242880070402.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200703/1593781256637072128.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"2020年,年中图鉴,奥利给\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1593781271263,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1593781271263,\"seqStrId\":\"1593781271263\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"2020年中图鉴 前方名场面高能集合\",\"title\":\"2020年中图鉴 前方名场面高能集合\",\"vbrief\":\"2020年上半年，信息过载，疫情大火蝗灾开启年度灾难片模式，美股熔断、高考延期、奥运会推迟，口罩成为划分时代的关键词……无数人感慨“活久见”，又自我安慰“活着就好”。但困难笼罩下，我们从未停止前行……测珠峰、射北斗、探火星，上天入地；谈后浪、看姐姐，高喊奥利给，用幽默和积极抵抗疫情和消极……过完半程，如何进行2020下半年时间管理？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":194,\"vid\":\"d3733eb0b33542948c711f7b4ae90654\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/07/03/VIDE03Gw3vtZPBJqcoP64a9c200703.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEHOe9qgMXyjHgwoaRJNuI200626\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"67fb6cbd608c49ee9d4fabd6acd89f78\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200626/1593135988230056338.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200626/1593135997013028652.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"毒品,缉毒民警,冰毒\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1593136005106,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1593136005106,\"seqStrId\":\"1593136005106\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"四分钟看毒品危害：各单位请注意，这不是演习！\",\"title\":\"四分钟看毒品危害：各单位请注意，这不是演习！\",\"vbrief\":\"冰毒为什么能快速“上位”，成为我国滥用人数最多的毒品？此外，北美大麻入境案件增多，一些国家和地区推行的大麻合法化是否等同于承认大麻无害？破坏大脑白质区的发育，阻断脑细胞之间互相“交流”的能力，吸食大麻的风险远不是“自己一个人的选择”这样简单。枪战、追车、搏斗真实缉毒现场……对缉毒民警来说，这不是演习！请对毒品说不！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":235,\"vid\":\"2360b4b5d1fd4405b935829d1d410778\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/06/26/VIDEHOe9qgMXyjHgwoaRJNuI200626.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE7yI3NyvLQ0CvVCLZ9J6b200624\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"8d2a6429d73f4bfdadd6eb9e5f841f2e\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200624/1593004462854096444.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200624/1593004471412059028.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"毕业,神操作\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1593004960059,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1593004960059,\"seqStrId\":\"1593004960059\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"2020隔空毕业！盘点最难毕业季神操作\",\"vbrief\":\"2020年毕业季，出现了“远程拨穗”、“云p毕业照”、“线上毕业典礼”各种新气象，作为最“南”一届毕业生，他们被迫接受无散伙饭、无毕业照、无毕业典礼的“三无”命运。于是，他们琢磨起毕业照新方式，将毕业典礼仪式移到线上游戏中，开发智能AI在线拨穗，从技术上实现了“云聚首”，隔空泪别母校……2020年云毕业，《比划》讲讲口罩下的学生时光和毕业记忆。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":235,\"vid\":\"489b2ae1a1524d12b0b4e6c8d9be4870\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/06/24/VIDE7yI3NyvLQ0CvVCLZ9J6b200624.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEwpTDop6cVFuIzWyWXyqm200619\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"fcd7f9006ba147a2bd7ada3f1bfecdb3\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200619/1592545309441081225.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200619/1592545319719024625.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"核酸检测,病毒检测,鼻咽拭子\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1592545359755,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1592545359755,\"seqStrId\":\"1592545359755\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"核酸检测就是捅嗓子眼么？3分钟了解哪种病毒检测最可靠\",\"vbrief\":\"想检测自己是不是感染上新冠病毒，会经历哪几种方法？做核酸检测，鼻咽拭子和口咽拭子有什么不同？是否有更快速的检测方式？如果核酸检测结果是假阴性，还会通过什么方式进一步确认是否感染，具有传染性？新冠病毒各种检测方法优缺点对比，三分钟了解如何全方位检测新冠病毒。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":150,\"vid\":\"1a4f924e03534829b1b17396c0fa7ab0\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/06/19/VIDEwpTDop6cVFuIzWyWXyqm200619.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEWW64sImaDqqhOvFI0cEC200612\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"7fe8424fd734482cb0ee762374cfe08d\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200612/1591956430915044926.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200612/1591956440154030519.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"北京,摇号,中签概率\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1591956478139,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1591956478139,\"seqStrId\":\"1591956478139\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"怎样拥有一辆北京车？ 来算算你的中签概率\",\"vbrief\":\"北京机动车摇号新政来了！最热门问题硬核解读，参与者需要符合哪些条件？哪几类人群最容易中签？不同组合的家庭，积分是如何计算的？一个正在排队摇号的外地单身北漂，如果转投“家庭摇号”，中签概率会增加很多吗？《比划》划拉一下“摇号新政”干货，让你不费力气读懂新政策。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":156,\"vid\":\"b856a1cf02f94f158dddf98df48af764\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/06/12/VIDEvjBoFyHguJkUJs3b83oo200612.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEW3zmpgX04uWs9E95mNJp200606\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"9fae9bdcffc94bacb0e961d1f19d0cc9\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200606/1591413639278031196.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200606/1591413650785051188.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"美国警察,科普,暴力冲突\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1591413654794,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1591413654794,\"seqStrId\":\"1591413654794\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"2分钟看懂美国警察武力使用规则\",\"vbrief\":\"美国都有哪几种警察？他们的职能是如何划分的？在执法过程中，如何判断他们是否过度使用武力？面对不同危险程度的执法对象，他们有哪几个级别的武力使用规则来自卫？“放倒”还是“击毙”，他们如何在瞬间作出正确决策？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":170,\"vid\":\"a9119aac923741b9a6245d9ee0ad3a9c\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/06/06/VIDEW3zmpgX04uWs9E95mNJp200606.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDELzfxZAwlGkJ7U87hdyPr200601\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"52a7bf4bb9bb4889bab7c5e1170a9223\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200601/1590970833106089006.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200601/1590970846141088714.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"儿童节,童年,动画片\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1590970848979,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1590970848979,\"seqStrId\":\"1590970848979\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"请签收你的小可爱 人类幼崽影像大全\",\"vbrief\":\"迷恋动画片、冰淇淋，爱好奔跑跳跃，虽然有时让人头疼讨嫌，但仍然深得人类这种群居动物的喜爱。毕加索曾说：“我这一生，都在向孩子学习”。每个人类在幼崽时期都那么努力的长大，但长大后的人类却常常忘记时间对自己的意义。六一儿童节让我们都活成孩子吧，看个动画片、吃个棒棒冰、身披红色斗篷、追光而行。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":162,\"vid\":\"66499deac5c6480bae193a8e9789fe8f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/06/01/VIDELzfxZAwlGkJ7U87hdyPr200601.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEHy2QKwM79keUEiaDBVbg200531\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"d0ed4e2133e245378158f9af71a9169a\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200531/1590894950247056015.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200531/1590894956047053408.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"儿童节,动画片,回忆杀\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1590894960175,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1590894960175,\"seqStrId\":\"1590894960175\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"回忆杀！童年荧幕上最令你难忘的瞬间\",\"vbrief\":\"哪吒自刎、雪孩子融化、螳螂新郎在新婚夜被吃掉、初代男神夜礼服假面首次登场……经典的童年动漫总会在脑子里刻录数不清的难忘和感动瞬间，成为让我们哭瞎害怕的名场面，当熟悉的op或者台词想起，你脑子里第一浮现的动漫情节是哪一个？\\n\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":182,\"vid\":\"346e210497ba4528a0bba7e228ae3595\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/05/31/VIDEHy2QKwM79keUEiaDBVbg200531.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDExGOwqseI1Z5dAUdlz04E200528\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c6eca7eaea094797b1a7a559adb5d26d\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200528/1590657427587084913.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200528/1590657441153074925.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"民法典,比划,法律\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1590657459885,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1590657459885,\"seqStrId\":\"1590657459885\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"信息量很大 民法典表决通过！\",\"title\":\"信息量很大 民法典表决通过！\",\"vbrief\":\"今天下午，十三届全国人大三次会议表决通过了《中华人民共和国民法典》。这部新中国首次带“典”字的法律将自2021年1月1日起施行，届时9部法律将同时废止。民法典话题近日站稳“C位”，每一件都事关每个公民“从摇篮到身故”的切身利益。“高空抛物”、“个人信息保护”、“离婚冷静期”、“职场性骚扰”……你最关注哪一项的变化？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":184,\"vid\":\"3ebd3a9d4e584338b6919dedb80b81f2\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/05/28/VIDExGOwqseI1Z5dAUdlz04E200528.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"271631f76eed410fbba11d83055f5c03\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200519/1589862011471040586.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200519/1589862021540059600.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"偶像女团,C位出道,国内综艺\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1589862033083,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1589862033083,\"seqStrId\":\"1589862033083\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"顶流女团要求有多高？你pick的小姐姐如何出道？\",\"title\":\"顶流女团要求有多高？你pick的小姐姐如何出道？\",\"vbrief\":\"从《创造营2020》到《青春有你2》，女团是今年国内综艺重要的关键词。那么，国内偶像女团的定位和运营模式是什么？女团出道的标准是什么？一个女团的组建成员有哪些？从普通人到C位出道，拢共分几步？《比划》这期给你唠唠小姐姐出道秘籍~激情提示：小央视频“纯血流量”小编出镜热舞女团主题曲，大家一定要看到最后的彩蛋哦！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":224,\"vid\":\"aa11d716038a46898346e984f29ac505\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/05/19/VIDEKtXkAMBq5xGE5Kp9FArH200519.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDELlkwH6TNbWgy7Gwh42nf200516\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"ee83ef4be34d486582ab63e12182b73f\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200516/1589591891182093444.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200516/1589591901027093282.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"导盲犬,稀少,人类\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaI