t\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE7nep3kxewOCNHYwvgZhi200507\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c798d9b298b64e49ab60f119673abb8e\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200507/1588808465594047965.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200507/1588808480391032075.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"HPV疫苗,科普,女性\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1588808507660,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1588808507660,\"seqStrId\":\"1588808507660\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"女孩子都应该看的HPV疫苗科普干货\",\"vbrief\":\"近日，首个国产宫颈癌疫苗正式上市 ，5月份起可预约接种。HPV病毒究竟有多厉害？它和宫颈癌之间又是什么关系？有必要接种hpv疫苗吗？2价、4价、9价有什么区别？点击查收《比划》HPV疫苗功课，3分钟让你明明白白去打HPV。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":174,\"vid\":\"34a9b26f8ac545f9910eae854509f33f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/05/07/VIDE7nep3kxewOCNHYwvgZhi200507.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEhLKKi9XK5sXUxO68WPGL200430\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"99dcdf3454ad446cbea4797af537f7be\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200430/1588216164387052882.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200430/1588216169360047147.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"外卖,小哥,中国\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1588216188241,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1588216188241,\"seqStrId\":\"1588216188241\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"中国最神秘组织：外卖小哥到底是一群什么样的人？\",\"vbrief\":\"蓝黄的冲锋衣，萌萌的头盔…疫情特殊时期，他们是穿梭在小区街道的“银河保胃队”，为我们珍贵的外卖保驾护航。他们开的了摩托，爬的了绳索，能唱歌、会斗舞，上能抓小偷指挥交通，下能代打英雄联盟。神出鬼没是他们的代号，隐秘交接是他们的语言。这个堪称中国最神秘的组织，只秉承着一句口号“没有送不到的外卖，只有不努力外卖小哥！”。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":99,\"vid\":\"aa899718aee3426db66758c2a156c864\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/04/30/VIDEhLKKi9XK5sXUxO68WPGL200430.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEEiwGCHui5Y2MDbtnHsZa200430\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"aecd19338d3841e5ac1bf450adcbdcd2\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200430/1588201102769053437.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200430/1588201111954079468.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"恋童癖,防范,科普\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1588201223951,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1588201223951,\"seqStrId\":\"1588201223951\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"真实的恋童癖是什么样子？ 如何防止侵害的发生\",\"vbrief\":\"普通人群中，每100个人里面就有可能潜伏着1个恋童癖患者，他们究竟是一群什么样的人？“恋童癖”是天生的还是来自于后天的创伤？“恋童癖”犯罪常见的作案手法有哪些？那些被侮辱被损害被扭曲的孩子们，如何得到保护，而且是从源头得到保护？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":271,\"vid\":\"0352efb319eb470a9457b859cbdf133c\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/04/30/VIDEEiwGCHui5Y2MDbtnHsZa200430.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"76b790b2e7f44ede914fd279a5933c66\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200424/1587687928847090612.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200424/1587687937856089654.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"火箭,直播带货,比划\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1587687941308,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1587687941308,\"seqStrId\":\"1587687941308\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"送一颗火箭上天 需要多少钱\",\"vbrief\":\"发射一枚火箭的价格，跟卫星重量、轨道高度、火箭类型等因素有关。把天宫二号送上天和把嫦娥四号送上月亮哪个更烧钱？直播卖火箭，买家4000万买一次发射服务到底贵不贵？买家买火箭为了干啥？普通人上天要花多少钱？发射人造卫星跟人类有啥关系？看《比划》，老铁全部告诉你。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":288,\"vid\":\"2553f6d283a745d394857dc40f094141\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/04/24/VIDEEshFzS23PfFcnBZUhjFr200424.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEvzlJp6IP0Mew8Vjk9bHl200421\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"0e8ce8edcc9342eaa3a56f4a8a0a9ed8\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200421/1587462536938061194.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200421/1587462555571054707.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"5G,阴谋论,新冠病毒,疫情谣言\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1587461390178,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1587461390178,\"seqStrId\":\"1587461390178\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"新冠疫情魔幻谣言实录：烧掉5G基站 比尔·盖茨“清除人类”\",\"title\":\"新冠疫情魔幻谣言实录：烧掉5G基站 比尔·盖茨“清除人类”\",\"vbrief\":\"“5G传播病毒”、“美国钟南山福奇操控感染人数”、“比尔·盖茨酝酿人类清除计划”，有关新冠病毒的阴谋论在西方社交媒体中疯狂传播。总结疫情谣言传播套路，分析病毒入侵“大脑”破次元壁传播原因。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":261,\"vid\":\"b09f145e302748fa96fea40921842e95\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/04/21/VIDEvzlJp6IP0Mew8Vjk9bHl200421.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEPDO3fZM3rdcHmq5VaFg7200405\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"cd1a020dc16c4b8faad130ec1867dab3\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200405/1586046796462052990.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200405/1586046802601021414.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"疫苗,新冠肺炎,临床试验\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1586047052884,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1586047052884,\"seqStrId\":\"1586047052884\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"中美疫苗哪家强 谁是新冠肺炎的“终结者”\",\"vbrief\":\"全球都在追寻终结新冠肺炎的方式，中、美等国家竞相加入研制队伍。3月中旬，中美两国疫苗临床试验同步展开，研发后阶段中美谁会更领先一步？这次的研发速度为何这么快？两种疫苗又有什么不同？到底还有多久才能用上新冠疫苗？中美疫苗最详细对比出炉，看这一篇就够了。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":256,\"vid\":\"60ca75f6c1bc4bb091ce74a726f83239\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/04/05/VIDEPDO3fZM3rdcHmq5VaFg7200405.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEs500MqrbIyLssXfb3jUq200331\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"7094154ebe054cccbe6fcde1c8197b8e\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200331/1585615977133033778.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200331/1585615983591006783.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"新冠肺炎,花费,美国\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1585615994064,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1585615994064,\"seqStrId\":\"1585615994064\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"账单解读：在美国治疗新冠肺炎要花多少钱\",\"title\":\"账单解读：在美国治疗新冠肺炎要花多少钱\",\"vbrief\":\"日前，特朗普签署第二轮新冠病毒救助法案，包括免费开展病毒检测等措施，那么，美国为什么不对新冠肺炎患者免费治疗？整套治疗流程走完的花费是多少？没有保险的话，在美国就医是一种怎样的体验？高昂的医疗费对疫情在美发展又有何影响？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":235,\"vid\":\"7223427ea253404ab29bb7112fbfafe8\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/03/31/VIDEs500MqrbIyLssXfb3jUq200331.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE6ZSRfoUenFw8HZ0cvSmr200327\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"ed5c0499f06f495aa0c1db5b57ae8d7f\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200327/1585293302837026274.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200327/1585293417489075134.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"美国,政客,特朗普,封锁\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1585293544318,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1585293544318,\"seqStrId\":\"1585293544318\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"离“全球封锁”有多远？ 特朗普称我们必须开放\",\"vbrief\":\"近日，疫情全球蔓延速度忽然加快，至少有48个国家宣布进入紧急状态，欧盟全境封锁30天，印度全国封锁21天……美国总统特朗普却在采访中表示，“我们必须开放，我们的人民希望开放”，“美国开放的大门不会关闭”，他甚至描述了他想象的场景——成千上万的信徒可以在下个月参加复活节仪式，“所有的教堂都满了不是很好吗？”\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":230,\"vid\":\"bb547a87d64c460faa990bd45c4718e0\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/03/27/VIDE6ZSRfoUenFw8HZ0cvSmr200327.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE4tIuKirdU4tJkwwehaGf200325\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"5ed92353de744926ae1b3b29e5302da1\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200325/1585102976466006579.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200325/1585102984157093165.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"抗疫,防毒妙招,脑洞,疫情\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1585103189711,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1585103189711,\"seqStrId\":\"1585103189711\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"更新记录贴 疫情期间各国人民行为记录\",\"vbrief\":\"美国囤枪保平安，意大利阳台开音乐会、越南风靡魔性洗手歌……不得不服的抗疫脑洞盘点。人类的本质是复读机，全世界人民仿佛重复了中国人民当初的日常百态……与此同时，各国政要们也纷纷宣布进入“备战”状态，释放“防毒”妙招。当疫情在世界各地蔓延时，中国正尽全力用自己的力量帮助全世界，分享战“疫”经验，提供诊疗方案，派医疗队驰援……全球战疫总动员，为中国加油！为世界加油！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":327,\"vid\":\"174b31b714ff46d5884b437439a9d622\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/03/25/VIDE4tIuKirdU4tJkwwehaGf200325.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEAbASGBl5VBWTI54MjetZ200319\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"10fcffb3cc0042bdbec60e4c66d26bc0\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200319/1584611536118091823.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200319/1584611549010031823.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"钟南山,群体免疫,疫情\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1584611597487,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1584611597487,\"seqStrId\":\"1584611597487\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"钟南山也不看好 群体免疫到底有多不靠谱\",\"vbrief\":\"随着新冠肺炎疫情不断加剧，英国采取了旨在延缓高峰而非强力控制的“消极防御”政策，什么是“群体免疫”，它依据的原理是什么？能遏制新冠肺炎蔓延吗？是否会使中国、意大利等国家的“严防严控”努力功亏一篑？没有任何证据表明，新冠病毒会像天花那样一次感染终身免疫，钟南山称最终形成群体免疫是靠疫苗，下一步是要生产出有效的疫苗，需要很好的国际合作。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":199,\"vid\":\"6838498c0848445d80613bf131048063\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/03/19/VIDEAbASGBl5VBWTI54MjetZ200319.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEw5DkQoMmKTaG65XO80Oh200317\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"845b7181cb164f78bce67e750a00c3dc\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200317/1584424001889065204.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200317/1584423993819061398.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"复工,中国制造,疫情,世界经济\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1584424072912,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1584424072912,\"seqStrId\":\"1584424072912\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"复工！复工！中国制造撑地球村\",\"vbrief\":\"近日，意大利等全球多地集中出现爆发式疫情，新冠肺炎会在全球大幅蔓延吗？疫情对世界经济的负面影响正在显现，“疫情当前，才知道世界对中国有多依赖。”纽约时报如是说。好消息是，我国的疫情防控形势已大幅好转，不仅仅是人们不断加快的复工复产脚步，政府也正派遣一支支医疗队将物资和抗疫经验带到世界各国。如习近平主席所说，人类是一个命运共同体，携手吧地球村民们！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":210,\"vid\":\"85b128a39e0e41638ae8d4fcb1ae1385\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/03/17/VIDEw5DkQoMmKTaG65XO80Oh200317.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDERVGY4ipuCP8wONOQDF37200317\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"0bf40c7af16c4777927886bcfb27ec42\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200317/1584403970773013908.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200317/1584403979712001573.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"全球大流行,疫情,新冠肺炎,拐点\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1584404037670,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1584404037670,\"seqStrId\":\"1584404037670\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"大流行是什么意思？ 全球疫情拐点在哪？\",\"vbrief\":\"意大利确诊病例破2万，美国进入紧急状态，西班牙宣布“封锁全国”，多国高官政要确诊。日前，世卫组织宣布新冠疫情全球大流行，这是一种怎样的级别？会产生哪些影响？《比划》聚焦“全球大流行”，带你看疫情之下的中国与世界。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":142,\"vid\":\"594222c0d82f4fad83e04db9fdbe12a3\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/03/17/VIDERVGY4ipuCP8wONOQDF37200317.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDERb1d2TBLP7CYFPeP9eir200312\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"eadc000027e9491aa90b0ee1cbef8b4e\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200312/1584000769083093002.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200312/1584000775759014006.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"NBA,确诊,病例\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1584000781297,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1584000781297,\"seqStrId\":\"1584000781297\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"首例确诊！戈贝尔摸话筒成NBA史上最愚蠢时刻\",\"vbrief\":\"NBA犹他爵士队球员鲁迪·戈贝尔成为了NBA第一例新冠肺炎，NBA官方也宣布本赛季暂停。在此前，戈贝尔曾摸遍发布会话筒以证明自己不怕疫情，网友称之为“NBA史上最愚蠢时刻”，还有网友戏称：戈贝尔不愧为NBA最佳防守球员，以一己之力防住了整个NBA。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":46,\"vid\":\"707cd832782b40f7b4111e1a6b4577b3\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/03/12/VIDERb1d2TBLP7CYFPeP9eir200312.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEOCsxLZ4qEnE00blXj2Xs200308\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"77c3ee8a94b04e3ab459fb320a444ec3\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200307/1583582347870084293.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200307/1583582361339015058.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"节日,医护人员,最美逆行者\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1583597280000,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1583597280008,\"seqStrId\":\"1583597280008\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"她们有千万种身份：比樱花美丽，比春风和煦\",\"vbrief\":\"都说天上的星星很漂亮，那是因为没有见过她的眼睛。她是谁？她是如风般的外卖员，她是加班加点生产口罩的工人，她是每日被汗水打湿的护士……奋斗在战疫一线，温柔至极是她，坚强果敢也是她，需知巾帼胜须眉，自古何须轻女儿！和小央一起向最亮的“星”们表白，节日快乐！我们都在等你们平安回家！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":212,\"vid\":\"2eec8a775b73439a93e40a2a0eb08f01\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/03/08/VIDEOCsxLZ4qEnE00blXj2Xs200308.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEUXF9Gtqu8ZKYKNWFsKkh200306\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"12a4ff0aed2d41f9a695dab2e31e544f\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200306/1583452583496023984.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200306/1583452594892045390.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"新冠病毒来源,疫情,传播途径\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1583452708301,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1583452708301,\"seqStrId\":\"1583452708301\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"病毒到底从哪来 疫源地扑朔迷离\",\"vbrief\":\"中科院最新研究认为，华南海鲜市场可能不是新型冠状病毒的初始来源，有关“病毒到底从哪来”的各种研究正在进行中，基因序列如何分析探讨可能的病毒源头？新冠肺炎“零号病人”到底是谁？目前病毒源头尚不确定，应避免涉及地域的污名化语言，没有任何益处，国际社会只有通力合作查明来源，才能尽可能地切断病毒传播途径，避免疫情进一步大范围蔓延。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":223,\"vid\":\"fdd0832dd3a24eeab60ce5e55e0a7467\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/03/06/VIDEUXF9Gtqu8ZKYKNWFsKkh200306.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDETPNzjYsVykydgCdHwFcs200228\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"0083887e6e904f22b5b179fdb6e7a692\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200228/1582854551580072716.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200228/1582854556931032839.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"蝗虫,蝗灾\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1582854560416,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1582854560416,\"seqStrId\":\"1582854560416\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"沙漠蝗虫如何肆虐数国？动画还原蝗灾形成原理\",\"vbrief\":\"据联合国粮农组织发布报告显示，一场大范围的蝗虫灾害席卷了从西非到东非、从西亚至南亚等大部分地区。据了解，一个普通规模的沙漠蝗群就拥有4000万只成员，它们日行150公里，消灭约3.5万人的粮食，被称为“移动粮食收割机”。它们的繁殖能力也特别夸张，并且在受到攻击时，会向天敌释放剧毒氢氰酸，那么他们是如何出现的，对我国会有影响吗？为什么说#靠吃没办法消灭蝗虫# ？我们该如何抵御这场灾难？新一期《比划》用动画给你答案！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":210,\"vid\":\"b331d083ef3e47cf992a1a4aadb388fc\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/02/28/VIDETPNzjYsVykydgCdHwFcs200228.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEPCHxJhbIdXOcnVh0FnsH200227\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"b771a5aa4c2c4f5da492bf37f9e7518f\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200227/1582762107132029546.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200227/1582762112820071445.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"超长假期,直播,疫情\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1582762271304,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1582762271304,\"seqStrId\":\"1582762271304\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"全国人民超长假期缩影 哪种状态是你？\",\"vbrief\":\"睡了一觉假期又…又延长了……这个超长假期，老师“被迫营业”当起了主播，学生难逃被直播软件支配的恐惧；2亿在家办公的白领们实现了“躺着把钱赚了”的梦想，萌娃们在家憋疯哭天喊地，但坚持就是胜利！与此同时，在大街小巷里还穿梭着一群“口罩侠”，外卖骑手、超市员工、环卫工人、蔬菜摊老板……他们用自己的方式守护着我们的家园。此时的经历也许有些糟，但我仍还世界以勇气和微笑，因为我并不平凡普通。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":262,\"vid\":\"a72d7550fe744f5e886efb8b9001bf1d\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/02/27/VIDEPCHxJhbIdXOcnVh0FnsH200227.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEIwAJhPvkZGRLm2QdHDAu200225\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"07a6a11efaed4e9ebf4841b145e4b2a6\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200225/1582591976524076565.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200225/1582591991606038412.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"新型冠状病毒,疫情科普,无症状感染者\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1582591996338,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1582591996338,\"seqStrId\":\"1582591996338\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"如何识别无症状感染者 他们是怎么“隐身带毒”传染他人的\",\"vbrief\":\"无症状感染者是如何传播病毒的？出现无症状感染者，是因为潜伏期长，还是因为个人免疫力导致病毒无法攻击却能存活，又或是因为病毒不攻击与其共生？无症状感染者会不会成为超级传播者？如果无症状感染者一直未被发现会怎样？该如何防控？这期《比划》为你解密隐形带“毒”者。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":166,\"vid\":\"eca1ce879f4f4d4ea947f2b6a4f77988\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/02/25/VIDEIwAJhPvkZGRLm2QdHDAu200225.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEMePOFXDmH4tNoE8JBwI5200217\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"6a5724f808324b65b4404b8c4b96d73f\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200217/1581912386965033571.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200217/1581912398863095331.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"新型冠状病毒,野生动物,病毒\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1581912408520,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1581912408520,\"seqStrId\":\"1581912408520\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"野生动物毒性排行榜 病毒是如何从动物到人的\",\"vbrief\":\" SARS、禽流感、新型冠状病毒肺炎……会致命的病毒为何总来自动物？历史上那些传播疫病的动物都有哪些？蝙蝠、大猩猩、老鼠谁是“病毒王”？穿山甲为新型冠状病毒潜在中间宿主，病毒传播为什么会有中间宿主存在？调查病毒来源和中间宿主的意义是什么？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":143,\"vid\":\"789287dc47f844c2ba5e23b9d5edc9b8\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/02/17/VIDEMePOFXDmH4tNoE8JBwI5200217.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEnnScPGF0IO830hwTnyuJ200214\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"9a95936874be43bc862afcbd975453c5\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200214/1581641481286036956.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200214/1581641486277061656.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"爱情,情人节,疫情,医护,夫妻\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1581641747831,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1581641747831,\"seqStrId\":\"1581641747831\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"战疫最前线 | 等到春暖花开时 我们要肆无忌惮地握手亲吻拥抱\",\"vbrief\":\"疫情之下的爱情有多浪漫？是时隔11天却只能隔着玻璃口罩的亲吻？是从厚厚的装备中通过眼神就能认出彼此的默契？还是丈夫为妻子送行许下的“做一年家务”的承诺？除夕那天，他们结伴去拯救世界。再坚持一下，就能脱下厚厚的防护服，在阳光下毫无顾虑地见面。武汉今年的冬天有些长，口罩里的爱情让凛冽的寒风里还带着温柔。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":173,\"vid\":\"30a07a7dcc504f628b4a626270c8a2b5\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/02/14/VIDEnnScPGF0IO830hwTnyuJ200214.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEbbJ2kKgf9k4ISNlNVRnI200213\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"fa0a406d4d254e47af5d749341a392e1\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200213/1581597855173011563.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200213/1581597863198085472.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国女足,足球,王霜\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1581597867067,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1581597867067,\"seqStrId\":\"1581597867067\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"铿锵玫瑰再度绽放，期待女子三大球胜利会师\",\"title\":\"铿锵玫瑰再度绽放，期待女子三大球胜利会师\",\"vbrief\":\"受疫情影响失去主场优势、王霜等主力球员缺阵、长时间被隔离无法训练，面临中国足球历史上最艰难的一次大赛征程，女足姑娘们依旧不负众望，顺利出线。距离在东京奥运会与女篮、女排姑娘胜利会师只差一步之遥。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":41,\"vid\":\"c3e0314c4a5c4010979685bcdb74c362\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/02/13/VIDEbbJ2kKgf9k4ISNlNVRnI200213.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEMOXcxAtGHJ4BfWpUJ7xN200211\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"eec78912234644539ad7433dbc208307\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200211/1581386637533071376.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200211/1581386646150037945.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"气溶胶传播,战疫最前线,LOL,新冠肺炎\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1581386794770,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1581386794770,\"seqStrId\":\"1581386794770\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"一看就明白 用LOL解读气溶胶传播\",\"title\":\"一看就明白 用LOL解读气溶胶传播\",\"vbrief\":\"什么是气溶胶传播？跟空气传播有什么区别？按现在的防护手段比如戴口罩能否防止气溶胶传播？如果新冠肺炎传播途径包括气溶胶传播，意味着什么？又应该如何防控？科学解释太长，《比划》用三种简单粗犷的方式，让你更轻松了解令人头疼的病毒传播途径。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":124,\"vid\":\"5ce1ff62eb164c299f06e140952c76ba\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/02/11/VIDEMOXcxAtGHJ4BfWpUJ7xN200211.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEuI18LSv2FkuxXmf1hu4N200210\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"cfd2a2e4b870425581b5e966ab1acdd9\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200210/1581327177031014751.jpg\",\"