oad/image/20200129/1580285444456089674.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"疫情,肺炎,抗疫\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1580286370700,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1580286370700,\"seqStrId\":\"1580286370700\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"全国人民花式抗疫大赏 笑着笑着就哭了……\",\"vbrief\":\"鱼缸钓鱼、客厅跳广场舞、隔窗喊话求聊天……这个春节，受新型肺炎疫情影响，各地市民纷纷取消出行留在家，钟南山说动才动，自娱自乐花样不断。CBD亮灯滚屏提示、无人机大喇叭硬核喊话……为了引起市民重视，各地防疫措施花样百出各显神通。而在这一场没有硝烟的战争中，最让人崇敬的是那些坚守岗位，守护大家的最美逆行者，除夕夜各地医疗队出征支援，84岁的钟南山，92岁的敖忠芳，无数战士冲锋在疫情一线。快递小哥、警察蜀黍、白衣天使，每一个普通人，他们都是勇敢的英雄。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":186,\"vid\":\"697ef8aad03a42a392adcf994a29cbed\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/01/29/VIDEG2i9OYLVe72PElwY3GbI200129.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEDUDnPYS6VT24kmsIBjxm200124\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c09667ad36de44ecad42ff6b044eaf5b\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200124/1579859661199030120.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200124/1579859668723082229.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"奥运会,三大球,篮球,男子\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1579859885186,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1579859885186,\"seqStrId\":\"1579859885186\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"集体缺席奥运会！中国男子三大球到底怎么了？\",\"title\":\"集体缺席奥运会！中国男子三大球到底怎么了？\",\"vbrief\":\"男足以一分未得、一球未进的成绩结束了他们的历史使命;男排0-3不敌伊朗，连续三届缺席奥运会;男篮奥运落选赛抽签分入死亡之组命悬一线，中国男子三大球集体缺席奥运会的“盛况”，很可能将在1984年中国重返奥运大家庭之后首次发生。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":66,\"vid\":\"e5f57fd19e3a487ca536d47361e5cff7\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/01/24/VIDEDUDnPYS6VT24kmsIBjxm200124.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"a075e37e6e0d4a6dbb7d934b04b138cf\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200123/1579749579827083354.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200123/1579749589568078451.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"过年,神曲,春节,背景音乐\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1579749594124,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1579749594124,\"seqStrId\":\"1579749594124\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"真·年三十儿·BGM 听到这些歌就知道要过年了\",\"title\":\"真·年三十儿·BGM 听到这些歌就知道要过年了\",\"vbrief\":\"哪些旋律一响起，会让你一秒进入过年模式？是什么歌，让你有收红包的错觉？哪首曲儿，让你手不听使唤直往购物车里加东西？又是哪首歌被当代年轻人奉为锦鲤加持神曲？春节必备年三十儿背景音乐，《比划》携小央全体祝大家新春快乐！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":214,\"vid\":\"b3933182b5be441694b1507cd103e7f4\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/01/23/VIDEyU3qww3VzCnKfzwwvaac200123.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDECHnNkLYiOZonq8uCcZXR200122\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"09d47c8d172243b5a5d1e4d9502a9f5d\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200122/1579655430843043126.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200122/1579655440364070670.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国女排,我的爱豆,巅峰全记录,女排姑娘\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1579656034259,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1579656034259,\"seqStrId\":\"1579656034259\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"我的爱豆是中国女排 神勇巅峰全记录\",\"title\":\"我的爱豆是中国女排 神勇巅峰全记录\",\"vbrief\":\"1981年世界杯日本站，女排7战全胜，拉开了女排精神的序章。2016年里约奥运会，新一代女排姑娘逆境求生，最终走上冠军之巅。对你来说，印象最深的女排夺冠是哪次？拦网扣球厮杀哪一次最触目惊心？谁是最让你心动的大魔王？登国庆花车、金牌抖腿，女排姑娘们的哪些名场面会让你又哭又笑？“真的太牛了，真的太神了。”哪怕非专业球迷都会发出赞叹，话不多说，看视频吧！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":140,\"vid\":\"f12d47abaf244d18a85f1c238dc116ff\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/01/22/VIDECHnNkLYiOZonq8uCcZXR200122.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEwVVcyb619bJxYN5w0ONR200121\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"22187351ce4140188da1e3e2a9fc640f\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200121/1579573754620086411.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200121/1579573759759086583.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"论文,核心期刊\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1579573906307,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1579573906307,\"seqStrId\":\"1579573906307\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"自带热搜体质的论文题目\",\"title\":\"自带热搜体质的论文题目\",\"vbrief\":\"核心期刊《冰川冻土》、《银行家》发表嗑师父师娘cp论文，10岁小学生散文？虽说没有谁规定论文必须高大上，但群众的眼睛那必须是雪亮的！下面我们再来回顾回顾，那些年自带热搜体质，并成功引起广大吃瓜群众注意的论文题目，看看沉浸在科研中的学霸们都在想些啥？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":203,\"vid\":\"7eb0f4c8c3da4f9b94b5a1cad93b39a4\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/01/21/VIDEwVVcyb619bJxYN5w0ONR200121.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE1k99KymIiyIyfIw7Y0Qa200116\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"9473fc68e6bb4e1aae538162f533918c\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200116/1579172973178078313.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200116/1579172983223065288.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国女排,郎平,朱婷\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1579172596424,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1579172596424,\"seqStrId\":\"1579172596424\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"中国女排有什么梗 是时候筛选真正的球迷了\",\"title\":\"中国女排有什么梗 是时候筛选真正的球迷了\",\"vbrief\":\"从1981年的第一冠，到2019年的第十冠，中国女排总是让我们热泪盈眶。顶级教练郎平用了什么神仙方法让女排们如此优秀？MVP收割机朱婷、重炮萝莉张常宁、妙音娘子袁心玥，这群拥有神秘东方力量的姑娘们，她们各自擅长的技能是什么？场上霸气侧漏，场下欢脱可爱，中国女排为了实现“升国旗，奏国歌”的目标，她们永远像热血动漫里那样拼尽热血，全力以赴！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":289,\"vid\":\"4b797c29418b4bdd886c7efa218c7347\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/01/16/VIDE1k99KymIiyIyfIw7Y0Qa200116.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEHqr8TFx6y8t4Cs2kPEHe200109\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"e1232ed4a7294d3d9a765cab76b14265\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200109/1578561167662097471.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200109/1578561174055017528.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"国足,奥运会,东京\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1578561194134,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1578561194134,\"seqStrId\":\"1578561194134\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"东京还是巴黎 这届奥运会国足还有戏吗\",\"title\":\"东京还是巴黎 这届奥运会国足还有戏吗\",\"vbrief\":\"史上最弱的一届国奥队，分在了史上最强的一个小组，出线难度着实不小。今晚国奥冲击东京奥运会，看临危受命的少帅郝伟，能否创造奇迹。是昂首挺胸去东京还是垂头丧气盼巴黎，一周之后见分晓。东京，离我们这么近，却又那么远。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":62,\"vid\":\"1ff887ebee0f427caed94a934ca78457\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/01/09/VIDEHqr8TFx6y8t4Cs2kPEHe200109.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDED7qArUpKY6ooszXCw3wu200109\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"e693f721b925411ea7fb9f796acb0f89\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200109/1578538600684057617.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20200109/1578538609610001944.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"戈恩,越狱\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1578538618445,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1578538618445,\"seqStrId\":\"1578538618445\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"理性分析“戈恩逃亡”中包含的魔性知识点\",\"title\":\"理性分析“戈恩逃亡”中包含的魔性知识点\",\"vbrief\":\"近日，日产前董事长戈恩保释期间潜逃出日本，上演真实版“越狱”，整个潜逃计划环环相扣，不可思议。那么，他到底是藏身于哪种音乐盒，期间保持什么样的姿势，需要待多久？如果没有躲进盒子，又是怎样明目张胆地坐上新干线？到达机场后，又是如何模仿柯南躲进行李箱骗过边检人员？看《比划》理性分析戈恩“逃跑计划”中的魔性知识点。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":235,\"vid\":\"658c1c282fdd41b78c754442e7e70db0\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2020/01/09/VIDED7qArUpKY6ooszXCw3wu200109.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"3bfb2b6741924881b68d27704a1f6fe5\",\"image1\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191231/1577773446635079692.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191231/1577773454064009912.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"足球,盘点,年终,关键词\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1577773750180,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1577773750180,\"seqStrId\":\"1577773750180\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"2019年中国足球十大关键词\",\"title\":\"2019年中国足球十大关键词\",\"vbrief\":\"又到岁末年终，2019即将成为过去，回首这一年的中国足球，有激情，有感动，更有数不清的失落与忧伤，国家队主教练下课上课再下课、武磊登陆西甲、归化球员在国家队拥有姓名、恒大成就八冠王伟业、女足生存状况堪忧，戳视频～带您回顾中国足球这一年的十大关键时刻！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":218,\"vid\":\"eedf75baaaf24e418c8dd6ac27c9a612\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/12/31/VIDETc1kM42DuuOr0UX4kUGp191231.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEHymIw2vje0jfVik8fJ8z191230\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"2b54bb22459d44c38c5459458d3871dc\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191230/1577665528376064238.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191230/1577665543469079515.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"庆余年,世界,方式,消失\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1577668358096,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1577668358096,\"seqStrId\":\"1577668358096\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"我在庆余年里思考了一下“世界会以什么方式消失”\",\"title\":\"我在庆余年里思考了一下“世界会以什么方式消失”\",\"vbrief\":\"最近热播的古装科幻片庆余年，将故事背景设定在人类社会的下一个冰川期，让比划小编陷入疑惑：全球变暖，为什么灾难电影末日都是冰雪世界？人类对末世的想象为什么总是“银装素裹”？外星人入侵、极端天气、小行星撞击、瘟疫、超级人工智能… 我们的世界最终会因为何种灾难消失？电影里描绘的末日情景真的会发生吗？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":229,\"vid\":\"dfb325378db544388eb3d40bb8c63895\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/12/30/VIDEHymIw2vje0jfVik8fJ8z191230.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"5022b550afaa49f1994f38ae2395e6d3\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191227/1577418887477006000.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191227/1577418894685010088.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"国足,限薪令,足协\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1577418977517,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1577418977517,\"seqStrId\":\"1577418977517\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"重拳出击！史上最严限薪令能否推动国足进步\",\"title\":\"重拳出击！史上最严限薪令能否推动国足进步\",\"vbrief\":\"近日，中国足协表示，将开始限制联赛球员薪资，意欲抑制球员薪资过高的现状，为俱乐部减负，促进优秀球员留洋。然而，监管是否到位，政策能否落地才是关键。中国足协限薪令最终能否为国足带来积极的改变，还有待时间验证。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":70,\"vid\":\"0a8c2a44c12143c2806ace8c53b2d462\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/12/27/VIDE3nAoPlHgmbkG8758MKqu191227.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEdbtWLhJUdjoI7x0YaPES191219\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"5e670735791546418ce13db709645447\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191219/1576726911291012787.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191219/1576726921498097520.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"电竞,PDD,冠军\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1576727575820,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1576727575820,\"seqStrId\":\"1576727575820\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"如何打造一支优秀的电竞团队？\",\"vbrief\":\"作为电竞小白，你知道俱乐部是怎么“招兵买马”的吗？除了技术要“6到飞起”，组建一支队伍还需要啥条件？PDD“电竞界的黄埔军校”又是怎么训练选手呢？Doinb为什么选择小天作队友？（结尾有彩蛋！肯定是你的爱~）\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":316,\"vid\":\"2565251126634999935a2888fec83a1f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/12/19/VIDEdbtWLhJUdjoI7x0YaPES191219.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEZiZ708PfZruzYqRPvoqm191212\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"1324f5f7d5df4194ba8b32582d9e18c2\",\"image1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191212/1576106315488008813.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191212/1576106321912092111.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"年轻人,消费观,比划\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1576106869694,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1576106869694,\"seqStrId\":\"1576106869694\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"这届年轻人的钱都花哪儿了？  \",\"title\":\"这届年轻人的钱都花哪儿了？  \",\"vbrief\":\"2019年，一句“我太难了”风靡网络，成为新一代年轻人的口头禅。这不，双十二又来了，刚发的工资眼看着马上就没，这届年轻人都有哪些剁手的爱好，他们的消费观你了解吗？面对质疑，现实中他们是怎么做的？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":205,\"vid\":\"4077d7681a5449d181f9ce25ae00f6fb\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/12/12/VIDEZiZ708PfZruzYqRPvoqm191212.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c29109136f1d43b9bcc57a1efa2f2c64\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191210/1575972414894085260.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191210/1575972423758050852.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"东亚杯,救火队长,李铁\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1575972438997,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1575972438997,\"seqStrId\":\"1575972438997\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"东亚杯：救火队长的检阅之战\",\"title\":\"东亚杯：救火队长的检阅之战\",\"vbrief\":\"2019东亚杯将在韩国釜山打响，“救火队长”李铁率领国家二队出战本次赛事。虽然足协对东亚杯成绩并无指标，但球队需要在对阵日韩时拿出好的表现，一扫里皮离去的阴霾。另外本次比赛，无疑是对国产少壮派教练的检阅之战，李铁带领的国家二队接下来的表现，极有可能决定里皮继任者人选的问题。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":55,\"vid\":\"3445c90bac684c6da8410cd532f2dd83\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/12/10/VIDEV6v2Upq1ygN1UEbEbxpt191210.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDExPbZCaK1ZpHlAifm9T0T191206\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"d6215caa031441678eeead1369099943\",\"image1\":\"https://p4.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191206/1575626147703044250.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191206/1575626160283062984.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"网红,比划,顶级流量\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1575626164476,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1575626164476,\"seqStrId\":\"1575626164476\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"霸占热搜的那些事儿 为什么我们连主角名字都不认识\",\"vbrief\":\"阿沁刘阳lu一丝，那些动不动就上热搜的网红，你知道他们都是谁吗？看到从未听说的人物与事件成为网络中的顶级流量，让各路吃瓜群众产生自我怀疑，是我脱离时代了吗？为什么有时候好像全世界都知道的事情，我却不知道？ 这一切的背后， 是人性的扭曲还是道德的沦丧？ 是我们打开的方式不对还是互联网大数据时代的宿命？跟随比划，探索这一现象背后的根本原因。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":159,\"vid\":\"643f44b6205d4b509c1a278f9ef50977\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/12/06/VIDExPbZCaK1ZpHlAifm9T0T191206.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEbTP3cmvJr7y1wlE29mZp191130\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"29e41edf4c2244e8a38d7939ac6e108b\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191130/1575075810875027239.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191130/1575075816267070770.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"家暴,暴力倾向,潜在特征\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1575076264810,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1575076264810,\"seqStrId\":\"1575076264810\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"2分钟看清家暴本质：有家暴倾向的人会有哪些潜在特征？\",\"title\":\"2分钟看清家暴本质：有家暴倾向的人会有哪些潜在特征？\",\"vbrief\":\"施暴者常用“只是一时情绪失控”“我是为你好”不断向受害者灌输，扭曲受害者眼中的真实，达到心理操控、洗脑的目的。如何鉴定家暴男？有暴力倾向的人都有哪些潜在特征？怎么保护自己留存“铁证”？宇芽男友刑拘如何对施暴者进行处罚？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":148,\"vid\":\"db7da584521741f3a04a1f763fdd0fe3\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/11/30/VIDEbTP3cmvJr7y1wlE29mZp191130.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEXOQsTuLES1C7wu9MNrQK191129\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"7d045b1852954004b8059c7a7b808681\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191129/1575014611671034317.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191129/1575014628095028443.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"区块链,物联网,新兴技术\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1575014641284,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1575014641284,\"seqStrId\":\"1575014641284\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"如何跟朋友解释区块链 两个通俗易懂小故事告诉你\",\"vbrief\":\"区块链到底是啥，如何简单易懂地介绍区块链？区块链对我们的生活到底有哪些好处？能为我们的生活提供哪些改变与优化？比划采用比较感性的方式帮助大家认识区块链，避开一些高深环节，适合那些想对区块链有初步了解，和别人谈论时不再一脸懵的朋友们。\\n\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":222,\"vid\":\"f7c5a4e59cc14d4ba8f08723fe05fe6d\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/11/29/VIDEXOQsTuLES1C7wu9MNrQK191129.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEXecZ1jBojZPBr2A8ttHT191128\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"cf078517a0654e499603ba16db6ff204\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191128/1574895582737072048.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191128/1574895593159011487.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"总统弹劾,美国,特朗普\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1574895718487,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1574895718487,\"seqStrId\":\"1574895718487\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"弹劾一个美国总统 拢共分几步\",\"title\":\"弹劾一个美国总统 拢共分几步\",\"vbrief\":\"美国总统弹劾进入新阶段，众议院邀请特朗普参加12月4日的听证会，此次听证会将是针对总统弹劾的最新一步。那么，美国历史上遭到弹劾的总统有哪几个？他们都犯了什么“罪”？特朗普被弹劾是怎么回事？罪名有哪些？他会下台吗？如果特朗普被弹劾下台,会被赦免还是锒铛入狱？《比划》这周跟你唠唠如何弹劾一位美国总统。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":197,\"vid\":\"c909c4163f5e4249858e653e130a1490\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/11/28/VIDEXecZ1jBojZPBr2A8ttHT191128.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEFgT34w6rOUdM7VQql9hU191127\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"af94f279467d4cc4b7461040f16aef62\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191127/1574836535714072948.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191127/1574836547393024822.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"国足,里皮,辞职\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1574836561556,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1574836561556,\"seqStrId\":\"1574836561556\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"谁是接盘侠？国足开启后里皮时代\",\"title\":\"谁是接盘侠？国足开启后里皮时代\",\"vbrief\":\"万万没想到，里皮的下课比双十一的快递来得还早。里皮辞得坚决，足协送得彻底，仿佛一场蓄谋已久的和平分手，留给国足的，又是一地鸡毛。究竟谁将成为里皮的继任者？本届世界杯是否还有一线生机？后里皮时代的中国足球将何去何从？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":76,\"vid\":\"1e606061201c4fafb09832071584f291\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/11/27/VIDEFgT34w6rOUdM7VQql9hU191127.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDErI3TLDkkMcvoSLIZ0bie191115\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"bf61518b43d94c9a837709711ff83f91\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191115/1573774185139025269.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191115/1573774190968092182.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"未成年犯罪,刑责,法律,年龄\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1573774557970,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1573774557970,\"seqStrId\":\"1573774557970\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"降低“最低刑责年龄”对减少未成年人犯罪真的有用吗？\",\"title\":\"降低“最低刑责年龄”对减少未成年人犯罪真的有用吗？\",\"vbrief\":\"13岁男孩杀害10岁女孩抛尸无罪，女孩眼睛被男生塞进几十张纸片“没有恶意”……这些话题引起巨大舆论哗然。为啥有时他们“下手”比成年人还可（bian）怕（tai），怎样的处罚才能真正起到震慑作用？各国法律是怎么规定的？针对部分家长和孩子钻未成年人犯罪处罚轻或不入刑的空子，我国两部未成年人法律大修该如何修改，说说你的建议！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":219,\"vid\":\"f7ad122570f34894bb208f90ca79f079\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/11/15/VIDErI3TLDkkMcvoSLIZ0bie191115.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDELzWDtor5K8BYXdAaS3al191114\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"9c18d8c57e994d8294ff876902ec8bc4\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191114/1573718179051046541.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191114/1573718181927091776.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"世预赛,国足,叙利亚,小组出线\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1573718185794,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1573718185794,\"seqStrId\":\"1573718185794\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"再遇苦主，十年不胜国足背水一战\",\"title\":\"再遇苦主，十年不胜国足背水一战\",\"vbrief\":\"今夜国足将迎来世预赛40强赛最艰难一役，面对近些年来新上位的苦主叙利亚队，中国队已经十年未曾在正式比赛中取得胜利，站在命运十字路口的国足须全力争胜；一旦失利，小组出线的前景，将画上一个大大的问号。\\n\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":65,\"vid\":\"a258fe9dc64c4917b6d676128c8ad606\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/11/14/VIDELzWDtor5K8BYXdAaS3al191114.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEhE8CdBvef0kFbdHMbV6D191111\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"bdaf1889b8a740e9b51f133d6204bbde\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191111/1573436814545018941.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191111/1573436830683087124.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"比划,世俱杯,足联\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1573436834330,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1573436834330,\"seqStrId\":\"1573436834330\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"落户中国！世俱杯来了，世界杯还会远吗？\",\"vbrief\":\"国际足联近日宣布2021年世俱杯将在中国举办，大幅扩军、高额奖金，世俱杯将被打造为一个超级赛事。举办世俱杯是中国为申办世界杯进行的“试水”，在家门口看世界杯的梦想，似乎有望照进现实。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":65,\"vid\":\"ab07d755514a41f3b5fa5163dd77fe1e\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/11/11/VIDEhE8CdBvef0kFbdHMbV6D191111.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDElL4QC7fio3k4zW8ibFXN191101\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"309c27411f364e7c86418eb984557b0e\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191101/1572616561829005159.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191101/1572616577428032806.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"万圣节,恐怖片\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1572616798556,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1572616798556,\"seqStrId\":\"1572616798556\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"一个真正的恐怖片，需要具备哪些套路？\",\"title\":\"一个真正的恐怖片，需要具备哪些套路？\",\"vbrief\":\"《午夜凶铃》贞子爬出电视，《驱魔人》小女孩脑袋旋转180度，《闪灵》里的血海和双胞胎……给你阴影最深的恐怖片场景是哪个？一个优质的恐怖片，需要具备哪几类元素？#恐怖片的自我修养#，必备套路你知道几个？如果你是主角，怎样在恐怖片中坚持活到最后？#万圣节#纳凉特辑 ，#比划#带你看看鬼片吧！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":202,\"vid\":\"90ba0c4d44294b4dbd7f6906a2606837\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/11/01/VIDElL4QC7fio3k4zW8ibFXN191101.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE2F0XOXt9c2PdxuUnaMPT191021\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"f57cb007c1984ad68e8f4421cdc7d490\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191021/1571621047484082423.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191021/1571621055894011455.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"白银案,华城案,连环杀手\",\"labelId\":\"4a1f6b117c154656963f2c058d5089a8,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1571621175446,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1571621175446,\"seqStrId\":\"1571621175446\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"白银案和华城案的连环杀手是如何被DNA揪出来的？\",\"title\":\"白银案和华城案的连环杀手是如何被DNA揪出来的？\",\"vbrief\":\"一根毛发、一滴血、一点体液……但凡带上案犯生物信息，DNA检测都能拨开茫茫人群、直指凶手。除了前不久被破获的#杀人回忆#华城连环杀人案，刑案史上由DNA证据破解的其他谜案还有“开膛手杰克”百年悬案、#沉默的羔羊#原型绿河连环杀人案、甘肃#白银案#……那么，这些凶案长期未破的原因究竟是什么？DNA检测依据的生物信息原理和检测过程又是什么样的？有被污染和伪造的可能吗？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":222,\"vid\":\"7bd4f3c61c4c448aad931e24daeebc0c\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/10/21/VIDE2F0XOXt9c2PdxuUnaMPT191021.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"17maMN3y0811\",\"cateName\":\"体育\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEyznU4m4jVB1Dk5x9CZNz191015\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"d3d709a3745641b3b1bc69c072cf97cc\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191015/1571124959820083730.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191015/1571124968110019539.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"国足,菲律宾队,世预赛\",\"labelId\":\"17FB3y2a0811,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1571124970519,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1571124970519,\"seqStrId\":\"1571124970519\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"国足战菲律宾 中国队：目标三分，必须拿下！\",\"title\":\"国足战菲律宾 中国队：目标三分，必须拿下！\",\"vbrief\":\"今晚19:55，中国队迎来本届世预赛40强赛第一道考验——客场挑战菲律宾。此役国足目标明确，就是客场全取三分，确保小组第一的成绩。菲律宾队以归化高水平海外球员而闻名，是一支名副其实的“多国部队”。里皮曾评价说：“菲律宾更像一支欧洲球队。”历史上两队8次交锋，国足全胜。这次能否延续全胜战绩呢？中国队加油！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":60,\"vid\":\"bdd8287f6f08469db154d3aec52e0411\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/10/15/VIDEyznU4m4jVB1Dk5x9CZNz191015.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEhitQGFCV5M3ZlcQqyVws191010\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"3f1f46be68844dae8db1b1db62eecf7d\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191010/1570693451888092424.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191010/1570693459354039232.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"国足,世预赛\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1570693468703,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1570693468703,\"seqStrId\":\"1570693468703\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"对阵“美国二队”，看国足今夜如何闯关\",\"vbrief\":\"关岛，国足冲击2022年世界杯的第二战对手，长期以来一直被认为是世界上实力最弱的官方足球代表队之一。2000年第12届预赛中，中国队曾以19:0横扫关岛队。如今凭借大量归化球员，摇身一变，成为“美国二队”的关岛队，似乎仍然不能给国足带来任何威胁，看今夜国足能否达成两位数的“最低消费”。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":64,\"vid\":\"032584b266e943e2a85445a4c6648c7d\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/10/10/VIDEhitQGFCV5M3ZlcQqyVws191010.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEwVaIShU4gz6WzxTIavHM191009\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"64db27ccbb4648f0bba2b4b2d278670d\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191009/1570608656185025704.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191009/1570608659948050335.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"袁隆平,杂交水稻,专访\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1570608750257,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1570608750257,\"seqStrId\":\"1570608750257\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"这是你绝对想不到的袁·梗王·隆平爷爷\",\"title\":\"这是你绝对想不到的袁·梗王·隆平爷爷\",\"vbrief\":\"上班不打卡，下田最快乐。爱好——自由，特长——散漫，修改学生论文大倒苦水。不爱出名有“偶像包袱”。英语十级、排球王子、不爱肥肉、不想变胖，​90后资深帅哥，拒绝加入老年队，毕生所求就是让所有人都吃饱饭！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":187,\"vid\":\"d83557a023d2490d80b90b4647112a28\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/10/09/VIDEwVaIShU4gz6WzxTIavHM191009.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEfusrEBsQ0KsftzZQNqaQ191003\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"f50c73f4e4a24ec6ad197a2fe6f679ad\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191003/1570091067551011896.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20191003/1570091071805074469.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"归化球员,世锦赛,国足\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1570091186999,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1570091186999,\"seqStrId\":\"1570091186999\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"归化，又见归化！100秒带你了解什么样的人可以成为归化球员 \",\"title\":\"归化，又见归化！100秒带你了解什么样的人可以成为归化球员 \",\"vbrief\":\"继国足世预赛首轮艾克森代表中国男足完成了首秀，中国足球冲击世界杯的历史上，“归化球员”第一次拥有了姓名。“归化球员”到底咋回事？需要具备啥资格，才能身披国家队的战袍成为归化球员呢？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":100,\"vid\":\"a571743d505e4b0cbd40bf7c24d49227\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/10/03/VIDEfusrEBsQ0KsftzZQNqaQ191003.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEPhWaJAiacODUF2k0I5Eu190927\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"f689006e88ba46efa5be446e66d57e5d\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190927/1569538630218097938.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190927/1569538639400086765.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"高铁,铁路,比划\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1569538775108,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1569538775108,\"seqStrId\":\"1569538775108\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"实名吹爆中国铁路 最励志的逆袭之路\",\"title\":\"实名吹爆中国铁路 最励志的逆袭之路\",\"vbrief\":\"从绿皮车到复兴号，从时速40公里提升到350公里；从深夜排队买票，到动动手指买票；从盒饭方便面，到高铁订餐……我们的主角“中国铁路”一路崛起，一路逆袭，70年来它们惊艳世界。一起穿越，探寻最初的故事。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":221,\"vid\":\"05543c714b7f41f28d35c0818f7b269d\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/09/27/VIDEPhWaJAiacODUF2k0I5Eu190927.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDExf67DihZ8pTvmyjZGOc8190926\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"e800cfb701814a9796db8c5a14056e35\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190926/1569490757201064528.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190926/1569490762908075769.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"人造肉,人造肉食品,餐桌\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1569490776173,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1569490776173,\"seqStrId\":\"1569490776173\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"“人造肉”进入中国  会阻碍我撸串么\",\"title\":\"“人造肉”进入中国  会阻碍我撸串么\",\"vbrief\":\"朋友，爱吃肉吗？人造肉吃过吗？从第一块人造肉牛排诞生到中秋亮相的“人造肉狮子头“， 这些科技肉丝儿到底有着怎样异于常肉的经历？今天是日常的《比划》， 人造肉食品将走上寻常百姓餐桌，你怎么看？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":157,\"vid\":\"c40fbe676fea4a3d8c8ab21921279feb\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/09/26/VIDExf67DihZ8pTvmyjZGOc8190926.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEFcn4RtK5WgxYpIIeCYRL190925\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"ad1a85e38c2841d0bac2aa5ead632c65\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190925/1569379120731001756.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190925/1569379203476075250.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"大兴国际机场,世界七大奇迹\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1569379307185,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1569379307185,\"seqStrId\":\"1569379307185\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"19分钟干不了什么事，但你可以到机场\",\"title\":\"19分钟干不了什么事，但你可以到机场\",\"vbrief\":\"9月25日，北京大兴国际机场通航。“机场里没有一根柱子！8000块互不相同的玻璃！机器人自动泊车！”经过台湾节目的一顿猛夸，来看看“低调”大气的大兴机场究竟什么样？这座被外媒评为新“世界七大奇迹”榜首的机场，究竟有哪些奇幻之处？配套的硬件和黑科技又有哪些“第一”和突破？从19分钟到机场的交通设施到最贴心的的“行李追踪”，机场又提供了哪些超人性化体验？《70年来它们惊艳世界》最全解密，看这一个视频就够了！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":204,\"vid\":\"2599cef3b7914d288004d3ae6c6235de\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/09/25/VIDEFcn4RtK5WgxYpIIeCYRL190925.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEBZocQiMuufBck2CpbfJq190925\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"bc45750237374edc888b9ffc473f4aa4\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190925/1569364584403043815.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190925/1569364589153043462.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"杂交水稻,袁隆平,贡献,传奇故事,比划\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1569364824506,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1569364824506,\"seqStrId\":\"1569364824506\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"我是一粒有理想的米 毕生追求是喂饱你\",\"title\":\"我是一粒有理想的米 毕生追求是喂饱你\",\"vbrief\":\"我是一粒米，经袁隆平爷爷一手培植，升级为闻名世界的杂交水稻的一员！我呀，不仅为咱中国十几亿人填饱肚子的问题贡献了力量，还走出国门帮助了世界人民哩。今天，就让“米”中龙凤的我来告诉你，从吃得饱到吃得好，一粒米是如何喂饱全中国的？ 快邀请小伙伴们一起来听我们稻米界的传奇故事吧！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":237,\"vid\":\"1609a37fbe284642afdc93505b91fdc8\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/09/25/VIDEBZocQiMuufBck2CpbfJq190925.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEBUYxU785AZb6FaarOlD4190923\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"248ca7bb78a94885ac60139d900f6e20\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190923/1569212109009021794.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190923/1569212118245065913.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"比划,袁隆平,杂交水稻\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1569212138055,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1569212138055,\"seqStrId\":\"1569212138055\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"用电影预告片的方式打开袁隆平的水稻梦\",\"vbrief\":\"他，凭一粒种子改变世界，人称“当代神农”；他，致力于粮食增产，耄耋之年仍扑在田间地头，只为“把饭碗端在自己手里”。今天，我们用电影预告片的方式打开袁隆平，看真·流量·全民偶像究竟什么样儿！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":66,\"vid\":\"a9fd81e7e3214584846c56e20effb035\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/09/23/VIDEBUYxU785AZb6FaarOlD4190923.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDECBtGz1iv8DCAgdK4N89k190919\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"5d0d5e10b0b14b73aec65ba1728bb63e\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190919/1568897513794045885.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190919/1568897614341087707.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"阅兵,比划,70年来它们惊艳世界\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1568899399322,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1568899399322,\"seqStrId\":\"1568899399322\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"中国阅兵的精彩 让全世界都知道\",\"title\":\"中国阅兵的精彩 让全世界都知道\",\"vbrief\":\"1949年开国大典，阅兵为什么在下午三点举行？第一次阅兵，首长坐的什么车？战略导弹方队、女兵方队是从哪次阅兵开始亮相？“中国最帅天团”是如何走出“复制粘贴”步伐？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":229,\"vid\":\"9a60570d7f9141bc94dc495e5e80843d\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/09/19/VIDECBtGz1iv8DCAgdK4N89k190919.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE6h1ggXWUHrISzZqefwYb190919\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"e9b49e1b751845c68d3aeb18777655c4\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190919/1568848289025061579.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190919/1568847985801023445.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"新闻联播,比划,正能量\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1568848494521,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1568848494521,\"seqStrId\":\"1568848494521\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"今天你追《新闻联播》了吗？\",\"title\":\"今天你追《新闻联播》了吗？\",\"vbrief\":\"新闻联播，41岁，摩羯座，我国影响力最大的新闻栏目。它不仅是国家发展进程中重大历史节点的“影像记录仪”，也是政治、经济、文化的“晴雨表”。它以客观、生动、丰富的纪实手段记录着中华大地四十多年来每一天的变化，上能直“怼”美国“满嘴跑火车”，下能讲述百姓“因为爱情”，既能力挺华为绝地反击居安思危，又积极“点赞”正能量的综艺和电影。最近，它靠着幽默鲜辣的新鲜形象圈粉无数，成为国内外舆论场的明星。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":318,\"vid\":\"14b4be81a878441481866b57154f7c95\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/09/19/VIDE6h1ggXWUHrISzZqefwYb190919.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEgPLbtxC59Ta7TRpn6v1B190918\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"79a64f6802714c1e89f522be43f20ff7\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190918/1568760941145099496.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190918/1568760625516096597.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"大熊猫,比划,外交高手,卖萌\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1568760943156,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1568760943156,\"seqStrId\":\"1568760943156\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"“外交高手”大熊猫：为国卖萌，应该的\",\"title\":\"“外交高手”大熊猫：为国卖萌，应该的\",\"vbrief\":\"以三寸不烂之舌高论雄辩，时而自信霸气，时而幽默犀利，你印象里的外交官，是不是这样的？但是……世界上还有一位神奇的外交官……它拥有银河系级别的可爱，全宇宙人民都想在圆滚滚的肚子里捉迷藏，它就是大熊猫。说好的天将降大任于斯人也，必先劳其筋骨饿其体肤呢，咋就变卦了？非也非也，滚滚大人们为了我国的外交事业，不吭不响的做出多大的贡献，但从不居功自傲，每天依旧认认真真的卖萌吃奶，“深藏功与名”，真的很不容易，不信，戳视频看。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":207,\"vid\":\"c5de477cf7c44adf8f09ba0b8233167b\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/09/18/VIDEgPLbtxC59Ta7TRpn6v1B190918.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEF2liLaXxYGV9fHpsEB4r190913\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"d393fd735605407d89dc068da5bd2693\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190913/1568340675444010292.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190913/1568340637377017539.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国最大,客厅,人民大会堂\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1568341382762,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1568341382762,\"seqStrId\":\"1568341382762\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"这是中国最大的“客厅”\",\"title\":\"这是中国最大的“客厅”\",\"vbrief\":\"猜我是谁？从尼克松、撒切尔到普京、特朗普，我都“接待”；从明星开演唱会到普通人办婚礼，我都“欢迎”。我，是百姓民生的传声筒，是国家政策的风向标，是故宫边上的宝库，也是法律法规出台的必经之路。我，还是世界建筑史上的奇迹，从设计到施工完成仅用了380天，面积却比故宫还大！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":207,\"vid\":\"9b6718bb91124c8fafe2cd8eb2b70206\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://v.cctv.com/2019/09/13/VIDEF2liLaXxYGV9fHpsEB4r190913.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEWAKl2tKMFchnJGr5wjUX190911\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c3924929c65a48a3a86d7a4c20e1fafc\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190911/1568150867348019623.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190911/1568150894963055298.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"兵马俑,新中国成立0周年,70年来它们惊艳世界\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1568151142665,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1568151142665,\"seqStrId\":\"1568151142665\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"有信号了！这个“沉睡军团”全员2000岁+\",\"title\":\"有信号了！这个“沉睡军团”全员2000岁+\",\"vbrief\":\"1974年7月15日，一支由4人组成的考古队来到了骊山脚下，一个庞大的地下兵团兵马俑由此重现于世。他们千人千面，主人成谜，自带“中国紫”色彩，既能走进大屏幕成为一代“龙套群演”，又能入驻网红主题酒店，还能抖起来唱“我们不红，始皇不容”。70年来它们惊艳世界！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":241,\"vid\":\"f111eb122ba64b84a1d45a8111636e8f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/09/11/VIDEWAKl2tKMFchnJGr5wjUX190911.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEVmczgn946pVL4kkizEO6190910\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"1b7a84ba03b24fd39bb50078a0fddff8\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190910/1568098550846056638.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190910/1568098576018085322.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"国足世预赛,马尔代夫,国足\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1568098641974,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1568098641974,\"seqStrId\":\"1568098641974\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"国足世预赛前瞻：第12次冲击世界杯，国足扬帆起航！\",\"vbrief\":\"国足世预赛大战当前，哪怕是身处度假圣地，拥有蓝天碧海沙滩，国脚们也注定无暇观光。为了备战今晚与马尔代夫队的比赛，国足祭出史上最细致备战流程，“归化球员”首次亮相成为最大看点！梦想永不止步，今晚让我们一起为国足加油，期待将士们凯旋！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":68,\"vid\":\"d6ff015dca534882b0fd8bd993c06b45\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/09/10/VIDEVmczgn946pVL4kkizEO6190910.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"17maMN3y0811\",\"cateName\":\"体育\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEeVplD8W6rdpng6xqere3190905\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"a9c0c52fada24e45a171ce6551858389\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190905/1567674590223037766.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190905/1567674594850043891.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"内马尔,转会,欧洲转会窗\",\"labelId\":\"17363mIn0811,17FB3y2a0811,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1567674597537,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1567674597537,\"seqStrId\":\"1567674597537\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"内马尔去哪儿？内马尔哪也不去！\",\"title\":\"内马尔去哪儿？内马尔哪也不去！\",\"vbrief\":\"伴随着欧洲转会窗的关闭，折腾了一个夏天的内马尔转会大戏，最终戏剧性地以“失败”收场。年少成名的内马尔，始终给球迷、给球队不安分的用户体验，桀骜不驯的性格，是他新王登基路上最大的绊脚石。这出名为《内马尔去哪》的肥皂剧，恐怕还会在下一个转会窗口继续更新？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":75,\"vid\":\"c36df6f549824f068c667601f8b77b41\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/09/05/VIDEeVplD8W6rdpng6xqere3190905.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEogDJDdyNPNMoNFEz2vF8190830\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"5dd136b21ec44115920c5449043f6296\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190830/1567165747427044923.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190830/1567165740115034886.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国校服,中国校园,青春回忆\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1567167000241,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1567167000241,\"seqStrId\":\"1567167000241\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"为啥中国校服不怎么好看\",\"title\":\"为啥中国校服不怎么好看\",\"vbrief\":\"无论你是昼伏夜出的追风少年，还是擅长应援的饭圈少女，只要回到学校，都得穿上风靡中国校园的“经典六色”。中国校服是万能的，能装零食，能藏漫画，能挡风挡雨，能当被子，保暖不透风，那红白蓝灰的大胆撞色，Oversize的男友风，它就是无数青春回忆的“封存器”。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":205,\"vid\":\"992c9128f10142d8981ef03544848284\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/08/30/VIDEogDJDdyNPNMoNFEz2vF8190830.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE6EdonQv9IjUffeybsKFd190815\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"1a6060b5d77d4726b15d0095c6675e71\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190815/1565860083564066728.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190815/1565860092712048935.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"香港警察,大学,高校专业\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1565860114402,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1565860114402,\"seqStrId\":\"1565860114402\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"大学啥专业？TVB职业剧曾给我最初的职业诱惑\",\"title\":\"大学啥专业？TVB职业剧曾给我最初的职业诱惑\",\"vbrief\":\"又到开学季，大学生朋友，读的啥专业？《比划》带你回顾中国高校专业变迁史，分享各色专业在历史浪潮中的魔幻旅程……当年TVB职业剧《陀枪师姐》《妙手仁心》《鉴证实录》里的精英们，深深地影响了小编幼小的心灵；今天，小编依然看到现实中勇敢、专业、坚守的他们，香港警察我们挺你！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":155,\"vid\":\"5ca40e549edd41398118ecd79daabce2\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/08/15/VIDE6EdonQv9IjUffeybsKFd190815.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEDwXD6X0HhrFcrrlV4OkL190808\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"ff23ecf538b64627a33c8467ad12d4f5\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190808/1565236517121028326.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190808/1565236568913047343.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"奶茶,珍珠,垃圾分类\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1565236987074,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1565236987074,\"seqStrId\":\"1565236987074\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"奶茶的进击 “国民饮品”是如何征服宇宙的\",\"title\":\"奶茶的进击 “国民饮品”是如何征服宇宙的\",\"vbrief\":\"伴随着“你是我的优乐美”、戒不掉奶茶的周杰伦，从香精色素植脂末的冲调，到真茶实叶的熬煮，再到因为害怕垃圾分类而给店家注明放几颗珍珠，作为新生代饮品霸主，奶茶这么美好怎么可能有错，奶茶征服亚洲乃至整个世界，日本姑娘把它做到指甲上，黑帮大哥改行卖茶为生。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":241,\"vid\":\"fc92b35533384d4aa7ad06008129a45c\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/08/08/VIDEDwXD6X0HhrFcrrlV4OkL190808.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDETchMcuMekEMrWqFMkyEM190805\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"b78e5e0cd5aa48be9448988c22b3ba8d\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190805/1564974344078043863.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190805/1564974352929010175.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"哪吒,孙悟空,《西游记》\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1564974692563,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1564974692563,\"seqStrId\":\"1564974692563\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"哪吒真实武力值解密 为啥打不过孙悟空\",\"title\":\"哪吒真实武力值解密 为啥打不过孙悟空\",\"vbrief\":\"哪吒VS.孙悟空，神仙界两大著名流量IP，他俩谁更厉害？孙悟空、二郎神、牛魔王、哪吒，谁又是西游第一“战神”？我们以《西游记》和《封神演义》原著为依据，分别从战绩、技能、兵器、师傅、出身、年龄各方面作了一个理（脑）性（洞）梳理分析，如有论述不周全之处，还请粉丝海涵。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":232,\"vid\":\"f77b19accfcf42699063e67560484371\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/08/05/VIDETchMcuMekEMrWqFMkyEM190805.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE0cXC6Egk1mzp9Vu6s7sx190727\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"e251c838739b4d17a75bfb1b5096cc68\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190727/1564235247283063504.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190727/1564235254691042368.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"潍坊杯,世界杯\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1564235563065,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1564235563065,\"seqStrId\":\"1564235563065\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"热血青春“潍坊杯”     世界杯梦想从这里启航  \",\"title\":\"热血青春“潍坊杯”     世界杯梦想从这里启航  \",\"vbrief\":\"可别看到“潍坊杯”就想到风筝节，这是亚洲范围内唯一由FIFA国际足联认证国际青少年足球B级赛事，历经十三年发展积淀，赛事观赏性、知名度和国际影响力逐年提高，与法国“土伦杯”、美国“达拉斯杯” 等国际青少年赛事齐名。葡萄牙天才小将菲利克斯正是从这里走出去的第一球星，本次赛事上，这位身价超越C罗的球星，将带来怎样惊艳的表现呢 ？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":68,\"vid\":\"f8677547a38f4d7caf5c521300218468\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/07/27/VIDE0cXC6Egk1mzp9Vu6s7sx190727.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEdcYp0bANi9xqMhMHaFZ0190727\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"077ecddec8d846c9ae200328ddb6d88c\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190727/1564208302275014528.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190727/1564208312435058666.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"摇滚乐,“滚圈儿”,地图炮\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1564210525722,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1564210525722,\"seqStrId\":\"1564210525722\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"“滚圈儿”地图炮\",\"title\":\"“滚圈儿”地图炮\",\"vbrief\":\"1985年，英国威猛乐队和崔健的一首《一无所有》点燃了以华北为中心的摇滚引线。此外，不同地区的摇滚乐风格会给你带来怎样的视觉盛宴？我们很不严谨地统计了东北、华北、西北、华南著名摇滚乐队或乐手的风格特点，看看他们的区别在哪儿？你喜欢的乐队来自哪里？他们的风格又是啥样儿？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":223,\"vid\":\"a3d57226d2c74ffd88372a342b7dcc9c\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/07/27/VIDEdcYp0bANi9xqMhMHaFZ0190727.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEmpljVlapbZniLF5k1pHp190726\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"f2f8f05f6ac24bfcbca338643a390d17\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190726/1564145523030077913.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190726/1564145549878077815.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"精神病犯罪,鉴定\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1564145883269,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1564145883269,\"seqStrId\":\"1564145883269\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"精神病犯罪怎么鉴定\",\"title\":\"精神病犯罪怎么鉴定\",\"vbrief\":\"任达华被刺一案嫌犯存在精神障碍，日本京都纵火者疑患精神病，当匪夷所思的恶性事件发生时，被判定为“精神障碍”似乎成为嫌犯逃脱惩罚的有效手段。那么，如何鉴定嫌犯是否真的是精神病人？我国的精神病司法鉴定申请是谁发起的？过程中如何进行精神检查？嫌犯能否靠“装病”通过鉴定而逃脱制裁？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":177,\"vid\":\"de74182dbb134ed186f15d7e3e853f8b\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/07/26/VIDEmpljVlapbZniLF5k1pHp190726.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEmcJrY8ftakhwiZ0PwWMk190724\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"41a2dffce5e1481b8fb6f5a4c62a6845\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190724/1563953959206057974.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190724/1563953974102048117.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"梅西,美洲杯,阿根廷队\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1563954202878,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1563954202878,\"seqStrId\":\"1563954202878\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"阿根廷再次为你哭泣 梅球王何日圆梦\",\"title\":\"阿根廷再次为你哭泣 梅球王何日圆梦\",\"vbrief\":\"本届美洲杯，是梅西13年间参加的第9届世界大赛，然而夺得桂冠似乎成为了“梅球王”难以打破的宿命。这背后又有什么样的原因？明年阿根廷主场的美洲杯，阿根廷队能否利用主场优势，实现零的突破？最后一次机会，梅西能否把握？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":70,\"vid\":\"86aa472b0cd64967b6b20b240e2bbf95\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/07/24/VIDEmcJrY8ftakhwiZ0PwWMk190724.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEfZH2SfnSLR6zBYVRqAxe190719\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"ce56f6762547449582fb27aca7190b6e\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190719/1563490261542074811.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190719/1563490279425023451.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"比划,丢失,孩子被骗\",\"labelId\":\"4a1f6b117c154656963f2c058d5089a8,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1563490378301,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1563490378301,\"seqStrId\":\"1563490378301\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"防丢失十二时辰：孩子被骗走后怎么办\",\"title\":\"防丢失十二时辰：孩子被骗走后怎么办\",\"vbrief\":\"孩子走失后的第一个24小时，是最关键的寻找期。如何快速找回？第一时间怎么做？家长的做法可能会有哪些误区？该教孩子什么样的自救方法？日常生活中，该如何教孩子识别坏人？暑期安全防护指南，保护孩子，力求“万无一失”。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":149,\"vid\":\"13a194190d654c35a1f4128caf563a76\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/07/19/VIDEfZH2SfnSLR6zBYVRqAxe190719.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDELZSavnl6mntAY0VixoSh190712\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"56a50d1395dd4d1ca2b3e710afdcd703\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190712/1562919111257015445.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190712/1562919120474081526.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"吃货,外来物种,物种入侵\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1562919123865,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1562919123865,\"seqStrId\":\"1562919123865\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"吃货，真能“灭了”外来物种吗？\",\"title\":\"吃货，真能“灭了”外来物种吗？\",\"vbrief\":\"丹麦生蚝、德国大闸蟹、美国牛蛙、苏格兰小龙虾......这些在国外肆虐的家伙，对于中国吃货来说，可能还不够塞牙缝儿。可现实果真如此？各国规定出入境时，不可携带违禁品，新鲜果蔬也在禁止范围内，这又是为啥？戳视频，外来物种入侵，你知道吗？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":180,\"vid\":\"a2046b6ce1ab4130ad29163be8774e4f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/07/12/VIDELZSavnl6mntAY0VixoSh190712.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEezpW636NPNrXl73mW0Tu190706\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"b4f4a8ba420348df982fb27c60d05c94\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190706/1562372459078000614.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190706/1562372466081038087.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"龙卷风,辽宁,科普\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1562372530500,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1562372530500,\"seqStrId\":\"1562372530500\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"龙卷风为啥会在辽宁出现 没有东西可以阻止它吗\",\"title\":\"龙卷风为啥会在辽宁出现 没有东西可以阻止它吗\",\"vbrief\":\"当龙卷风在辽宁刮起的时候，你们是否会有这样的疑问：为什么东北地区的内陆城市会刮龙卷风？它是怎么突然出现的？？被卷入龙卷风会发生什么？？？进入“风眼”又是一种怎样的体验？？？？既然龙卷风不能预测，那么可以用炸弹炸掉吗？？？？？？戳视频，看龙卷风“最全”科普视频。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":178,\"vid\":\"ca312a5172be48bdbe673270a638a3c1\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/07/06/VIDEezpW636NPNrXl73mW0Tu190706.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEIqbqmx42Q52O17VxTATB190627\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"35a761758a41423db8b0d2d04be8fd53\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190627/1561599424563062172.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190627/1561599431944086392.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"章莹颖案,克里斯滕森,死刑\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1561599437085,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1561599437085,\"seqStrId\":\"1561599437085\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"绑架谋杀罪成立！章莹颖案嫌犯被判死刑还差几步？\",\"title\":\"绑架谋杀罪成立！章莹颖案嫌犯被判死刑还差几步？\",\"vbrief\":\"章莹颖案嫌犯克里斯滕森绑架和谋杀罪名成立，将面临终身监禁或死刑判决。那么，克里斯滕森被判死刑的可能性有多大？陪审团能否推动嫌犯被判死刑？嫌犯及其律师团还会打出什么牌逃避死刑？如果被判死刑，执行需要多久？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":165,\"vid\":\"57b64ee3c1ac4c96865452123cb7aebf\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/06/27/VIDEIqbqmx42Q52O17VxTATB190627.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEc2ySUU9AYvGosdnTVu6v190621\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"9ae8b215052941938c555676eee0eed1\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190621/1561116957622091536.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190621/1561116963279016617.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"非洲杯\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1561116995781,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1561116995781,\"seqStrId\":\"1561116995781\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"命途多舛！看接盘侠能否办好这届非洲杯\",\"title\":\"命途多舛！看接盘侠能否办好这届非洲杯\",\"vbrief\":\"6月22日，非洲兄弟们即将迎来属于自己的重大赛事——非洲杯。作为非洲大陆最高规格的国家级赛事，本届非洲杯可以说是命途多舛，原东道主喀麦隆被取消了主办资格，埃及成为接盘侠，面对6、7月近40度的高温，“七连冠”的埃及队，今年还能继续荣获桂冠吗？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":64,\"vid\":\"18d87a7b96474e34940c02dcf751332a\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/06/21/VIDEc2ySUU9AYvGosdnTVu6v190621.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEiZ0EEWjzxjgZ7kElwcqP190618\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"07c1a6dd12db4f9ca7eea7cb61d072c0\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190618/1560825258649086937.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190618/1560825263818092280.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"禁毒,缉毒英雄,毒品,斗争史,比划\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1560825397642,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1560825397642,\"seqStrId\":\"1560825397642\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"从鸦片到冰毒 3分钟了解人类与毒品的“斗争史”\",\"title\":\"从鸦片到冰毒 3分钟了解人类与毒品的“斗争史”\",\"vbrief\":\"从美味佳肴、万能神药到蚀骨毒药，毒品如何成为让人类沦陷的致命恶魔？毒瘾为什么难戒？是心理作用还是药物作用？在中国，缉毒警牺牲人数是一般警察的4.9倍，平均每天都有1名缉毒警牺牲，在6.26国际禁毒日即将到来之际，#比划#向所有在刀尖上行走的缉毒英雄致敬！#6.26国际禁毒日# \",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":181,\"vid\":\"aec37628489e4025be5886967bf98388\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/06/18/VIDEiZ0EEWjzxjgZ7kElwcqP190618.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDETiB27lv6FQUgPJGlOJMw190614\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"639b9d9f9e104d9589b0c724b88a57fa\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190614/1560519047539063863.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190614/1560519062649022484.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"美洲杯,足球赛,梅西\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1560519098205,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1560519098205,\"seqStrId\":\"1560519098205\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"又见美洲杯！梅老板的冠军梦到底有没戏?\",\"title\":\"又见美洲杯！梅老板的冠军梦到底有没戏?\",\"vbrief\":\"1916年诞生的美洲杯足球赛，是仅次于世界杯和欧洲杯的世界第三大国家队足球赛事。2019美洲杯开赛在即，缺少内马尔的东道主巴西队还能否夺得桂冠？梅球王冠军梦能否实现？ 戳视频，看看啊~\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":65,\"vid\":\"74b0f1f1309e4e1d81bb2148ab403da2\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/06/14/VIDETiB27lv6FQUgPJGlOJMw190614.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEVBmv1UJ83iBvyWF48Vk5190610\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"8f79ab2595b948aca7cff2102ce67a53\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190610/1560137438378057477.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190610/1560137452117075811.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国芯\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1560132656510,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1560132656510,\"seqStrId\":\"1560132656510\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"3分钟告诉你一颗“中国芯”是如何炼成的\",\"title\":\"3分钟告诉你一颗“中国芯”是如何炼成的\",\"vbrief\":\"芯片为什么这么重要？制造芯片究竟有多费事？截至2018年底，世界上投入实际应用的7纳米半导体芯片只有3种，其中一种就来自华为。中国付出了多少努力，才让手机芯片与世界比肩？＃不忘初芯＃\\n\\n\\n\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":190,\"vid\":\"c1d0860324cb4f309c30fde1337e9a68\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/06/10/VIDEVBmv1UJ83iBvyWF48Vk5190610.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE405dIfFmLmvWcTEp0Ex0190607\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"255e856ad04b41aa8a0c51be3e37825a\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190607/1559903755047072977.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190607/1559901641389098392.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"女足,比划,世界杯,王霜\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1559903756753,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1559903756753,\"seqStrId\":\"1559903756753\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"谁说女子不如男  世界杯我们来了\",\"title\":\"谁说女子不如男  世界杯我们来了\",\"vbrief\":\"女足世界杯自1991年起，与男足世界杯同样拥有四年一轮回的庄严仪式感，中国作为首届大赛的承办国，女子足球运动全面进入世界竞技舞台。年度大赛即将开启，本届世界杯王霜领衔的这支国家队会有怎样的发挥？期待“铿锵玫瑰”能从死亡之组杀出一条血路，在法兰西美丽绽放！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":77,\"vid\":\"ce6662df62944f8fb8851aca76cdc945\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/06/07/VIDE405dIfFmLmvWcTEp0Ex0190607.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEVnt6WGjGpu9whqBOlJid190606\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"e811a7fe11f94a95b577714640bfa5bb\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190606/1559783884982065458.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190606/1559783891509084857.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"高考,独家记忆\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1559784095692,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1559784095692,\"seqStrId\":\"1559784095692\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\" 70年记忆彩蛋｜我们为什么努力高考？\",\"title\":\" 70年记忆彩蛋｜我们为什么努力高考？\",\"vbrief\":\"“我睡过头了！不能考大学了啊啊啊！！！”打开朋友圈，满满的精湛演技。但关于高考，你知道的真不多……不信？请听题——恢复高考后的第一年考了什么题目？1977、1978年高考都有哪些名人？为啥高考选在了炎炎夏日？英语成为必考科目是从什么时候开始的？限时1分钟，请作答！戳视频找回那段属于自己的高考独家记忆。《比划》祝愿全国考生高考顺利！ \",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":208,\"vid\":\"d9cfa3cb4d824f07a1c0f8f772231cea\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/06/06/VIDEVnt6WGjGpu9whqBOlJid190606.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEF35W2pqoMbhKfQFm8FIP190605\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"135c1ec8ccbf469bb3fffd65cbc0b32d\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190605/1559721210662012000.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190605/1559721165525090158.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"里皮,国足,卡塔尔世界杯\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1559721531359,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1559721531359,\"seqStrId\":\"1559721531359\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"里皮重掌帅印 里家军再度吹响集结号\",\"title\":\"里皮重掌帅印 里家军再度吹响集结号\",\"vbrief\":\"意大利名帅里皮重掌国足帅印，此次回归，他将带领国家队剑指2022年卡塔尔世界杯。如今，新的出战名单出炉，新来的小伙伴，又会带来啥样儿的精彩赛事？毕竟，我们从未缺席过任何一届亚洲举办的世界杯！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":62,\"vid\":\"7c74d25211c24ade8b2130f0d65d770a\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/06/05/VIDEF35W2pqoMbhKfQFm8FIP190605.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE12wEavc8QNtOwyS1qWOG190529\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"6aabcab71bfb4b728f7ed69ab6485432\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190529/1559117262466073686.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190529/1559117291916094360.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"武磊,西甲联赛,欧战\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1559117301504,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1559117301504,\"seqStrId\":\"1559117301504\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"全村的希望！武球王是怎样炼成的\",\"title\":\"全村的希望！武球王是怎样炼成的\",\"vbrief\":\"西甲联赛落下大幕，武磊和他的西班牙人队喜提欧战资格，西班牙媒体开启了花式“武吹”模式。那么，武球王是如何从一个其貌不扬的小个子，变身全民热捧的“核武七”呢？武磊西行漫记，你需要了解一下！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":103,\"vid\":\"7a936a427dbc4d5696b69bfa79ee181f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/05/29/VIDE12wEavc8QNtOwyS1qWOG190529.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEzHXWk03I24T3a4vT8X2i190513\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"56e372fe89744128b99af7f2631266a3\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190513/1557712682928014905.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190513/1557712691353097194.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"台湾,韩国瑜,郭台铭\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1557712881833,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1557712881833,\"seqStrId\":\"1557712881833\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"2020选举 国民党要打造“最强复联”？\",\"title\":\"2020选举 国民党要打造“最强复联”？\",\"vbrief\":\"最近台湾有两位风云人物，韩国瑜，郭台铭，你对他们的了解有多深？这个五月，国民党主席吴敦义与有意参选2020者陆续会面，并表示将于5月15日公布最终规则，国民党要打造“最强复仇者联盟”？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":140,\"vid\":\"c0d46585914940c9a8223801cb8e7d2b\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/05/13/VIDEzHXWk03I24T3a4vT8X2i190513.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEU0zVN6KS6Nbh9ymnEwHW190506\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"945c04d1ee5a45d5b33ed6e7c3d3d81a\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190506/1557146486205082191.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190506/1557146488651093233.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"比划,复仇者联盟,剧透\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1557146795796,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1557146795796,\"seqStrId\":\"1557146795796\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"为什么讨厌剧透 咱也不敢问……\",\"title\":\"为什么讨厌剧透 咱也不敢问……\",\"vbrief\":\"《复联4》的上映将剧透和反剧透的战争推向高潮。官方为防剧透泄密想尽了办法，演员们为了保密集体“眼瞎”。但还是挡不住剧透党们的热情，他们有的明目张胆，有的求生欲满满，还有的在被打的边缘疯狂试探。我们为什么讨厌被剧透？剧透的人到底是一种什么心理？被剧透《复仇者联盟4》是什么体验？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":128,\"vid\":\"033928bc249142369d789d0f02a34e39\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/05/06/VIDEU0zVN6KS6Nbh9ymnEwHW190506.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEgZgLs5d19kGWpELwxn4V190430\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"b05456f5c83f489aa9771cf303905d0f\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190430/1556603424524046984.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190430/1556603428556065077.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"儿童性侵犯,化学阉割\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1556603468780,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1556603468780,\"seqStrId\":\"1556603468780\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"终身监禁化学阉割电子脚镣 各国如何惩罚儿童性侵犯 \",\"title\":\"终身监禁化学阉割电子脚镣 各国如何惩罚儿童性侵犯 \",\"vbrief\":\"《素媛》原型案凶犯赵斗淳将于明年刑满释放，根据法案，他在出狱后将被一对一监视。4月24日，韩国媒体首次公开了他的长相，然而，监视和公布肖像丝毫没有缓解民众的恐惧和不安。在明知道赵斗淳“再次犯案”可能性极高的情况下，韩国为什么还是“执意”把他放出来？性犯罪者被释放后，世界各地又是如何处理的？#素媛案元凶长相首次公开#\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":138,\"vid\":\"2068c087c3394679887d3b66c2e6a4d0\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/04/30/VIDEgZgLs5d19kGWpELwxn4V190430.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEJSUqbfeAvZVLY9Et279z190420\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"58028876686a4a768a3b919a5e96fdc9\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190420/1555713853720009010.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190420/1555713871421008095.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"黑客,入侵,硬核攻击,阿桑奇\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1555714239941,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1555714239941,\"seqStrId\":\"1555714239941\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"黑客到底有多厉害 解密你所不知道的“黑客江湖”\",\"title\":\"黑客到底有多厉害 解密你所不知道的“黑客江湖”\",\"vbrief\":\"“黑客”常被指作电脑侵入者，经过影视剧的加工渲染，他们增加了一丝神秘和恐怖的色彩。黑客的真正面目是什么？世界上有哪些最有名的黑客？他们发动过哪些硬核攻击？电影中玄幻的黑客技术真实存在吗？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":137,\"vid\":\"85dcdc956f024f74ac806012d4813c03\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/04/20/VIDEJSUqbfeAvZVLY9Et279z190420.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEfxIONEtz71Qg6myvTJQp190419\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"a08ca846485747b28545ba0713d79f9b\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190419/1555662914471082054.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190419/1555662917705052573.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"文化遗产,比划,巴黎圣母院,火灾\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1555663114618,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1555663114618,\"seqStrId\":\"1555663114618\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"防患于未“燃”！文化遗产如何“自救”？\",\"title\":\"防患于未“燃”！文化遗产如何“自救”？\",\"vbrief\":\"“你相信巴黎圣母院有一天会消失吗？”据不完全统计，近30年10座人类重要的文化遗产出现损毁，6座皆因火灾。火，是文物古迹的“头号杀手”，据《纽约邮报》曝光，巴黎圣母院在起火前23分钟，曾响起警铃，但安全员没有发现。一失万无，火灾发生前有哪些是我们不应错过的细节，该如何防患于未“燃”？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":120,\"vid\":\"bcafc1b0819943d7acd5a9e17e094589\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/04/19/VIDEfxIONEtz71Qg6myvTJQp190419.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c896ee132e0f4c9cad27690671911b2b\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190413/1555123485734038084.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190413/1555123489793000328.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"明星,经纪人,公关,张丹峰\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1555123661043,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1555123661043,\"seqStrId\":\"1555123661043\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"为什么明星都有经纪人 他们是干啥的\",\"title\":\"为什么明星都有经纪人 他们是干啥的\",\"vbrief\":\"明星经纪人，表面光鲜神秘，离明星最近，生活在光环背后，他们替明星发言，为明星公关，那么明星为什么都需要经纪人？经纪人又是从什么时候出现的？他们和明星们私下关系如何呢？#张丹峰毕滢# #我和我的经纪人#\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":156,\"vid\":\"48f67f852c6d4159a752adf1795de477\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/04/13/VIDEdbefjDSXoNehR9y1YUmP190413.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDER5baq53lmz8wHOErJBqm190322\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"4a576922d77944179473c7f62b2ccdcf\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190322/1553251503311053417.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190322/1553251506591078321.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"辅导作业,家长,孩子,教育,咆哮\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1553252013538,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1553252013538,\"seqStrId\":\"1553252013538\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"风在吼马在叫 辅导作业的家长在咆哮\",\"title\":\"风在吼马在叫 辅导作业的家长在咆哮\",\"vbrief\":\"你，还在为辅导孩子写作业而苦恼吗？你，还在被各种优秀猎奇的作业所困扰吗？你，还在被孩子各种掉链子不靠谱的情况所烦躁吗？辅导作业，被誉为“社会公害”、健康杀手。深陷其中容易导致早衰、脱发、心梗、神经失常、甚至肥胖。那么，作业这个“万恶之源”是怎么来的？孩子一写作业就磨磨唧唧浑浑噩噩鸡飞狗跳的根本原因又是什么？戳视频找答案……\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":205,\"vid\":\"6b767021c9fc442bb9be0a8e316b326b\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/03/22/VIDER5baq53lmz8wHOErJBqm190322.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDECUZdtIq2i4nYBk5MR9ya190321\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"e5419967ae7b43649cfc95eb198acf12\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190321/1553147643093070484.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190321/1553147651220006634.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国杯,里皮,中国足球\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1553147653773,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1553147653773,\"seqStrId\":\"1553147653773\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"国足吹响集结号  “中国杯”到底是个什么杯\",\"title\":\"国足吹响集结号  “中国杯”到底是个什么杯\",\"vbrief\":\"2019中国杯后里皮时代首期国足比赛今晚吹响集结号。那么问题来了，“中国杯”到底是个什么杯？代理主教练卡纳瓦罗能否凭借出色的战绩通过转正考核？新一代国足男团能否强势回归？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":74,\"vid\":\"67d9d1702fc8436480d415c7ad141842\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/03/21/VIDECUZdtIq2i4nYBk5MR9ya190321.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEOS8uL6dTCMCxcW5b1qmq190315\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"e5cec97f87bf4e4a813b3f228c477db5\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190315/1552636965622035681.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190315/1552636973846086971.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"结婚彩礼,婚姻法\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1552637130370,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1552637130370,\"seqStrId\":\"1552637130370\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"子女结婚父母负债，为啥结婚要彩礼？\",\"title\":\"子女结婚父母负债，为啥结婚要彩礼？\",\"vbrief\":\"全国人大代表张青彬在两会上建议把结婚彩礼纳入《婚姻法》，此前中央一号文件也点名批评“天价彩礼”现象。子女结婚父母负债，为啥结婚成结仇？“天价彩礼”看似自愿，实则无奈，背后隐藏的复杂成因有哪些？如果我们不愿意正视这些问题，那这样的畸形现象永远都存在。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":138,\"vid\":\"8e642fc8a88c472893a957d2dbd36242\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/03/15/VIDEOS8uL6dTCMCxcW5b1qmq190315.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18MZvI3a0926\",\"cateName\":\"资讯\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEUmZA2GvQEQXpou33aYbv190309\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"faccfecee3344e839c3af3e1d6342637\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190309/1552091901949097556.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190309/1552092007818064681.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"人民大会堂,部长通道,政策\",\"labelId\":\"18Jj6nUj0926\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1552092013721,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1552092013721,\"seqStrId\":\"1552092013721\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"这条人民大会堂里的红地毯不一般\",\"title\":\"这条人民大会堂里的红地毯不一般\",\"vbrief\":\"在人民大会堂北大厅，有一条从北门通向万人大礼堂的通道，被称为“部长通道”。自2015年它成为官方认可的沟通途径后，这段不足百米的通道成为媒体报道焦点，在这里发布的只言片语，传递出重要的政策信号和风向。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":100,\"vid\":\"7c9099b84e3e4a32b224e387ff66903d\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/2019/03/09/VIDEUmZA2GvQEQXpou33aYbv190309.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEX4sxwzaOquaaNdVCvydu190303\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"97c518bd48cf4393a309d9cf52e8326c\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190303/1551622682022085310.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190303/1551622733084030109.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中超,比划\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1551623103297,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1551623103297,\"seqStrId\":\"1551623103297\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"“降级”或“不降级”，这是一个问题\",\"title\":\"“降级”或“不降级”，这是一个问题\",\"vbrief\":\"中超联赛的保级大战素来惨烈，真正的角逐从第一轮就已经开始，到底谁将最终成为两个掉段的玩家？是传统老牌保级钉子户？还是新新新新新来的菜鸟？戳视频，#比划#给你侃球，我们拭目以待！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":173,\"vid\":\"d689856ad4ac46f7aa42557a573c7d62\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/03/03/VIDEX4sxwzaOquaaNdVCvydu190303.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE5XKtNVdeyFA39RuyRYRI190302\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c848d9dba43b4436b0e25bd6ae0bea99\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190302/1551499467705082403.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190302/1551499470348007999.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中超联赛,佛系,比划\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1551499540645,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1551499540645,\"seqStrId\":\"1551499540645\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"中超联赛激烈角逐 确认过眼神 却是一群佛系踢球的人\",\"title\":\"中超联赛激烈角逐 确认过眼神 却是一群佛系踢球的人\",\"vbrief\":\"众多参赛球队中，始终有那么一支或几支球队，向上看看，没有争冠希望，往下瞅瞅，没有降级担忧，他们又是谁？来来来，新赛季中超佛系球队了解一下？戳视频，#比划#给你侃球→→\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":166,\"vid\":\"00ea98df19cc4f67a8a02d22af401ef2\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":