ame\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1551336177156,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1551336177156,\"seqStrId\":\"1551336177156\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"2019中超前瞻：谁动了我的奖杯\",\"title\":\"2019中超前瞻：谁动了我的奖杯\",\"vbrief\":\"新赛季中超联赛群雄逐鹿，花落谁家！是为国练兵的广州恒大？是佛系备战的上海上港？是不走地面寻常路的鲁能泰山头球队？还是第一个吃进口螃蟹的北京国安？戳视频来猜猜啊～\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":249,\"vid\":\"693a0b9581d94749a35d27146b0430bb\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/02/28/VIDEDyQc0dihfmh1JaZoSlu9190228.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"d257cba9db9c40188b08a2900666f09f\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190224/1550980721941047371.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190224/1550980725391030732.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"奥斯卡,小金人,电影,颁奖礼\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1550981424591,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1550981424591,\"seqStrId\":\"1550981424591\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"“扒一扒”奥斯卡背后的那些事儿\",\"title\":\"“扒一扒”奥斯卡背后的那些事儿\",\"vbrief\":\"传说中的那个小金人，身高34.3厘米，体重7斤8两。你知道吗？“奥斯卡”其实是个乳名，就好比二妞、春生、狗蛋儿，那么这个压过大名风头的乳名从何而来？所谓宝剑配英雄，红粉赠佳人，本届这个“手持宝剑、满身金色腱子肉的男人”花落谁家？\\n\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":138,\"vid\":\"d556ffbf52e84235a7f65e58eacca7e6\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/02/24/VIDEJBbWyAwcBHh4Vnn8R4le190224.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEYM7FekSAREHYDaLViqMM190223\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"e588b2ff5f4d4bc2b4e84dae631cae37\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190223/1550904918143097056.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190223/1550904890149043734.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"奥斯卡,小金人,第91届奥斯卡,冷知识\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1550905419669,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1550905419669,\"seqStrId\":\"1550905419669\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"你可能不知道的，奥斯卡的几个“最”\",\"title\":\"你可能不知道的，奥斯卡的几个“最”\",\"vbrief\":\"第91届奥斯卡即将开始，这么多届奥斯卡办下来，谁获得的掌声最热烈？谁拿到的奖项最多？第一届最佳演员奖差点颁给一只狗狗？今年你心中的“最佳”又是谁？戳视频盘点几个奥斯卡冷知识给你看\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":139,\"vid\":\"ab1963e049fe4160b6d173af0100064f\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/02/23/VIDEYM7FekSAREHYDaLViqMM190223.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"8e974fc0cae54999a716a636dd137f52\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190219/1550568394011080311.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190219/1550568439622071112.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"元宵节,影视剧,邂逅意中人\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1550569558857,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1550569558857,\"seqStrId\":\"1550569558857\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"吃一把古代狗粮！不用抢票去故宫，也能看上元节盛况\",\"title\":\"吃一把古代狗粮！不用抢票去故宫，也能看上元节盛况\",\"vbrief\":\"众里寻它千百度，蓦然回首，那人却在灯火阑珊处。元宵节，又称中国情人节，太平长安市集初遇薛绍、紫萱徐长卿的第一世相遇、梅长苏赏灯想起霓凰，盘点影视剧中男女主角元宵节相遇浪漫情景，转发这条视频，帮你邂逅意中人。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":160,\"vid\":\"5d5bc679cbcf47bd951a35f07c7a1cba\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/02/19/VIDEM5Xqrk1zD6WYdSGSj4dp190219.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDENq5Uz1T5znSDJsCqp5FF190214\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"25e80851c38c46f3a32911b659650fad\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190214/1550140161042004530.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190214/1550140167953000127.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"情人节,单身狗,脱单\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1550140308969,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1550140308969,\"seqStrId\":\"1550140308969\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"情人节，你还在孤单苦嚎吗？\",\"title\":\"情人节，你还在孤单苦嚎吗？\",\"vbrief\":\"小央单身狗俱乐部提醒您：套路千万条，脱单第一条；告白不规范，明年两行泪。今天大家都是怎么过呢，是有鲜花巧克力的簇拥还是哼哧着“搬砖”？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":141,\"vid\":\"8394143b055b4f4d95fedad87d9f327b\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/02/14/VIDENq5Uz1T5znSDJsCqp5FF190214.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEcSbEdeAcnowj9vrFyryd190205\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"26b173fe316a4047861270e740be16a9\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190205/1549328863818016654.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190205/1549328870153032376.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"麻将,春节,家人,亲友,口水战\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1549329800150,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1549329800150,\"seqStrId\":\"1549329800150\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"不盘麻将 还怎么过年\",\"title\":\"不盘麻将 还怎么过年\",\"vbrief\":\"春节有多适合打麻将？当隔壁的李阿姨问起年终奖，你还来不及想到应对之策，上家张叔叔就会立刻发起攻击：“诶诶诶！打牌就打牌，说这些干什么！赶紧出牌！”一场亲友间的口水战，就将对象之事、生娃之事、脱发之事大化小、小化了。是不是很玄妙？点开下方的视频—>让你春节回家不尴尬。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":173,\"vid\":\"34fb6fcdbf684a3596341c5e1d0f060a\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/02/05/VIDEcSbEdeAcnowj9vrFyryd190205.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE0DJFtHQj86lbORSM0EA0190204\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"0a1fbbfda13e4ff5b49754a3eb6eeaa5\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190204/1549247019472058057.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190204/1549247025650069105.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"春节,年夜饭,中华美食,歪果仁\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1549247787182,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1549247787182,\"seqStrId\":\"1549247787182\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"从“打卤馕”到“小笼包” 中国美食怎么馋疯歪果仁的\",\"title\":\"从“打卤馕”到“小笼包” 中国美食怎么馋疯歪果仁的\",\"vbrief\":\"年夜饭永远是春节的压轴大戏，无论此刻你在国内还是海外，一桌丰盛的年夜饭，是家的味道，更是幸福的味道。你可知道，中国美食受到了歪果仁怎样的追捧？戳视频看看，评论留言，晒一晒今晚你家的饭桌上都啥好吃的呢？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":158,\"vid\":\"a6be1ab275ce4b4c826cd158bcc3c937\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/02/04/VIDE0DJFtHQj86lbORSM0EA0190204.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"481b9f2112bf425ea8e7bf73de0dc748\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190202/1549070729412018118.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190202/1549070741794043413.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"网络热词,C位出道,小猪佩奇\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1549070897319,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1549070897319,\"seqStrId\":\"1549070897319\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"“居居”年将至！狗年盘过的那些小词儿你还记得吗？\",\"title\":\"“居居”年将至！狗年盘过的那些小词儿你还记得吗？\",\"vbrief\":\"进入春节倒计时！不懂这些网络热词，你还怎么稳坐社交圈？确认过眼神，遇到对的词。老妹们咱先一起来顺顺已有知识呗，狗年的流行语你可都还记得？“求生欲”、“C位出道”、“真香定律”、“小猪佩奇”、“转发锦鲤”……来来来，让我们一起回忆下！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":229,\"vid\":\"5ce0b4b78a0149d99d0c8f8092e2d178\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/02/02/VIDEP3j2JZJrR5OB3ps0jI4J190202.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEaoQGpmfPQTXn4Ppod8gH190201\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"50637780470a4f10bb25d0f1bb66eff5\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190201/1548990730303046849.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190201/1548990741089063189.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"里皮,中国队,亚洲杯\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1548990860303,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1548990860303,\"seqStrId\":\"1548990860303\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"告别国足！里大爷不再是你大爷\",\"title\":\"告别国足！里大爷不再是你大爷\",\"vbrief\":\"随着中国队本届亚洲杯止步八强，