words\":\"亚洲杯,国足,伊朗队\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1548302182800,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1548302182800,\"seqStrId\":\"1548302182800\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"今晚挑战波斯铁骑！看国足能否书写亚洲杯童话\",\"title\":\"今晚挑战波斯铁骑！看国足能否书写亚洲杯童话\",\"vbrief\":\"此役国足迎战亚洲区世界排名最高的伊朗队，面对看似不可战胜的对手，国足完全可以放下包袱，本着输了不亏、赢了血赚的心理放手一搏，哪怕头破血流，战斗过便问心无愧。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":91,\"vid\":\"326d493306ce4c059415ead9ee16b817\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/01/24/VIDEtNOdr0uEHUedwbtCyqkb190124.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEJ4JeGlom4uYhsYcG4Dam190120\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"706cc259ea554bc2b56ad9a672805a52\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190120/1547954380034072551.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190120/1547954385249089840.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"亚洲杯,足球,国足\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1547954493438,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1547954493438,\"seqStrId\":\"1547954493438\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"泰国队说他们能赢，是认真的吗？\",\"title\":\"泰国队说他们能赢，是认真的吗？\",\"vbrief\":\"小组赛末轮没能盘动韩国欧巴的中国队，今晚将在八分之一决赛中与泰国队pk，一场洗刷曾经的耻辱与尴尬之战即将打响，戳视频，两队狭路相逢，你认为国足的胜算有多大？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":85,\"vid\":\"327a56eb40d54e4897b332dc84574d94\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/01/20/VIDEJ4JeGlom4uYhsYcG4Dam190120.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE0MgI5YZeJS6zGSKlKxqz190116\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"07bbc1a300864bc1a87bd21f2e1b0bd7\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190116/1547601533016090394.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190116/1547601535561041612.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"亚洲杯,国足,韩国队,争夺战\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1547601579601,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1547601579601,\"seqStrId\":\"1547601579601\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"东方龙对阵太极虎，国足恐韩？不存在的！\",\"title\":\"东方龙对阵太极虎，国足恐韩？不存在的！\",\"vbrief\":\"2019亚洲杯C组末轮，中国队将与老朋友韩国队来一场激烈的争夺战。面对韩国队的恐怖输出孙兴慜，如何限制他的发挥，将成为本场比赛的关键！小组第一，就在今晚！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":85,\"vid\":\"6ac9a91c20cc4854baa3f18fea322cec\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/01/16/VIDE0MgI5YZeJS6zGSKlKxqz190116.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDECGkfRCcnDXNq4pIFCGCc190111\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"96fba7a875834be29fdb913d8bb1f6e6\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190111/1547171074803086645.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190111/1547171083019096543.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"亚洲杯,国足,经典故事\",\"labelId\":\"4a1f6b117c154656963f2c058d5089a8,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1547171096045,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1547171096045,\"seqStrId\":\"1547171096045\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"球盲天问：国足有没有过特别辉煌的时刻？\",\"title\":\"球盲天问：国足有没有过特别辉煌的时刻？\",\"vbrief\":\"恭喜国足2-1逆转亚洲杯新军，迎来新年开门红！你可能不知道，距1976年中国队首次参赛到现在，已经过去了43年！这43年来，赛场上的中国队又产生了多少经典故事呢？戳视频，原来，我们曾经离称霸亚洲只差了那么一丢丢啊！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":158,\"vid\":\"feaa77c6e9a7458299f390f51a790827\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/01/11/VIDECGkfRCcnDXNq4pIFCGCc190111.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEsZYzClEEnZ2HddcqtEB9190106\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"5ffc6b5ed076490c87aba6be0c4a9bf2\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190106/1546744438882013568.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190106/1546744444190051361.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国足球,亚洲杯,韩国队\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1546744496052,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1546744496052,\"seqStrId\":\"1546744496052\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"国足出线形势了解下？留给我们的时间到底有多少？\",\"title\":\"国足出线形势了解下？留给我们的时间到底有多少？\",\"vbrief\":\"本月亚洲杯国足除了对战“新人”吉尔吉斯斯坦和菲律宾，将再遇“老冤家”韩国队。18年前“亚洲头球天团”宿茂臻、范志毅、杨晨等人力压韩国以小组第一的成绩晋级淘汰赛，18年后，手持“上上签”的国足和韩国队之间会擦出怎样的火花？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":84,\"vid\":\"29cb22b9de1644bf8f84abf0aaea3afc\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/01/06/VIDEsZYzClEEnZ2HddcqtEB9190106.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEl4BoyjCA3biArFBnw3Bm190104\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"7c4cfe6d90014df797cee2a784238ff6\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190104/1546564622857086304.png\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20190104/1546564625741033735.png\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"亚洲杯,国足,高科技,助理裁判\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1546564747473,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1546564747473,\"seqStrId\":\"1546564747473\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"2019开年大赛，国足出征，最值钱的一届亚洲杯来了！\",\"title\":\"2019开年大赛，国足出征，最值钱的一届亚洲杯来了！\",\"vbrief\":\"裁判背锅？NONONO！本届亚洲杯不存在的！第17届阿联酋亚洲杯足球赛开赛在即，高科技视频助理裁判（VAR）首次亮相，再有“4换人”规则的加持，给你带来最真实的赛况！此外，作为亚洲地区内最有排面的国家级赛事，告别“小钱钱”奖金，让你数到手抽筋！这样的亚洲杯你了解了多少？戳完视频，你就是这条gai上最懂球的仔！\\n\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":86,\"vid\":\"d80e396950514a6e982d92adb218126c\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2019/01/04/VIDEl4BoyjCA3biArFBnw3Bm190104.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE3ASvPaMEUei0ikQuTcxy181230\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"abd3b925fce8466eb22287b8a4859dd8\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181230/1546162494956027483.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181230/1546162504705002982.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"春运,黄牛党,火车票\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1546162514678,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1546162514678,\"seqStrId\":\"1546162514678\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"你这个黄牛贩子坏得很 春运抢票大战开启！\",\"title\":\"你这个黄牛贩子坏得很 春运抢票大战开启！\",\"vbrief\":\"春运抢票大战已经开启，你准备好了吗？黄牛党是如何抢到大量火车票的？？你会选择加价向黄牛党买票吗？嗯哼，一心想着钻法律空子发横财的，还请仔细阅读《中华人民共和国刑法》吧！今年，12306春运上线“候补购票”，大招来了，黄牛党会凉凉吗？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":138,\"vid\":\"113b6a9288f44905a494998d74f29376\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/12/30/VIDE3ASvPaMEUei0ikQuTcxy181230.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEvS8f9ziJ4zw8wWUwgmot181215\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"62675d678e454258ac035db565835258\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181215/1544849760659080154.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181215/1544849785890093527.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"改革开放四十年,超市,供销社\",\"labelId\":\"4a1f6b117c154656963f2c058d5089a8,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1544850250284,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1544850250284,\"seqStrId\":\"1544850250284\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"从供销社到无人超市  四十年“剁手”回忆录\",\"title\":\"从供销社到无人超市  四十年“剁手”回忆录\",\"vbrief\":\"土豪们锦鲤们凡人们，糖票布票油票，供销社、国营商场、小卖部，这些购物体验你曾有过吗？人脸识别、移动支付、VR购物，未来购物会变成啥样？从定额配给到琳琅满目，从货郎挑担到零售集团，从排队抢购到送货上门…人间很值得，但商场、小卖部、超市让人间更值得。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":164,\"vid\":\"9526d996b2c34e50b7f5391bff8838c3\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/12/15/VIDEvS8f9ziJ4zw8wWUwgmot181215.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDE63OJzkspJmMGLCdUSHuo181214\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"804da8ba074f4baebfe98746b9f3992a\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181214/1544750585339031687.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181214/1544750591240045526.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"改革开放,电视广告,广告明星\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1544750599284,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1544750599284,\"seqStrId\":\"1544750599284\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"那些年洗脑的广告，真香\",\"title\":\"那些年洗脑的广告，真香\",\"vbrief\":\"土豪们锦鲤们凡人们，知道改革开放后中国第一支电视广告是哪年播出的吗？记得第一位“吃螃蟹”代言广告的明星是谁吗？你能想起哪些洗脑的广告神曲？广告，不仅是那些年我们买买买的“人间指南”，还让小盆友们知道了要“给妈妈洗脚”、“心有多宽、舞台就有多大”等等人生（大）道理。从“洗脑”到“走心”，广告记录了经济的发展，见证了时代的进步。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":163,\"vid\":\"8cafaf8d422b427992f6631edeb54ec3\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/12/14/VIDE63OJzkspJmMGLCdUSHuo181214.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEgJEBOTAiB68pkVOrcnXB181207\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"4c9cf464f0e0431697d993684fafd6bd\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181207/1544181238304068950.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181207/1544181241927005801.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"沙县小吃,中国美食,国民街餐\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1544181299766,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1544181299766,\"seqStrId\":\"1544181299766\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"你以为你吃的是沙县小吃吗？不，你咀嚼的是中华文化\",\"title\":\"你以为你吃的是沙县小吃吗？不，你咀嚼的是中华文化\",\"vbrief\":\"土豪们锦鲤们凡人们，今天#比划#带你品尝国民“街餐”沙县小吃，90年代它和洋快餐麦当劳一起出现在特区街头，经过近三十年的奋斗，从“矮穷矬”向“高富帅”狂奔，以魔幻惊人的速度复制壮大，随着中国经济地位的飞跃、世界影响力的提升，它和老干妈、全聚德、海底捞、兰州拉面、煎饼果子、灌汤包等一众中国美食，冲出亚洲，走向世界。#加入1978# 快上车。#改革开放40年#还记得第一个爆款广告吗？ #比划#下期带你看，每周三、周五更新，敬请期待！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":120,\"vid\":\"7b98d7abfc7345f7a3f2b4586aed3a2a\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/12/07/VIDEgJEBOTAiB68pkVOrcnXB181207.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEawHK2UF0Oafx68x6q4z1181206\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"81d46bdefe84495f8609bfd3b91ee050\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181206/1544062476820079912.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181206/1544062483335084190.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"改革开放40年,沟通进化史\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1544062507059,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1544062507059,\"seqStrId\":\"1544062507059\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"唠嗑进化史：从“飞鸽传书”到“正在输入”\",\"title\":\"唠嗑进化史：从“飞鸽传书”到“正在输入”\",\"vbrief\":\"土豪们锦鲤们凡人们，还记得那个通讯基本靠吼，写信聊天交笔友的年代吗？还记得家里的第一部电话是什么模样吗？今天《比划》带你回顾四十年中国人沟通进化史，不管是划算的小灵通、摔不坏的诺基亚，还是港剧里的装X神器BP机大哥大，总有一款“唠嗑”神器能勾起你的陈年记忆，#加入1978# 快上车。#改革开放40年# 《比划》下期带你品尝开遍全世界的神秘小吃，每周三、周五更新，敬请期待！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":186,\"vid\":\"388e9234d2c14b28a2e8509de419c90a\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/12/06/VIDEawHK2UF0Oafx68x6q4z1181206.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEBZki5TuceKtyRS97sO48181130\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"178bb39e027e46c89a47631f37bf1a88\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181130/1543556559411092007.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181130/1543556563390046458.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"挂历,贴画,比划,改革开放40年\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1543556638410,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1543556638410,\"seqStrId\":\"1543556638410\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"挂历书皮大美人儿，贴画追星的日子你还记得吗？\",\"title\":\"挂历书皮大美人儿，贴画追星的日子你还记得吗？\",\"vbrief\":\"土豪们锦鲤们凡人们，今天#比划#带你走进挂历的“视”界，上世纪90年代，没有智能手机的提醒，人们全凭墙上的一纸挂历计算着年月。还记得当年墙上挂着的“大美人儿”吗？明眸皓齿、衣着前卫，是女孩偷偷模仿的对象、男孩最美好的想象，多看一眼，耳根就泛起了红光。它们用途广泛，可以是逢年过节的必备“年货”，也可以成为你下一本课本的封皮，更是你童年最朴实真挚的追星记忆，#加入1978# 快上车。#改革开放40年# #比划#下期为你讲述“唠嗑”进化史，每周三、周五更新，敬请期待！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":157,\"vid\":\"b469bf46de784c7eafb80fe7904d30a5\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/11/30/VIDEBZki5TuceKtyRS97sO48181130.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEfKY1cSPcbpKYMrHoTA2K181128\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"ede3f3b005ba48fa8a7f0ff315201222\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181128/1543368023128086400.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181128/1543368027881068228.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"卡拉OK,改革开放40年,K歌狂欢,比划\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1543368125837,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1543368125837,\"seqStrId\":\"1543368125837\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"谁也抢不走你的麦克风 因为卡拉永远OK\",\"title\":\"谁也抢不走你的麦克风 因为卡拉永远OK\",\"vbrief\":\"土豪们锦鲤们凡人们，今天#比划#带你K歌狂欢，80年代卡拉OK传入中国，迅速发扬光大，老年人聚扎在公园里飙歌，年轻人聚会去KTV唱歌，小孩子看到迷你KTV就兴奋。最近#KTV下架六千多首歌曲#的新闻，让大家再次关心起这个“老地方”。去KTV唱一把，把心中的喜悦、愤怒、焦虑、忧伤通通发泄！#加入1978# 快上车。#改革开放40年# #比划#下期带你走进挂历的世界，周三、周五更新，敬请期待！\\n\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":194,\"vid\":\"06ee7f390d48441f96c98603aa11b3dd\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/11/28/VIDEfKY1cSPcbpKYMrHoTA2K181128.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEMYaVJodPSxYHRZDeudXo181123\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"c95889fcfd0d45e0ab89c54f86d32846\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181123/1542936203179095967.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181123/1542936211544025091.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"泡面,童年味蕾,加班必备\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1542936261119,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1542936261119,\"seqStrId\":\"1542936261119\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"为了不将就的人生 你知道60岁的泡面有多努力吗\",\"title\":\"为了不将就的人生 你知道60岁的泡面有多努力吗\",\"vbrief\":\"土豪们锦鲤们凡人们，今天《比划》带你了解泡面君传奇的一生，“香喷喷，好吃看得见”，这句康师傅的广告词能否唤醒你的童年味蕾？童年故事、创业伴侣、加班必备、出行神器……没有哪一种食品能像泡面这样，承载如此多的个人情感和集体记忆。作为新晋“网红”，它还成为具有东方魅力的美食名片，随着“一带一路”的延伸，收获了大批外籍粉丝。#加入1978# 快上车。改革开放40年《比划》下期陪你K歌狂欢，每周三、周五更新，敬请期待！ \",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":153,\"vid\":\"b80cc9897460412bb5eb3d4e1135095e\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/11/23/VIDEMYaVJodPSxYHRZDeudXo181123.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEOHp02WZeXWOKCUvQsMSF181121\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"b0219c87d00f4f228f5a19fe92c62b2b\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181121/1542772638000013994.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181121/1542772644840048411.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"改革开放40年,时尚爆款,加入1978\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1542772707651,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1542772707651,\"seqStrId\":\"1542772707651\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"从姥姥的衣柜到妈妈的化妆台 美丽是如何进化的\",\"title\":\"从姥姥的衣柜到妈妈的化妆台 美丽是如何进化的\",\"vbrief\":\"土豪们锦鲤们凡人们，今天#比划#为你pick各个年代的时尚单品，是《金婚》里文丽念念不忘的布拉吉，还是用高压锅烫出的时髦发型？是邋遢大王都在穿的喇叭裤，还是张曼玉那身华美的旗袍？从“灰蓝黑”到“红裙子”，从女排热裤到老干妈卫衣，看一看40年时尚爆款是如何进化的，#加入1978# 快上车。#改革开放40年# #比划#下期带你领略便民食品方便面的魅力，每周三、周五更新，敬请期待！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":188,\"vid\":\"a97059febf1a473eaaa82e27060eab0c\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/11/21/VIDEOHp02WZeXWOKCUvQsMSF181121.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEY6lUpgPFvWLnMHYIICQQ181119\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"0934402a623c49b095b1352f4f04757d\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181119/1542618672256057973.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181119/1542618683735032467.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"女司机,公交坠江,真相,全民声讨\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1542618741261,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1542618741261,\"seqStrId\":\"1542618741261\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"为啥每次出事儿女司机都成“活靶子”？\",\"title\":\"为啥每次出事儿女司机都成“活靶子”？\",\"vbrief\":\"“这个女司机一定要判死刑！让她一个人死就好了！干嘛连累那么多人！”公交坠江事件反转，女司机没逆行！一次次的全民声讨，今天我们来为女司机群体正名，真相只有一个，戳视频，耐心观看！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":135,\"vid\":\"0bfd0fd2ddf74a29aed3ddec8806761c\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/11/19/VIDEY6lUpgPFvWLnMHYIICQQ181119.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEVbKERyPlkyBOi22scoQ4181116\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"0e743f70ab3e421c879fe3a0dcb210e2\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181116/1542371301782013656.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181116/1542371292290050199.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"改革开放,比划,中国1978\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1542364688460,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1542364688460,\"seqStrId\":\"1542364688460\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"1978年究竟发生了些啥 这段超真实MV影像告诉你\",\"title\":\"1978年究竟发生了些啥 这段超真实MV影像告诉你\",\"vbrief\":\"1978年，中国改革开放元年，这一年，十一届三中全会召开、邓小平访问日本、可口可乐进入中国……《比划》栏目查阅历史资料，在纪录片《中国1978》中发现了一段超现实混剪MV，影像高清、素材丰富、让你过目难忘。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":157,\"vid\":\"d7b2c3340e42425ead29d0b835046fc0\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/11/16/VIDEVbKERyPlkyBOi22scoQ4181116.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEv9YRRJCmZJFSBAIJHSzQ181114\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"18b5eb25e3c942d9983871f0f3db4a65\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181114/1542191579625041442.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181114/1542191586836073533.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"皮卡丘,比划,翻毛皮\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1542191596674,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1542191596674,\"seqStrId\":\"1542191596674\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"动画片里“滑溜溜”的皮卡丘，实际却是翻毛的？\",\"title\":\"动画片里“滑溜溜”的皮卡丘，实际却是翻毛的？\",\"vbrief\":\"“精灵宝可梦”《大侦探皮卡丘》发布了首个预告，那个大叔音的皮卡丘让不少小伙伴“开口跪”吧？继机器猫是软的还是硬的之后，动漫界再次迎来新的世纪拷问，毛党：“原著里，皮卡丘就一直有毛！”皮党反驳：“可人家姓‘皮’呀？！”你选择“滑溜溜”还是“翻毛皮”呢？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":72,\"vid\":\"002388c71907497a87b362fd4b70d954\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/11/14/VIDEv9YRRJCmZJFSBAIJHSzQ181114.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEW82OhyIlIYgIOYK7P6X8181107\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"08e017d8329e4e67855bbe9f0a7488b5\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181107/1541562069196031652.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181107/1541562075586081916.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"特朗普,赴美生子\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1541562077957,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1541562077957,\"seqStrId\":\"1541562077957\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"特朗普寻求废除“出生公民权” 赴美生子要“凉凉”？\",\"title\":\"特朗普寻求废除“出生公民权” 赴美生子要“凉凉”？\",\"vbrief\":\"出生在美国就是美国人？以前是，但以后就不一定是了。特朗普所说的“出生公民权”到底是个啥？别说没钱没孩子这事跟你没关系，戳视频，总有些你不知道的。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":105,\"vid\":\"85e5df838ada4139b9545f4444bebcf7\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/11/07/VIDEW82OhyIlIYgIOYK7P6X8181107.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"