,锦鲤\",\"labelId\":\"4a1f6b117c154656963f2c058d5089a8,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1540004381647,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1540004381647,\"seqStrId\":\"1540004381647\",\"size\":\"4:3\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"全世界都在转发锦鲤 一条鱼是如何成为吉祥物的\",\"title\":\"全世界都在转发锦鲤 一条鱼是如何成为吉祥物的\",\"vbrief\":\"2018年玄学最火的一个词，当属“锦鲤”！它既可以是一条鱼，也可以是杨超越、魏璎珞，或者最近的“信小呆”。从饮食界到图腾界，从盘中的美味到人见人转的吉祥物，这条鱼究竟经历了什么？\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":131,\"vid\":\"f7b9ce0b397141799836c358e26fb8a1\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/10/20/VIDEeKwn4s4PDNqPb7BInKIZ181020.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEhT33a9p4zDay3kOQ60ld181001\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"399a7a38ed51d40ec7561d06a4429fc5\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181001/1538372421365015669.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181001/1538372444229062274.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"人民币,历史,比划,印刷品\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1538372448035,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1538372448035,\"seqStrId\":\"1538372448035\",\"size\":\"9:16\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"假期来看“小钱钱” 一起品味人民币成长史\",\"title\":\"假期来看“小钱钱” 一起品味人民币成长史\",\"vbrief\":\"五毛钱上大学、两万元买只鸡、八万元买套房，我国的货币有着什么样的历史和故事？用着“土豪金”的你见过五版全套人民币吗？哪套人民币是你的“童年回忆”？关于全国人民最喜爱的物品和最受欢迎的印刷品，《比划》栏目带你了解它。\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":139,\"vid\":\"7e8eb6c4edd342ef819a4bf7cee2da66\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/10/01/VIDEhT33a9p4zDay3kOQ60ld181001.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEq7q5g9YuoEE9kHrkLQI3180822\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"aa72a7d785ebe7e6414fefe578d4a70b\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181018/1539833678965001289.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20180927/1538011785360087637.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"北极熊,比划,高温天气,立秋\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1538011819934,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqId\":1538011819934,\"seqStrId\":\"1538011819934\",\"size\":\"16:9\",\"source\":0,\"subTitle\":\"被讨论一整个夏天的北极熊：哥不是热，哥只是饿！\",\"title\":\"被讨论一整个夏天的北极熊：哥不是热，哥只是饿！\",\"vbrief\":\"　　央视网消息：虽然已经立秋，但高温天气仍在持续。暑假是不是被“北极圈32℃高温”刷屏了？各位明年去北极旅游的钱已经攒好了么？关于北极熊遭遇大难的新闻每年都要上榜好几次，是时候关心下它们最惧怕的是什么了！\",\"vcount\":0,\"vduration\":91,\"vid\":\"eb9e7112e9124d67955ccef94d048537\",\"videoType\":0,\"vip_flag\":0,\"webUrl\":\"https://v.cctv.com/reping/bh/index.shtml\",\"wwwUrl\":\"http://news.cctv.com/2018/08/22/VIDEq7q5g9YuoEE9kHrkLQI3180822.shtml\"},{\"allowAd\":0,\"allowComment\":0,\"allowShare\":0,\"cateId\":\"18AzYZNf0926\",\"cateName\":\"热评\",\"cvid\":\"VIDEMSYpIQMYxcpDnRQjNkuy180828\",\"episodes\":0,\"feedType\":\"3\",\"guid\":\"fde4911e355f5d522f246f43295fcfdb\",\"image1\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20181018/1539833689684068481.jpg\",\"image2\":\"https://p2.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20180927/1538011688579017688.jpg\",\"isCourse\":0,\"isSubed\":0,\"keywords\":\"中国足球,U23,亚运会\",\"labelId\":\"18aiYZ3m0926,\",\"likeCount\":0,\"mediaId\":\"18ryeuIb0926\",\"mediaImg\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260828/1787896006290088494.jpg\",\"mediaName\":\"比划\",\"pubTime\":1538011730688,\"pv\":\"\",\"seqI